translate chinese start_bf99d00c:

    # g "And don’t get me started on the heating. It’s so sketchy..."
    g "暖气就更别提了。太不靠谱了……"

# game/script.rpy:5813
translate chinese start_4b2233ac:

    # j "Yeah, yeah. All of that."
    j "对，对，都是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:5814
translate chinese start_9f376ea4:

    # j "And you still managed to make something this good."
    j "而你还是做出了这么好吃的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:5815
translate chinese start_3bfed1f0:

    # j "What do you say, Anna?"
    j "你说呢，Anna？"

# game/script.rpy:5821
translate chinese start_256a8a63:

    # a "It’s tasty. It reminds me of home."
    a "很好吃。让我想起家。"

# game/script.rpy:5829
translate chinese start_28a3cde0:

    # a "Have you tried remembering what home was like, Jack?"
    a "Jack，你有没有试着回想家是什么样子？"

# game/script.rpy:5834
translate chinese start_d77d58cb:

    # "I swallowed, choked, and coughed."
    "我咽了一下，呛住，咳了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:5836
translate chinese start_a53437ec:

    # j "What—what’s with that, all of a sudden?"
    j "怎、怎么突然问这个？"

# game/script.rpy:5844
translate chinese start_284753b5:

    # "Anna smiled and went on eating."
    "Anna 笑了笑，继续吃。"

# game/script.rpy:5850
translate chinese start_358bbcb8:

    # a "I was just wondering."
    a "我只是有点好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:5855
translate chinese start_1ef09466:

    # j "No, I have not tried to remember {i}what home was like.{/i}"
    j "没有，我没试过回想{i}家是什么样子{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:5856
translate chinese start_2a06d60c:

    # j "I don’t see why I’d have to."
    j "我不明白我为什么非要想起来。"

# game/script.rpy:5857
translate chinese start_c53c3e2c:

    # j "I’m fine without it."
    j "想不起来也没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:5862
translate chinese start_73e3c6db:

    # a "All right."
    a "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5869
translate chinese start_f0a50b11:

    # a "It’s a shame, though."
    a "不过真是可惜。"

# game/script.rpy:5871
translate chinese start_7f7a0312:

    # j "Tough."
    j "那可真不容易。"

# game/script.rpy:5878
translate chinese start_9e9d0886:

    # g "Um, Jack...?"
    g "呃，Jack……？"

# game/script.rpy:5883
translate chinese start_34a6073b_1:

    # j "Yeah?"
    j "怎么？"

# game/script.rpy:5884
translate chinese start_f428ce46:

    # j "What is it, Grace?"
    j "怎么了，Grace？"

# game/script.rpy:5890
translate chinese start_6e461818:

    # g "I’m with Anna on this one."
    g "这次我站在 Anna 这边。"

# game/script.rpy:5892
translate chinese start_78f14297:

    # j "...You are?"
    j "……你确定？"

# game/script.rpy:5898
translate chinese start_a19a272e_1:

    # g "Yes."
    g "确定。"

# game/script.rpy:5900
translate chinese start_185a21a6:

    # j "Even after you said you were fine with {i}me{/i} deciding what goes on in {i}my{/i} head?"
    j "哪怕你之前说过，{i}我{/i}脑子里的事由{i}我{/i}自己决定也没关系？"

# game/script.rpy:5906
translate chinese start_45b9f216:

    # g "I... I’m trying to think of what’s best for you."
    g "我……我是在替你着想。"

# game/script.rpy:5915
translate chinese start_ce95a095:

    # a "That's right. You can’t spend your life running away from the past."
    a "说得对。你不能一辈子都在逃避过去。"

# game/script.rpy:5921
translate chinese start_c7f65da4:

    # a "Face it now. Be a man."
    a "现在就面对它。拿出点男人的样子来。"

# game/script.rpy:5927
translate chinese start_bc1d5bbf:

    # g "It’s not healthy to lock so much of yourself away. It can’t be."
    g "把自己关起来这么多，这不健康。肯定不健康。"

# game/script.rpy:5932
translate chinese start_b3a5238b:

    # g "You {i}have{/i} to agree, Jack."
    g "Jack，你{i}必须{/i}答应。"

# game/script.rpy:5934
translate chinese start_355a055c:

    # "I didn’t reply. I was eviscerating a chicken drumstick."
    "我没回答。我正把一只鸡腿拆得七零八落。"

# game/script.rpy:5941
translate chinese start_e2785f3b:

    # g "Anna, um..."
    g "Anna，呃……"

# game/script.rpy:5946
translate chinese start_359dde54:

    # g "I didn’t tell you this, but at night, at least once a week, Jack—"
    g "我没跟你说过，可是夜里，每周至少一次，Jack——"

# game/script.rpy:5956
translate chinese start_95af1364:

    # j "{i}That’s enough!{/i}" with vpunch
    j "{i}够了！{/i}" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:5958
translate chinese start_673395b9:

    # "I banged my fist on the table, then was immediately ashamed that I’d lost my temper."
    "我一拳砸在桌上，随即又为自己失了态而羞愧。"

# game/script.rpy:5959
translate chinese start_b96ef9b3:

    # "But I couldn’t back down."
    "但我不能退让。"

# game/script.rpy:5961
translate chinese start_099a0fed:

    # j "This has got to do with {i}me,{/i} and {i}me{/i} only."
    j "这件事只跟{i}我{/i}有关，只跟{i}我{/i}一个人有关。"

# game/script.rpy:5962
translate chinese start_bb8dc7cc:

    # j "Stay the hell out of it. Both of you."
    j "你们两个都别掺和。"

# game/script.rpy:5963
translate chinese start_9ad4289a:

    # j "Do you {i}understand?{/i}"
    j "你{i}听明白了吗？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:5969
translate chinese start_717c03f3:

    # a "Hmph."
    a "哼。"

# game/script.rpy:5976
translate chinese start_6c231df7:

    # g "Wh-Why are you so...?"
    g "你、你为什么这么……？"

# game/script.rpy:5978
translate chinese start_8046b8bc:

    # j "Ah, it’s no good."
    j "不，这样不好。"

# game/script.rpy:5980
translate chinese start_090fd1a4:

    # "I’d never gotten this angry before."
    "我从没这么生气过。"

# game/script.rpy:5981
translate chinese start_f02238db:

    # "I needed to be alone."
    "我需要一个人待着。"

# game/script.rpy:5989
translate chinese start_c5d6ef7f:

    # "I walked off to another room, but that didn’t help."
    "我走到另一个房间，可那也没用。"

# game/script.rpy:5990
translate chinese start_6ba1c569:

    # "I could still hear their murmurs and their whispering."
    "我还是能听见她们的低语和窃窃私语。"

# game/script.rpy:5991
translate chinese start_b63b6237:

    # "They were talking about me."
    "她们在说我。"

# game/script.rpy:5992
translate chinese start_4730749c:

    # "I dressed in a hurry."
    "我匆匆穿上衣服。"

# game/script.rpy:6019
translate chinese start_0297fa45_2:

    # g "Huh?"
    g "咦？"

# game/script.rpy:6024
translate chinese start_807f4a7c:

    # g "What are you... Are you going out, Jack?"
    g "你这是……Jack，你要出门吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6026
translate chinese start_35bf5a71:

    # "I nodded."
    "我点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:6032
translate chinese start_58b0de78:

    # a "Have fun."
    a "玩得开心。"

# game/script.rpy:6043
translate chinese start_11d4fea9:

    # g "Wait! Don’t go."
    g "等等！别走。"

# game/script.rpy:6048
translate chinese start_97ad0289:

    # g "I-I’m sorry I keep insisting so much. You know I’m trying to help, right?"
    g "对、对不起，我一直这样硬劝你。你知道我是想帮你，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:6050
translate chinese start_984f6b91_3:

    # j "...Yeah."
    j "……嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:6056
translate chinese start_376bc4f3:

    # g "Then please don’t be mad."
    g "请不要生气。"

# game/script.rpy:6060
translate chinese start_abd71982:

    # "I couldn't stop being angry."
    "我没办法不生气。"

# game/script.rpy:6061
translate chinese start_3d11c36e:

    # "It was stronger than me."
    "那股怒气比我更强。"

# game/script.rpy:6068
translate chinese start_454322e8:

    # g "Um, can you do just one thing for me? Just so I know I did all I could?"
    g "那个，你能为我做一件事吗？就一件，好让我知道自己尽力了。"

# game/script.rpy:6070
translate chinese start_7712d2da:

    # j "Do what?"
    j "做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:6076
translate chinese start_6d050dce:

    # g "Can you... say you’re fine with..."
    g "你能不能……说你愿意接受……"

# game/script.rpy:6083
translate chinese start_3f828d45:

    # g "No, please say that you {i}don’t want to remember.{/i}"
    g "不，请你说你{i}不想记起来{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:6088
translate chinese start_9e3f09a2:

    # g "Can you do that for me?"
    g "你能为我做到吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6090
translate chinese start_5e4ace8e:

    # j "Of course."
    j "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:6096
translate chinese start_f3133f6a:

    # "I hesitated longer than I thought I would."
    "我犹豫的时间比我预想的长。"

# game/script.rpy:6097
translate chinese start_620d1963:

    # "Suddenly it struck me I was being childish as hell."
    "我忽然意识到自己幼稚得要命。"

# game/script.rpy:6098
translate chinese start_e3a615c5:

    # "But in the end my anger and my stubbornness won over."
    "但最后，我的怒火和固执还是占了上风。"

# game/script.rpy:6100
translate chinese start_4726a9d4:

    # j "{i}I don’t want to remember.{/i}"
    j "{i}我不想想起来。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:6101
translate chinese start_cf187e92:

    # j "There. Are you happy now?"
    j "好了。这下你满意了？"

# game/script.rpy:6102
translate chinese start_bf348344:

    # j "I wanted things to stay as they were."
    j "我只想让一切维持原样。"

# game/script.rpy:6103
translate chinese start_5d2dd188:

    # j "That’s all I ever wanted. For nothing to change."
    j "我一直想要的只有这些。什么都不要改变。"

# game/script.rpy:6104
translate chinese start_8904a0b3:

    # j "Because, for once, I was {i}happy.{/i}"
    j "因为，就这一次，我是{i}开心的{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:6109
translate chinese start_30aff13a:

    # g "I..."
    g "我……"

# game/script.rpy:6111
translate chinese start_4f449b04_1:

    # j "Well?"
    j "怎么？"

# game/script.rpy:6116
translate chinese start_73f22375:

    # g "I’m sorry..."
    g "我很抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:6118
translate chinese start_8652b1ae:

    # j "You should be."
    j "你确实该道歉。"

# game/script.rpy:6122
translate chinese start_43a9b878:

    # "I walked out."
    "我走了出去。"

# game/script.rpy:6123
translate chinese start_1cd21e73:

    # "By the time I came back, Grace was gone."
    "等我回来时，Grace 已经走了。"

# game/script.rpy:6137
translate chinese start_13c1acbd:

    # n "August 17"
    n "8月17日"

# game/script.rpy:6138
translate chinese start_0c1df9cc:

    # n "I came back hours later, after a little drinking and a lot of pointless wandering."
    n "我几个小时后才回来，喝了点酒，也毫无目的地晃了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:6139
translate chinese start_1be66844:

    # n "The apartment was empty. Her things were gone. But I only realized that after I read the letter."
    n "公寓空了。她的东西都没了。可我是读完那封信之后才意识到的。"

# game/script.rpy:6141
translate chinese start_28b9c772:

    # nvl clear
    # n "The letter was on the table, next to our half-finished dinner."
    nvl clear
    n "信就放在桌上，旁边是我们没吃完的晚饭。"

# game/script.rpy:6144
translate chinese start_70da948e:

    # n "There was a key next to the letter, too—her key to the apartment."
    n "信旁边还有一把钥匙——她公寓的钥匙。"

# game/script.rpy:6146
translate chinese start_d1ba0523:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I remember the letter word for word, so why don’t I write it down here?"
    nvl clear
    n "那封信我一个字不差地记得，那为什么不写在这里呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6149
translate chinese start_20826105:

    # n "Wouldn’t that be fun?"
    n "那岂不是很开心？"

# game/script.rpy:6151
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_79:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6163
translate chinese start_76f3a60b:

    # n "\"Jack,\" it said, \"I can’t stay with you anymore. You’re only going to make yourself more miserable, and I can’t help you, and I can’t watch you do this to yourself."
    n "“Jack，”信上写着，“我没办法再和你住下去了。你只会让自己更痛苦，而我帮不了你，也没法眼睁睁看着你这样下去。"

# game/script.rpy:6164
translate chinese start_b8362261:

    # n "\"I pray there’s someone who can help you like I couldn’t, and I hope you’ll be happy."
    n "“我祈祷会有个人能帮上你，帮上我帮不了的忙，也希望你能幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:6165
translate chinese start_3eaca981:

    # n "\"Goodbye.\""
    n "“永别了。”"

# game/script.rpy:6167
translate chinese start_7a03525e:

    # nvl clear
    # n "Grace didn’t need to sign the message. I would’ve recognized those neat letters anywhere."
    nvl clear
    n "Grace 不用署名。那种工整的字迹，我在哪儿都认得出来。"

# game/script.rpy:6170
translate chinese start_5ec8b391:

    # n "I’d seen that same handwriting, during our brief year together, on dozens if not hundreds of little notes."
    n "在一起的那短短一年里，同样的字迹我见过几十次，说不定上百次，都写在便条上。"

# game/script.rpy:6171
translate chinese start_8c154d0e:

    # n "Shift schedules, reminders to buy snacks or milk. Things like that."
    n "排班表，提醒我买零食或牛奶。诸如此类。"

# game/script.rpy:6172
translate chinese start_aeeda476:

    # n "There were, in fact, at least half a dozen of the yellow Post-its she used still around the apartment."
    n "事实上，公寓里至少还留着六七张她用过的黄色便利贴。"

# game/script.rpy:6173
translate chinese start_f672af3b:

    # n "Seeing them hurt."
    n "看到它们，很疼。"

# game/script.rpy:6175
translate chinese start_1d40d465:

    # nvl clear
    # n "There were a lot of other things Grace hadn’t taken with her, too."
    nvl clear
    n "Grace 没带走的东西还有很多。"

# game/script.rpy:6178
translate chinese start_2cb05c55:

    # n "Socks. Pants. A few undershirts. A scarf."
    n "袜子。裤子。几件内衣。一条围巾。"

# game/script.rpy:6179
translate chinese start_9d3e4d07:

    # n "One pair of shoes."
    n "一双鞋。"

# game/script.rpy:6180
translate chinese start_af055ae2:

    # n "A sweater she really liked, too."
    n "还有一件她很喜欢的毛衣。"

# game/script.rpy:6181
translate chinese start_f692fe69:

    # n "She would have worn the sweater while napping in the evening."
    n "她傍晚小睡的时候总会穿着那件毛衣。"

# game/script.rpy:6183
translate chinese start_390de88a:

    # nvl clear
    # n "It was all evidence of how much of a hurry she’d been in to get away from me."
    nvl clear
    n "这些全都是证据，证明她逃开我时有多匆忙。"

# game/script.rpy:6186
translate chinese start_419e6b55:

    # n "Now I know better."
    n "现在我明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:6188
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_80:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6214
translate chinese start_974b5dc2:

    # a "Morning, everyone!"
    a "大家早上好！"

# game/script.rpy:6218
translate chinese start_2684a969:

    # "The patients all greet her. I do, too."
    "病人们都跟她打招呼。我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:6226
translate chinese start_bfabc612:

    # a "Well, well."
    a "哎呀呀。"

# game/script.rpy:6234
translate chinese start_46de9be4:

    # a "I’m happy to see you’ve finally stopped being Mr. Grumpy."
    a "很高兴看到你终于不当闷葫芦先生了。"

# game/script.rpy:6236
translate chinese start_42baa714:

    # j "Well, you know."
    j "嗯，好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6241
translate chinese start_6d89a0d6:

    # a "Do you feel better?"
    a "感觉好点了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6246
translate chinese start_d5f4341d:

    # a "Does the leg still hurt?"
    a "腿还疼吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6248
translate chinese start_f39d0a6d:

    # j "I’m a little better, I guess."
    j "我好一点了，大概。"

# game/script.rpy:6249
translate chinese start_d748037d:

    # j "At peace."
    j "很平静。"

# game/script.rpy:6254
translate chinese start_6bedd022:

    # a "That’s great."
    a "那太好了。"

# game/script.rpy:6259
translate chinese start_5c91171d:

    # a "You’ll be up on your feet in no time, I’m sure."
    a "我敢说，你很快就能下地走路了。"

# game/script.rpy:6267
translate chinese start_722d7ebb:

    # a "Free to come back home."
    a "可以自由地回家了。"

# game/script.rpy:6271
translate chinese start_4875b2b4:

    # "I laugh like hell."
    "我笑得停不下来。"

# game/script.rpy:6278
translate chinese start_0c4730f1:

    # "Anna probably doesn’t see what’s so funny. She smiles vacantly."
    "Anna 大概不觉得有什么好笑的。她茫然地笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:6279
translate chinese start_cb441f77:

    # "I guess she does love me, in her own way. It doesn’t matter, though."
    "我想她是爱我的，以她自己的方式。不过那不重要了。"

# game/script.rpy:6280
translate chinese start_46aa76be:

    # "Remembering the pain she caused me has given me conviction."
    "想起她带给我的痛苦，我就更加笃定。"

# game/script.rpy:6281
translate chinese start_06b1f4e4:

    # "My heart is set on killing her."
    "我下定决心要杀了她。"

# game/script.rpy:6293
translate chinese start_9b2a5ac7:

    # n "August 18"
    n "8月18日"

# game/script.rpy:6294
translate chinese start_be1ad2fe:

    # n "My health is vastly improving. Doctor’s words, those."
    n "我的身体好了很多。这是医生说的。"

# game/script.rpy:6295
translate chinese start_8adb8003:

    # n "And I feel it."
    n "我自己也感觉得到。"

# game/script.rpy:6296
translate chinese start_7080473b:

    # n "I don’t wake up at night so much anymore, choking on pain."
    n "我夜里不再那么频繁地被疼醒、噎住了。"

# game/script.rpy:6297
translate chinese start_b8250f52:

    # n "And I don’t get so angry anymore that I have to chew my own fingers so I don’t end up shouting."
    n "我也不再气到必须咬住自己的手指，才能忍住不喊出声。"

# game/script.rpy:6298
translate chinese start_a99ca748:

    # n "I really am at peace."
    n "我真的很平静。"

# game/script.rpy:6300
translate chinese start_d511b1cc:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I know what to do."
    nvl clear
    n "我知道该怎么做。"

# game/script.rpy:6303
translate chinese start_0c3e845f:

    # n "And I know I {i}have{/i} to do it."
    n "而我知道我{i}必须{/i}这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:6305
translate chinese start_4cde8d32:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I feel like I don’t have a choice in the matter."
    nvl clear
    n "在这件事上，我觉得自己别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:6308
translate chinese start_a15459d9:

    # n "I’m a train going down a set of tracks at a few hundred mph, no turns, no breaks."
    n "我是一列以几百英里时速沿轨道冲下去的火车，不转弯，不刹车。"

# game/script.rpy:6309
translate chinese start_6999350d:

    # n "Whatever happens, will happen."
    n "该发生的，总会发生。"

# game/script.rpy:6310
translate chinese start_1c60fda6:

    # n "It’s strangely calming."
    n "这莫名地让我平静。"

# game/script.rpy:6312
translate chinese start_7eb5c75b:

    # nvl clear
    # n "For now, I’ll keep on writing."
    nvl clear
    n "眼下，我会继续写下去。"

# game/script.rpy:6315
translate chinese start_078b9208:

    # n "I know a good point to stop."
    n "我知道该在哪里停下。"

# game/script.rpy:6317
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_81:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6336
translate chinese start_263ef2a1:

    # n "After Grace left, I spent that first night alone on the kitchen floor."
    n "Grace 走后的第一个晚上，我一个人躺在厨房的地板上。"

# game/script.rpy:6337
translate chinese start_c97c0f1f:

    # n "It was where my legs happened to give in under me, after hours of walking back and forth in the apartment."
    n "在公寓里来来回回走了几个钟头之后，我的腿恰好在那儿软了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:6338
translate chinese start_d32f7465:

    # n "I had paced around like a caged animal, looking under pillows and carpets and poking my head in closets—I don’t know why."
    n "我像笼中的野兽一样来回踱步，翻看枕头底下、地毯底下，把头探进衣柜——我也不知道为什么。"

# game/script.rpy:6339
translate chinese start_9adf7465:

    # n "Maybe I thought I’d find her there."
    n "也许我以为自己会在那里找到她。"

# game/script.rpy:6341
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_82:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6354
translate chinese start_8a3ce981:

    # n "I woke up in the afternoon, with a blanket over me."
    n "下午醒来时，我身上盖着一条毯子。"

# game/script.rpy:6355
translate chinese start_5df8eb45:

    # n "I thought that Grace had done it—that she’d come back."
    n "我以为是 Grace 做的——以为她回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:6356
translate chinese start_d28cbafb:

    # n "She hadn’t."
    n "但是她没有。"

# game/script.rpy:6357
translate chinese start_b52d502d:

    # n "I guess it must have been Anna."
    n "我猜那一定是 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:6359
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_83:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6369
translate chinese start_b808a3c6:

    # n "I didn’t go to work. I didn’t eat."
    n "我没去上班。我没吃东西。"

# game/script.rpy:6370
translate chinese start_721a15e9:

    # n "I don’t remember drinking any water, but I must have. And I must have slept a lot, too."
    n "我不记得喝过水，但肯定喝了。也肯定睡了很久。"

# game/script.rpy:6372
translate chinese start_2d6330dd:

    # nvl clear
    # n "It turned out I needed Grace more than I thought I did."
    nvl clear
    n "原来我比自以为的更需要 Grace。"

# game/script.rpy:6375
translate chinese start_71dfc454:

    # n "Certainly more than she needed me."
    n "当然，比她需要我多得多。"

# game/script.rpy:6377
translate chinese start_79763eca:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I was all alone that day, that night, and the day after, too—right up until the evening."
    nvl clear
    n "那一天、那一夜，还有第二天，我都是一个人——一直到傍晚。"

# game/script.rpy:6380
translate chinese start_ad11ee3c:

    # n "That’s when {i}she{/i} made her move."
    n "就在那时，{i}她{/i}出手了。"

# game/script.rpy:6382
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_84:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6397
translate chinese start_4e544215:

    # "The windows were closed, and the blinds were drawn. It must have been stuffy and hot in the apartment."
    "窗户关着，百叶窗也拉下了。公寓里一定又闷又热。"

# game/script.rpy:6398
translate chinese start_e1eb5df8:

    # "I lay on the couch, shivering."
    "我躺在沙发上发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:6399
translate chinese start_3a483e00:

    # "I held to my chest the sweater Grace had left."
    "我把 Grace 留下的毛衣抱在胸口。"

# game/script.rpy:6403
translate chinese start_802467a8:

    # "I was about to slip into uncomfortable sleep when the front door opened."
    "我正要沉入不安的睡眠，前门开了。"

# game/script.rpy:6404
translate chinese start_a214d483:

    # "My heart skipped a beat, before the sight of the person coming in disappointed me."
    "我心跳漏了一拍，随即又被进来的人浇了一盆冷水。"

# game/script.rpy:6419
translate chinese start_22484a79:

    # a "Hello?"
    a "有人吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6428
translate chinese start_e8d0305a_2:

    # a "Jack?"
    a "Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:6430
translate chinese start_cefe8607:

    # "I stared at her."
    "我盯着她。"

# game/script.rpy:6437
translate chinese start_bd87fd67:

    # a "What’s wrong?"
    a "怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:6439
translate chinese start_687da541:

    # "Stare."
    "盯着看。"

# game/script.rpy:6443
translate chinese start_5ca1c5d1:

    # "She tried to get me to talk, but I was not in a talking mood."
    "她想让我开口，可我一点说话的心情都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:6444
translate chinese start_ab1d4776:

    # "Eventually she found the letter still on the table—pretended to find it."
    "最后她“发现”了还放在桌上的信——装作刚发现。"

# game/script.rpy:6455
translate chinese start_ce214931:

    # a "Oh, Jack."
    a "噢，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:6459
translate chinese start_4b20091c:

    # a "Oh, darling..."
    a "噢，亲爱的……"

# game/script.rpy:6461
translate chinese start_2976074e:

    # j "Go away."
    j "走开。"

# game/script.rpy:6466
translate chinese start_cc3c2a66:

    # a "You’re hurt, I know."
    a "我知道你很难过。"

# game/script.rpy:6473
translate chinese start_5e2528f2:

    # a "She’s terrible, isn’t she? To have hurt you so badly."
    a "她真过分，是不是？把你伤成这样。"

# game/script.rpy:6475
translate chinese start_5dc58de1:

    # j "She’s..."
    j "她……"

# game/script.rpy:6477
translate chinese start_2ad5ec0d:

    # "The sweater was soft against my skin. It smelled of her."
    "毛衣贴着皮肤，很软。上面有她的味道。"

# game/script.rpy:6499
translate chinese start_48823b36:

    # a "I know. I know. She's awful."
    a "我知道，我知道。她太差劲了。"

# game/script.rpy:6504
translate chinese start_14deb5ee:

    # a "Let me help."
    a "让我来帮你。"

# game/script.rpy:6506
translate chinese start_54162805:

    # "She brought her hand near to my face. I turned my head away."
    "她把手伸到我脸边。我把头转开了。"

# game/script.rpy:6511
translate chinese start_d69356a5:

    # a "{i}I’m{/i} the one who can make you happy, you know?"
    a "{i}我{/i}才是能让你幸福的人，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6516
translate chinese start_8d3fdb1a:

    # a "You won’t have to remember {i}that girl{/i} ever again."
    a "你不用再想起{i}那个女孩{/i}了。"

# game/script.rpy:6521
translate chinese start_fe84f724:

    # a "You won’t want to. I promise."
    a "你不会想的。我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:6523
translate chinese start_e1ed822d:

    # "Her hand found my cheek."
    "她的手抚上我的脸颊。"

# game/script.rpy:6524
translate chinese start_43b3e65e:

    # "It had only been two days since I’d last seen Grace, had last touched her. But it was like I had already forgotten a person’s warmth."
    "距我上一次见到 Grace、上一次碰到她，才过去两天。可我好像已经忘记了人身上的温度。"

# game/script.rpy:6525
translate chinese start_0ac53be4:

    # "I raised my hand to bat hers away, and I found that I couldn’t do it."
    "我抬起手想把她的手拨开，却发现自己做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:6526
translate chinese start_5a0beb1e:

    # "Instead I put my hand on hers."
    "我把手放在了她的手上。"

# game/script.rpy:6527
translate chinese start_6a345e84:

    # "I was close to tears."
    "我快要哭了。"

# game/script.rpy:6528
translate chinese start_f3ae57ba:

    # "There were so many emotions in me that confused and overwhelmed me."
    "太多情绪涌上来，搅得我晕头转向。"

# game/script.rpy:6529
translate chinese start_f3b5b88f:

    # "{w=0.5}But Anna was here. And she was whispering that she’d never leave."
    "{w=0.5}可是 Anna 在这儿。她低声说她永远不会离开。"

# game/script.rpy:6537
translate chinese start_90a02db3:

    # "We made love there, on the couch."
    "我们就在那里，在沙发上做了爱。"

# game/script.rpy:6538
translate chinese start_9ad06795:

    # "Afterwards, I used the sweater to wipe the sweat off of me."
    "事后，我用那件毛衣擦掉了身上的汗。"

# game/script.rpy:6539
translate chinese start_4b0f8a63:

    # "Anna lay next to me, soft and warm, both her arms wrapped around one of mine."
    "Anna 躺在我旁边，又软又暖，双臂抱着我的一条胳膊。"

# game/script.rpy:6555
translate chinese start_6d190c6c:

    # "In the morning, after the long, long night, Anna looked to me and asked me a question."
    "漫长的夜晚过去，早上 Anna 看着我，问了我一个问题。"

# game/script.rpy:6564
translate chinese start_fa9feb9e:

    # a "I’m tired. Aren’t you?"
    a "我累了。你不累吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6566
translate chinese start_8d4d9a79_1:

    # j "Uh-huh."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:6571
translate chinese start_87f8604e:

    # a "I won’t go to work today. I’ll call in sick."
    a "我今天不去上班了。我打电话请病假。"

# game/script.rpy:6576
translate chinese start_9169c3dd:

    # a "What about you?"
    a "你呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6578
translate chinese start_068ac14b:

    # j "I don’t know."
    j "呃，我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:6579
translate chinese start_61b465c1:

    # j "I won’t go to work."
    j "我不去上班。"

# game/script.rpy:6581
translate chinese start_8ecbd6dd:

    # "I hadn’t thought at all about work. It was so irrelevant."
    "我完全没想到上班的事。那太无关紧要了。"

# game/script.rpy:6589
translate chinese start_64dbfb6b:

    # a "That’s a good idea."
    a "好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:6595
translate chinese start_c0ead92f:

    # a "Hey, I’m going to my apartment. I want to have a nice, hot shower."
    a "嘿，我要回我公寓一趟。我想好好冲个热水澡。"

# game/script.rpy:6601
translate chinese start_45c1be04:

    # a "Come with?"
    a "一起来吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6603
translate chinese start_b5b6a2a5:

    # j "Sure. Yes."
    j "好啊。当然。"

# game/script.rpy:6605
translate chinese start_39fc9405:

    # "My apartment had a perfectly working shower, of course. But I didn’t want to be by myself."
    "当然，我公寓的淋浴完全没问题。可我不想一个人待着。"

# game/script.rpy:6606
translate chinese start_f99fe610:

    # "I was scared."
    "我很害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:6614
translate chinese start_b522a261:

    # n "After I’d had a shower at her place, Anna told me I could stay there a while."
    n "在她那儿洗完澡之后，Anna 说我可以先住一阵子。"

# game/script.rpy:6615
translate chinese start_608bb1fe:

    # n "\"Until you feel better,\" she told me. \"What do you say?\""
    n "“住到你好起来为止，”她对我说，“你觉得怎么样？”"

# game/script.rpy:6616
translate chinese start_8b2b3d38:

    # n "I said yes."
    n "我答应了。"

# game/script.rpy:6617
translate chinese start_509d7b55:

    # n "And that’s how it went."
    n "事情就这么定了。"

# game/script.rpy:6619
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_85:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6631
translate chinese start_d3092732:

    # n "I don’t feel shame for what I did."
    n "我不为自己做过的事感到羞耻。"

# game/script.rpy:6632
translate chinese start_66708da7:

    # n "I know I should, but I don’t."
    n "我知道我该感到羞愧，可我偏偏没有。"

# game/script.rpy:6633
translate chinese start_0af7d03f:

    # n "The problem is, I don’t {i}really{/i} feel like I did any of that."
    n "问题在于，我并不{i}真的{/i}觉得自己做过那些事。"

# game/script.rpy:6634
translate chinese start_225ba118:

    # n "It’s more like I was watching myself do those things—watching myself get tricked, and cheat on Grace, and live with that woman who’s caused so much misery to so many people."
    n "更像是旁观自己做了那些事——看着自己被耍，看着自己背叛 Grace，看着自己和那个给那么多人带来痛苦的女人住在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:6636
translate chinese start_517f2b42:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I know I should be ashamed."
    nvl clear
    n "我知道我该感到羞耻。"

# game/script.rpy:6639
translate chinese start_56f6b73b:

    # n "It’s a disgusting thing I did, and I can’t take it back."
    n "我做的事很恶心，而我无法收回。"

# game/script.rpy:6640
translate chinese start_599961dd:

    # n "I let myself be made into an animal."
    n "我任由自己被人驯成了一头畜生。"

# game/script.rpy:6641
translate chinese start_66d90e00:

    # n "That one whole month is something I’d like to forget and to never remember."
    n "那整整一个月，我想忘掉，永远不要再想起来。"

# game/script.rpy:6642
translate chinese start_a11363fb:

    # n "So I won’t write about it. Or about anything more."
    n "所以我不会写这件事。也不会再写别的了。"

# game/script.rpy:6644
translate chinese start_8fe10e8a:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I’ve written enough."
    nvl clear
    n "我写得够多了。"

# game/script.rpy:6647
translate chinese start_e2d69cde:

    # n "I’m done."
    n "到此为止。"

# game/script.rpy:6648
translate chinese start_a50f3b85:

    # n "This journal has helped me a lot, but I don’t need it anymore."
    n "这本日记帮了我很多，但我不再需要它了。"

# game/script.rpy:6650
translate chinese start_3bf7967e:

    # nvl clear
    # n "This is, then."
    nvl clear
    n "那就这样吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6653
translate chinese start_db618cf7:

    # n "It's goodbye."
    n "就此告别吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6654
translate chinese start_c3643806:

    # n "So goodbye."
    n "那么，再见了。"

# game/script.rpy:6655
translate chinese start_34fdca10:

    # n "—J. F."
    n "——J. F."

# game/script.rpy:6657
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_86:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6678
translate chinese start_0aa5cc6c:

    # "I woke up and found the room dark."
    "醒来时，房间里一片漆黑。"

# game/script.rpy:6686
translate chinese start_6b034c3e:

    # "Incredibly dark—it didn’t matter if my eyes were open or closed. The image didn’t change."
    "黑得离谱——睁眼闭眼都一样，眼前的画面没有变化。"

# game/script.rpy:6687
translate chinese start_8f792aec:

    # "Something wasn’t right. The air smelled... different."
    "有什么不对劲。空气闻起来……不一样了。"

# game/script.rpy:6688
translate chinese start_f95d9f14:

    # "Grace made a soft moaning sound in her sleep."
    "Grace 在睡梦中轻轻哼了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:6689
translate chinese start_56d2ac90:

    # "She lay next to me."
    "她躺在我身边。"

# game/script.rpy:6690
translate chinese start_e16deee0:

    # "I reached down, to make absolutely sure she was here."
    "我伸手往下摸，想确认她真的在。"

# game/script.rpy:6699
translate chinese start_dce88551:

    # a "Mmmn, {i}Jack{/i}..."
    a "嗯……{i}Jack{/i}……"

# game/script.rpy:6704
translate chinese start_bddc5b42:

    # "To hear {i}her{/i} voice instead was like finding a snake in my bed."
    "结果听到的却是{i}她{/i}的声音，像在床上摸到一条蛇。"

# game/script.rpy:6705
translate chinese start_b3987137:

    # "I almost fell over a nightstand."
    "我差点被床头柜绊倒。"

# game/script.rpy:6717
translate chinese start_ac7f74be:

    # a "Are you okay?"
    a "你没事吧？"

# game/script.rpy:6721
translate chinese start_031369b0:

    # a "Bad dream?"
    a "做噩梦了？"

# game/script.rpy:6723
translate chinese start_e6fdf2d7:

    # j "S-Stay a—"
    j "别、别过来——"

# game/script.rpy:6730
translate chinese start_51238ba6:

    # "She touched me, skin against skin."
    "她碰了我，皮肤贴着皮肤。"

# game/script.rpy:6731
translate chinese start_e02f78f8:

    # "I remembered where I was, and why I was here."
    "我想起了自己在哪儿，也想起了自己为什么在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:6737
translate chinese start_004a5a24:

    # a "Better?"
    a "好点了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6739
translate chinese start_fb3eafa2:

    # j "...Yeah. Sorry about that."
    j "……嗯。抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:6744
translate chinese start_ef85c08c_1:

    # a "Good."
    a "那就好。"

# game/script.rpy:6746
translate chinese start_069d6633:

    # "I settled back onto my side of the bed."
    "我躺回自己那半边床。"

# game/script.rpy:6747
translate chinese start_a217660a:

    # "Anna ruffled my hair."
    "Anna 揉了揉我的头发。"

# game/script.rpy:6753
translate chinese start_3cfcb8d3:

    # a "You startled me."
    a "你吓着我了。"

# game/script.rpy:6755
translate chinese start_ded8b030:

    # j "I didn’t mean to."
    j "我不是故意的。"

# game/script.rpy:6761
translate chinese start_295c7eab:

    # a "It’s okay. I know you wouldn’t do that."
    a "没关系。我知道你不会那么做的。"

# game/script.rpy:6767
translate chinese start_bf664d9e:

    # a "Because you love me."
    a "因为你爱我。"

# game/script.rpy:6788
translate chinese start_e79934f7_10:

    # y "Dear diary"
    y "亲爱的日记："

# game/script.rpy:6789
translate chinese start_0f51fbb6:

    # y "It’s all been worth it."
    y "这一切都值了。"

# game/script.rpy:6790
translate chinese start_308b2a4f:

    # y "All the years of waiting and hoping have been {i}so{/i} worth it."
    y "这么多年的等待和期盼，{i}太{/i}值了。"

# game/script.rpy:6792
translate chinese start_784932b0:

    # nvl clear
    # y "I never expected it to go as well as it did."
    nvl clear
    y "我从没想过会这么顺利。"

# game/script.rpy:6795
translate chinese start_ddcca906:

    # y "Now I feel so silly I ever worried."
    y "现在想想自己当初那么担心，真是可笑。"

# game/script.rpy:6797
translate chinese start_fb143e53:

    # nvl clear
    # y "Grace the whore is out of the picture."
    nvl clear
    y "Grace 那个婊子已经出局了。"

# game/script.rpy:6800
translate chinese start_e7c11558:

    # y "It was easy. She is so scared of everything."
    y "太容易了。她什么都怕。"

# game/script.rpy:6801
translate chinese start_063461ca:

    # y "And Jack is all mine."
    y "而 Jack 完全是我的了。"

# game/script.rpy:6803
translate chinese start_a1762a96:

    # nvl clear
    # y "I expected he would struggle a lot more!"
    nvl clear
    y "我还以为他会挣扎得厉害得多呢！"

# game/script.rpy:6806
translate chinese start_deae6c34:

    # y "I’m so proud of him."
    y "我真为他骄傲。"

# game/script.rpy:6807
translate chinese start_c0e89130:

    # y "Even in the terrible state he’s in, no memories of us at all, he knew in his heart he should pick me over her."
    y "就算他现在这副惨样子，一点都不记得我们的事，他心里也明白，该选我，不是她。"

# game/script.rpy:6809
translate chinese start_5e3cd971:

    # nvl clear
    # y "You’re so cute, Jack. The way you’re absolutely helpless without me."
    nvl clear
    y "你真可爱，Jack。没了我，你就彻底束手无策。"

# game/script.rpy:6812
translate chinese start_9f82b430:

    # y "I’ll pamper you a little more."
    y "我会再多宠你一点。"

# game/script.rpy:6813
translate chinese start_230fdcb6:

    # y "I can do that. There’s no hurry. There’s no rush."
    y "我可以等。不用急。一点也不急。"

# game/script.rpy:6814
translate chinese start_d9597590:

    # y "We’ve reached our happy ending."
    y "我们已经走到幸福的结局了。"

# game/script.rpy:6816
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_87:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:6835
translate chinese start_8dbb3ddb:

    # "I paced around Anna’s bedroom."
    "我在 Anna 的卧室里来回踱步。"

# game/script.rpy:6836
translate chinese start_cf1e7a89:

    # "Step, step, step, step. {w}Turn."
    "一步，两步，三步，四步。{w}转身。"

# game/script.rpy:6837
translate chinese start_cf1e7a89_1:

    # "Step, step, step, step. {w}Turn."
    "一步，两步，三步，四步。{w}转身。"

# game/script.rpy:6838
translate chinese start_df085553:

    # "It wasn’t a very large room. About the same size as mine and..."
    "房间不大。跟我那间差不多，而且……"

# game/script.rpy:6839
translate chinese start_cf1e7a89_2:

    # "Step, step, step, step. {w}Turn."
    "一步，两步，三步，四步。{w}转身。"

# game/script.rpy:6840
translate chinese start_a3c74db5:

    # "It was dark. The curtains were drawn."
    "屋里很暗。窗帘拉着。"

# game/script.rpy:6841
translate chinese start_53a75742:

    # "But it would’ve been dark without them, too."
    "可就算不拉窗帘，也还是暗的。"

# game/script.rpy:6842
translate chinese start_c72af19e:

    # "The alarm clock’s neon green digits, hovering in the dark, showed that it was 5:10 a.m. And that it was Monday."
    "闹钟的荧光绿数字浮在黑暗里，显示是凌晨五点十分。还有，今天是星期一。"

# game/script.rpy:6843
translate chinese start_93ea57b6:

    # "Step, step, step—"
    "一步，两步，三步——"

# game/script.rpy:6848
translate chinese start_b1d11354:

    # "Anna’s bed sheets rustled. She mumbled something and sat up."
    "Anna 的床单窸窣作响。她含糊地嘟囔了一句，坐了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:6859
translate chinese start_d143de4e:

    # a "Jack? Why are you...?"
    a "Jack？你怎么……？"

# game/script.rpy:6861
translate chinese start_f3787f8a:

    # "I took in a deep breath. It helped me keep my voice from shaking as I answered."
    "我深吸一口气，好让回答时声音不至于发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:6863
translate chinese start_3df827ed:

    # j "It’s nothing. Go back to sleep."
    j "没什么。你接着睡吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6869
translate chinese start_fa5a3fd9:

    # a "What is it?"
    a "怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:6875
translate chinese start_e137c140:

    # a "Something is wrong, isn’t it?"
    a "嗯，有什么烦心事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6880
translate chinese start_aaa0cc7b:

    # a "Tell me. I’ll make it go away."
    a "告诉我。我会让它消失的。"

# game/script.rpy:6882
translate chinese start_edcafca1:

    # j "No, please."
    j "不，求你了。"

# game/script.rpy:6883
translate chinese start_da523990:

    # j "It’s stupid."
    j "很蠢的。"

# game/script.rpy:6888
translate chinese start_cacd887d:

    # a "Tell me."
    a "告诉我。"

# game/script.rpy:6898
translate chinese start_06d7e729:

    # "I stepped closer to the bed, banged my shin on its side, and sighed."
    "我走近床边，小腿撞在床沿上，叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:6900
translate chinese start_ff3cb9d4:

    # j "It’s—it’s Monday."
    j "是——是星期一。"

# game/script.rpy:6905
translate chinese start_3757a41a:

    # "Anna glanced over my shoulder, at the alarm clock."
    "Anna 越过我的肩膀，瞥了一眼闹钟。"

# game/script.rpy:6911
translate chinese start_f37632dd:

    # a "Yep. It is."
    a "对，是星期一。"

# game/script.rpy:6916
translate chinese start_65258e71:

    # a "So?"
    a "所以呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6918
translate chinese start_1cac6311:

    # j "I have work."
    j "我得去上班。"

# game/script.rpy:6920
translate chinese start_d0bbc848:

    # "When Grace... When she..."
    "当 Grace……当她……"

# game/script.rpy:6921
translate chinese start_f30a3f50:

    # "...When I came back to an empty apartment, it was early Friday morning."
    "……当我回到空荡荡的公寓时，那是星期五的清晨。"

# game/script.rpy:6922
translate chinese start_bdbfebec:

    # "I had missed work on Friday."
    "星期五我没去上班。"

# game/script.rpy:6924
translate chinese start_7b85fc78:

    # j "I must be on thin ice already. I didn’t even call in."
    j "我大概已经站在被开除的边缘了。我连电话都没打。"

# game/script.rpy:6930
translate chinese start_4d679efb:

    # a "And?"
    a "然后呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6935
translate chinese start_3f4b4cb0:

    # a "Just don’t go."
    a "别去就是了。"

# game/script.rpy:6937
translate chinese start_e8c909e4:

    # j "But—but if I don’t go today, they’ll fire me for sure."
    j "可、可我今天要是再不去，他们肯定会开除我。"

# game/script.rpy:6942
translate chinese start_65258e71_1:

    # a "So?"
    a "所以呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6944
translate chinese start_519048f6:

    # j "What do you mean, ’so’?"
    j "你什么意思，“所以呢”？"

# game/script.rpy:6945
translate chinese start_d1e184b0:

    # j "This is serious!"
    j "这很严重！"

# game/script.rpy:6950
translate chinese start_6a26820d:

    # a "Don’t be upset. Here."
    a "别生气。来。"

# game/script.rpy:6960
translate chinese start_88f77e78:

    # "Anna got up lazily and kissed me, held me."
    "Anna 懒懒地起身，吻了我，把我抱住。"

# game/script.rpy:6961
translate chinese start_8ea1aeea:

    # "We stood there a few moments in silence."
    "我们就在那儿静静地站了一会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:6970
translate chinese start_f3987f00:

    # a "There. Doesn’t it all seem better now?"
    a "看，现在是不是好多了？"

# game/script.rpy:6972
translate chinese start_9680d736:

    # j "B-But I still..."
    j "但……但是我……"

# game/script.rpy:6977
translate chinese start_c2f9b0e0:

    # a "Uh-uh."
    a "不行。"

# game/script.rpy:6982
translate chinese start_b834ee30:

    # a "No, sweetie. You stay in today."
    a "不行，亲爱的。你今天待在家里。"

# game/script.rpy:6990
translate chinese start_7373a328:

    # "She pressed herself harder against me."
    "她往我身上贴得更紧了。"

# game/script.rpy:6991
translate chinese start_1ba3d202:

    # "I felt her softness, the heat of her body. I could hardly feel anything else."
    "我感觉到她的柔软、她身体的温度。别的几乎都感觉不到了。"

# game/script.rpy:6996
translate chinese start_a51ab298:

    # a "You don’t {i}want{/i} to go to work."
    a "你{i}不想{/i}去上班。"

# game/script.rpy:7001
translate chinese start_ad80cfee:

    # a "Do you?"
    a "对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7003
translate chinese start_e4a3efb3:

    # j "I... I don’t. But, I mean, I have to."
    j "我……我是不想。可是，我是说，我必须去。"

# game/script.rpy:7009
translate chinese start_b17cce47:

    # a "You don’t have to. It’ll be fine."
    a "你不必去。没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:7014
translate chinese start_5a4246af:

    # a "The world won’t end."
    a "天又不会塌下来。"

# game/script.rpy:7016
translate chinese start_853bbd3e:

    # "I was going to complain again, but she pressed a finger to my lips."
    "我还想再抱怨，她却把一根手指按在我唇上。"

# game/script.rpy:7021
translate chinese start_224997c0:

    # a "You know what?"
    a "你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7026
translate chinese start_24830659:

    # a "An idea just came to me."
    a "我刚想到一个主意。"

# game/script.rpy:7031
translate chinese start_74f8f398:

    # a "If you move out of that aw~ful apartment and come live with me instead, you won’t have to work in that aw~ful store anymore, either."
    a "你要是从那个可~怕的公寓搬出来，搬来跟我住，也就不用再去那个可~怕的店里上班了。"

# game/script.rpy:7036
translate chinese start_a64c7210:

    # a "That sounds nice, doesn’t it?"
    a "听起来不错吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7038
translate chinese start_38c2929a:

    # "It sounded so good."
    "听起来确实太好了。"

# game/script.rpy:7039
translate chinese start_c05987ed:

    # "Anna understood me so well."
    "Anna 太懂我了。"

# game/script.rpy:7040
translate chinese start_af3cd1d9:

    # "But I wasn't sure of myself. I asked if it was really fine for me to stay here for good."
    "可我对自己没底。我问她，我真的可以一直住在这儿吗。"

# game/script.rpy:7047
translate chinese start_b0a16f1e:

    # a "Of course."
    a "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:7054
translate chinese start_1dae8ae4:

    # a "I wouldn’t want you anywhere else."
    a "换别的地方我还不愿意呢。"

# game/script.rpy:7066
translate chinese start_e79934f7_11:

    # y "Dear diary"
    y "亲爱的日记："

# game/script.rpy:7067
translate chinese start_692c3427:

    # y "Oh my God! Oh goodness!"
    y "天啊！老天爷！"

# game/script.rpy:7068
translate chinese start_2e08d618:

    # y "How is this going so well?!"
    y "怎么会这么顺利？！"

# game/script.rpy:7070
translate chinese start_3e06ada0:

    # nvl clear
    # y "It never worked so well before. Not with the patients I tried it on. Even though they were terminal."
    nvl clear
    y "以前从没这么成功过。那些被我试过的病人也没这么成功——哪怕他们都已经到末期了。"

# game/script.rpy:7073
translate chinese start_8a5ecd0c:

    # y "Even though they had no one to visit them."
    y "哪怕根本没人来看他们。"

# game/script.rpy:7074
translate chinese start_4338165b:

    # y "All of them kept being themselves right up to the end."
    y "他们到最后都还是他们自己。"

# game/script.rpy:7076
translate chinese start_153b83fe:

    # nvl clear
    # y "But with Jack I can do anything."
    nvl clear
    y "可是对 Jack，我什么都能做到。"

# game/script.rpy:7079
translate chinese start_85022792:

    # y "He is like clay."
    y "他就像一团黏土。"

# game/script.rpy:7080
translate chinese start_491301ab:

    # y "I could change him into anyone, anything I want."
    y "我可以把他变成任何我想要的人、任何东西。"

# game/script.rpy:7081
translate chinese start_e275c1bb:

    # y "How awful!"
    y "多可怕啊！"

# game/script.rpy:7082
translate chinese start_70d5227c:

    # y "He’s so lucky that it’s me doing this. Could you imagine someone else with this kind of responsibility?"
    y "真幸运，做这事的人是我。你能想象换个人来担这份责任吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7084
translate chinese start_0dc74711:

    # nvl clear
    # y "No, no, no! What am I saying?"
    nvl clear
    y "不不不！我在说什么呀？"

# game/script.rpy:7087
translate chinese start_433aafec:

    # y "Nobody else could make him so willing to change."
    y "除了我，没人能让他这么心甘情愿地改变。"

# game/script.rpy:7088
translate chinese start_5f187fbf:

    # y "Me. Only me."
    y "我。只有我。"

# game/script.rpy:7089
translate chinese start_ffe60c5c:

    # y "He’s only like this because he loves me so much."
    y "他这样，只是因为他太爱我了。"

# game/script.rpy:7090
translate chinese start_cb4aeef2:

    # y "He’s always loved me. Even when he didn’t realize it."
    y "他一直都爱我。哪怕他自己没意识到。"

# game/script.rpy:7092
translate chinese start_7ca0111c:

    # nvl clear
    # y "And he’ll always love me, and I’ll always love him, and we’ll be together forever."
    nvl clear
    y "而他会永远爱我，我也会永远爱他，我们会永远在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:7095
translate chinese start_bd9af41d:

    # y "Forever."
    y "永远。"

# game/script.rpy:7096
translate chinese start_b10b2fe6:

    # y "Ah! I’m so happy I could scream."
    y "啊！我高兴得想尖叫。"

# game/script.rpy:7097
translate chinese start_306b7992:

    # y "Right now I’m only teasing him a little, but that’s O.K. We have all the time in the world."
    y "现在我只是稍微逗逗他，不过没关系。我们有的是时间。"

# game/script.rpy:7098
translate chinese start_6e736bd8:

    # y "Unlike those other boys, he’s not about to expire."
    y "跟那些男孩不一样，他不会到期作废。"

# game/script.rpy:7100
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_88:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:7108
translate chinese start_ee25c3e2:

    # "Days went by. Maybe a week."
    "日子过去了。大概有一个星期。"

# game/script.rpy:7117
translate chinese start_4ae28918:

    # a "Jack."
    a "Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:7122
translate chinese start_17f69eec:

    # a "Come on, Jack."
    a "来嘛，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:7128
translate chinese start_0ce38235:

    # "A laugh."
    "我笑了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:7134
translate chinese start_d5472a90:

    # a "If you don’t let go of me, I can’t go to work, you know?"
    a "你再不放开我，我就没法去上班了，知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7136
translate chinese start_e2dbf65c:

    # j "Then don’t go."
    j "那就别去。"

# game/script.rpy:7137
translate chinese start_d1dba655:

    # j "Stay here."
    j "留在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:7144
translate chinese start_af726f9e:

    # a "Hey, one of us has to go."
    a "嘿，我们总得有一个人去。"

# game/script.rpy:7151
translate chinese start_37087987:

    # a "We need it to live."
    a "我们得靠它过日子。"

# game/script.rpy:7153
translate chinese start_5d621231:

    # j "I need you to live."
    j "我需要你，才能活下去。"

# game/script.rpy:7159
translate chinese start_ada6bd72:

    # a "Hm hmm..."
    a "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:7165
translate chinese start_1097df96:

    # a "That’s very sweet, but I still have to go."
    a "这话很甜，可我还是得去。"

# game/script.rpy:7170
translate chinese start_fd27b82c:

    # "I wouldn’t budge."
    "我不肯让步。"

# game/script.rpy:7175
translate chinese start_bb32da52:

    # "She ran her fingers through my hair. I liked that."
    "她用手指梳过我的头发。我喜欢这样。"

# game/script.rpy:7181
translate chinese start_a5502b18:

    # a "If you get off me now, I promise I’ll have a special surprise for you when I come back."
    a "你现在放开我，我保证回来的时候给你一个特别的惊喜。"

# game/script.rpy:7183
translate chinese start_0d724a51:

    # j "Really?"
    j "真的？"

# game/script.rpy:7188
translate chinese start_c9a9876d:

    # a "Really. I promise."
    a "真的。我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:7190
translate chinese start_d99e9ed9:

    # j "...Okay."
    j "好……"

# game/script.rpy:7194
translate chinese start_27397c57:

    # "I forced myself to let her go."
    "我强迫自己松开她。"

# game/script.rpy:7195
translate chinese start_f2b1de14:

    # "After she went away, I lay back down on the bed."
    "她走后，我又躺回床上。"

# game/script.rpy:7196
translate chinese start_a567dc64:

    # "I waited for her to come back."
    "我等着她回来。"

# game/script.rpy:7197
translate chinese start_917b6947:

    # "I did nothing else."
    "别的什么都没做。"

# game/script.rpy:7220
translate chinese start_34e4e952:

    # "Anna’s surprise was a big plastic bag."
    "Anna 的惊喜是一个大塑料袋。"

# game/script.rpy:7221
translate chinese start_4da779a2:

    # "It was swollen, full of {i}something.{/i}"
    "袋子鼓鼓的，装满了{i}什么东西{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:7222
translate chinese start_20524697:

    # "I looked at her, then at it, then at her again, and frowned."
    "我看看她，又看看袋子，再看她，皱起了眉。"

# game/script.rpy:7227
translate chinese start_5cac9cb3:

    # a "You’ll see."
    a "你会知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:7232
translate chinese start_59572598:

    # a "Come. We need to go somewhere."
    a "来。我们得去个地方。"

# game/script.rpy:7234
translate chinese start_166ee1f2:

    # j "Go... outside?"
    j "去……外面？"

# game/script.rpy:7240
translate chinese start_210c06eb_1:

    # a "Yes."
    a "对。"

# game/script.rpy:7245
translate chinese start_9c197274:

    # a "Isn’t that exciting’"
    a "是不是很刺激？"

# game/script.rpy:7253
translate chinese start_5fcbd25f:

    # "I looked away."
    "我别开了视线。"

# game/script.rpy:7260
translate chinese start_5e6cb896:

    # a "What, you don’t want to?"
    a "怎么，你不想去？"

# game/script.rpy:7262
translate chinese start_5bcf5757:

    # "I held up a pillow in front of me. It was meant to act as a barrier."
    "我举起一个枕头挡在身前。它是用来当盾牌的。"

# game/script.rpy:7267
translate chinese start_5971d472:

    # a "Oh, you big scaredy-cat."
    a "哎哟，你这个胆小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:7273
translate chinese start_0be2cd51:

    # a "Come on."
    a "来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7278
translate chinese start_daa891b7:

    # "She took my arm and pulled."
    "她抓住我的手臂往外拉。"

# game/script.rpy:7279
translate chinese start_ad4e3719:

    # "I wouldn’t go."
    "我不肯走。"

# game/script.rpy:7280
translate chinese start_766b5cce:

    # "Her grip was strong—or maybe I’d gotten weak—but I stayed in place."
    "她的力气很大——也许是我变弱了——可我还是纹丝不动。"

# game/script.rpy:7286
translate chinese start_110f316a:

    # a "Huh."
    a "咦。"

# game/script.rpy:7292
translate chinese start_a93fd5a0:

    # a "So you really don’t want to go?"
    a "所以你真的不想去？"

# game/script.rpy:7294
translate chinese start_0aef94e6:

    # j "Let’s... How come we can’t just stay here?"
    j "我们……为什么就不能待在这儿呢？"

# game/script.rpy:7304
translate chinese start_06ebcf12_1:

    # a "Oh, sweetie."
    a "噢，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:7309
translate chinese start_bdb8c14a:

    # a "I don’t want the apartment to burn down."
    a "我不想让公寓烧起来。"

# game/script.rpy:7321
translate chinese start_8cf684b0:

    # "She made me dress in outside clothes. They were rugged and cold."
    "她让我换上出门的衣服。那些衣服又硬又冷。"

# game/script.rpy:7327
translate chinese start_4c353762:

    # "The outside was even more rugged and cold."
    "外面比衣服还要粗粝、还要冷。"

# game/script.rpy:7328
translate chinese start_1b11b3e4:

    # "The street was wet. It must have rained."
    "街上湿着。一定是下过雨。"

# game/script.rpy:7329
translate chinese start_ae3dfc1f:

    # "The people there were giving me looks."
    "那里的人都在看我。"

# game/script.rpy:7330
translate chinese start_82e2c25a:

    # "They were looking at me like I was trash."
    "他们看我的眼神，像在看垃圾。"

# game/script.rpy:7331
translate chinese start_8a93bb7a:

    # "Why? What had I done to them?"
    "为什么？我对他们做过什么？"

# game/script.rpy:7332
translate chinese start_e33b9f35:

    # "What had I ever done to anyone?"
    "我到底对谁做过什么？"

# game/script.rpy:7343
translate chinese start_b592d697:

    # a "Oh, hey!"
    a "噢，嘿！"

# game/script.rpy:7350
translate chinese start_265c32b4:

    # a "Ease up a little. You’ll hurt my hand."
    a "松一点。你把我的手都捏疼了。"

# game/script.rpy:7352
translate chinese start_63c19463:

    # j "I’m sorry."
    j "我很抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:7358
translate chinese start_ed68bf0a:

    # a "That’s okay."
    a "没关系的。"

# game/script.rpy:7363
translate chinese start_15ca2657:

    # a "If you really don’t feel like it, we can go back home right now."
    a "你要是真的不想去，我们现在就回家。"

# game/script.rpy:7365
translate chinese start_0d724a51_1:

    # j "Really?"
    j "真的？"

# game/script.rpy:7370
translate chinese start_210c06eb_2:

    # a "Yes."
    a "真的。"

# game/script.rpy:7375
translate chinese start_50eab55e:

    # a "But I know you can do this."
    a "但我知道你做得到。"

# game/script.rpy:7381
translate chinese start_9468b50e:

    # a "So will you do it? For me?"
    a "那你愿意做吗？为了我。"

# game/script.rpy:7386
translate chinese start_ef5d6c7a_1:

    # j "Ah..."
    j "啊……"

# game/script.rpy:7387
translate chinese start_010cf1f9:

    # j "I..."
    j "我……"

# game/script.rpy:7388
translate chinese start_bee38953_1:

    # j "Yeah. Okay."
    j "嗯。好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7394
translate chinese start_93443bbf_1:

    # a "Great!"
    a "太好了！"

# game/script.rpy:7399
translate chinese start_3090c0aa:

    # a "Thank you, Jack. You’re so good to me."
    a "谢谢你，Jack。你对我真好。"

# game/script.rpy:7429
translate chinese start_b0312ffc:

    # "We walked for over fifteen minutes."
    "我们走了十五分钟还多。"

# game/script.rpy:7430
translate chinese start_6f546bac:

    # "My feet hurt, and my legs made clicking sounds—I hadn’t really walked in over a week."
    "我的脚很疼，腿还发出咔哒的声音——我已经一个多星期没真正走过路了。"

# game/script.rpy:7431
translate chinese start_2bd6af45:

    # "But I didn’t complain."
    "但我没有抱怨。"

# game/script.rpy:7440
translate chinese start_abca13fe:

    # a "We’re almost there."
    a "我们快到了。"

# game/script.rpy:7445
translate chinese start_29ea959c:

    # a "Do you know where we are?"
    a "你知道这是哪儿吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7447
translate chinese start_bbb7e3c6_1:

    # "I shook my head."
    "我摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:7453
translate chinese start_1d6f52c5:

    # n "Anna had led me somewhere I’d never been."
    n "Anna 把我带到了一个我从没去过的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:7454
translate chinese start_2f3dadb9:

    # n "Each street we passed was dirtier and grayer and more abandoned than the last, and the people looked at us all the more meanly."
    n "我们经过的每条街都比上一条更脏、更灰、更荒废，人们看我们的眼神也越来越不客气。"

# game/script.rpy:7455
translate chinese start_65e143a7:

    # n "I thought they were going to hurt us."
    n "我以为他们要伤害我们。"

# game/script.rpy:7456
translate chinese start_d772525e:

    # n "But Anna wasn’t afraid, so I did my best to be brave, too."
    n "可 Anna 不怕，所以我也尽力装出勇敢的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:7458
translate chinese start_4251df66:

    # nvl clear
    # n "{w=0.5}Whatever she had in the plastic bag, it wasn’t heavy."
    nvl clear
    n "{w=0.5}不管塑料袋里装的是什么，都不重。"

# game/script.rpy:7461
translate chinese start_b43d0321:

    # n "The bag was so full it was almost the shape of a big ball, but it still swung so lightly."
    n "袋子鼓得几乎成了个大球，可拎起来还是轻飘飘的。"

# game/script.rpy:7463
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_89:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:7477
translate chinese start_81072c13:

    # a "What do you think is in there?"
    a "你觉得里面是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:7479
translate chinese start_b9be5a40:

    # "Anna had noticed me looking."
    "Anna 注意到我在看。"

# game/script.rpy:7481
translate chinese start_149f7d5f:

    # j "I dunno."
    j "我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:7487
translate chinese start_0cc2b90d:

    # a "Want to guess?"
    a "想猜猜看吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7489
translate chinese start_a630e449:

    # "I didn’t. I told her I didn’t."
    "我跟她说我不想猜。"

# game/script.rpy:7490
translate chinese start_ca0755f7:

    # "I told her I couldn’t think of anything."
    "我跟她说我什么都想不出来。"

# game/script.rpy:7496
translate chinese start_3987a194:

    # a "Oh, well. You’ll see soon enough."
    a "噢，算了。你很快就知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:7508
translate chinese start_2a3355d4:

    # "Our destination, I saw five minutes later, was an empty street."
    "五分钟后我看清了，我们的目的地是一条空街。"

# game/script.rpy:7509
translate chinese start_d810d574:

    # "A whole street, blocks and blocks of it, completely abandoned."
    "整整一条街，一个街区接着一个街区，全都废弃了。"

# game/script.rpy:7510
translate chinese start_54f1dc60:

    # "The pavement was cracked. The buildings that still stood were hollow. And everything was overgrown with weeds."
    "路面裂开了。还立着的楼房都是空壳。所有地方都长满了野草。"

# game/script.rpy:7511
translate chinese start_a4c9ac1b:

    # "It was more a jungle than a city street."
    "与其说是城市街道，不如说是丛林。"

# game/script.rpy:7512
translate chinese start_60a4d6a5:

    # "It was ugly. I hated to even look at it."
    "很难看。我连看都不想看。"

# game/script.rpy:7523
translate chinese start_fc6df01a:

    # a "Isn’t it so {i}beautiful?{/i}"
    a "是不是很{i}美{/i}？"

# game/script.rpy:7525
translate chinese start_fcceffc0_1:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:7531
translate chinese start_b31e38b0:

    # a "I’ll show you the best spot here. It’s my favorite."
    a "我带你去看这儿最好的地方。那是我的最爱。"

# game/script.rpy:7536
translate chinese start_d2c9204c:

    # a "But it’ll be our secret, okay?"
    a "不过这是我们之间的秘密，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7541
translate chinese start_8cfd9a3f:

    # a "You can’t tell anyone else."
    a "你不能告诉别人。"

# game/script.rpy:7543
translate chinese start_53d71353:

    # j "Okay."
    j "好。"

# game/script.rpy:7557
translate chinese start_993d400b:

    # "We passed through a tunnel-like opening set in a tall, wide building."
    "我们穿过一栋高大宽阔的楼房上一个隧道似的开口。"

# game/script.rpy:7558
translate chinese start_97b02925:

    # "Beyond it was a field of brown-yellow grass. It came up to my chest."
    "后面是一片棕黄色的草地，长到我的胸口。"

# game/script.rpy:7559
translate chinese start_7917dba0:

    # "Surrounding the grass were the sides of a large apartment building. This used to be its courtyard."
    "草地四周是一栋大公寓楼的外墙。这里从前是它的院子。"

# game/script.rpy:7560
translate chinese start_7b6bcf76:

    # "The building was a mottled, ugly gray. It had most likely been a prettier color before it burned down."
    "楼身是斑驳难看的灰色。烧毁之前，它原本大概是更漂亮的颜色。"

# game/script.rpy:7561
translate chinese start_c1e23d5c:

    # "It had so many windows, none of which had glass in them."
    "楼上的窗户很多，没有一扇还装着玻璃。"

# game/script.rpy:7562
translate chinese start_ccdec71f:

    # "They gaped down at us, empty and dark."
    "它们空着、黑着，朝下对着我们大张着嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:7563
translate chinese start_43a3ddf6:

    # "Anna’s spot was a square patch of concrete in the middle of the overgrown courtyard."
    "Anna 说的地方，是荒草丛生的院子中间一小块方形水泥地。"

# game/script.rpy:7577
translate chinese start_a7dc61c4:

    # "Once there, Anna handed me something from the plastic bag."
    "到了那儿，Anna 从塑料袋里递给我一样东西。"

# game/script.rpy:7578
translate chinese start_4c74f4cd:

    # "It was a small gas canister and a box of matches."
    "一小罐汽油，和一盒火柴。"

# game/script.rpy:7587
translate chinese start_989e4bcb:

    # "Then she emptied the rest of bag out on the concrete. When I saw the contents, my chest tightened and started to hurt."
    "然后她把袋子里的东西全倒在水泥地上。看到那些东西，我胸口一紧，开始发疼。"

# game/script.rpy:7589
translate chinese start_2860308e:

    # j "This..."
    j "这也太……"

# game/script.rpy:7590
translate chinese start_fc4aaeaa:

    # j "Anna, this is..."
    j "Anna，这是……"

# game/script.rpy:7592
translate chinese start_8765adf9:

    # "On the ground were a few Post-it notes, a pair of shoes, but mostly clothes."
    "地上是几张便利贴，一双鞋，但大多数是衣服。"

# game/script.rpy:7593
translate chinese start_29ffdbaf:

    # "I had seen them before."
    "我见过这些东西。"

# game/script.rpy:7594
translate chinese start_bc4a809b:

    # "They had belonged to someone I knew."
    "它们属于一个我认识的人。"

# game/script.rpy:7595
translate chinese start_5456df42:

    # "Who?"
    "谁？"

# game/script.rpy:7596
translate chinese start_88cc5a26:

    # "Someone I had known an eternity ago. Too long ago to remember."
    "一个久远得像隔了一辈子的人。久远到想不起来。"

# game/script.rpy:7597
translate chinese start_e9289a5b:

    # "But I knew these things were important."
    "但我知道这些东西很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:7603
translate chinese start_7350a7a9:

    # a "You know what this is?"
    a "你知道这是什么吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7605
translate chinese start_353acc55:

    # j "Y-Yes."
    j "是、是的。"

# game/script.rpy:7606
translate chinese start_d9a7c7c7:

    # j "I shouldn’t?"
    j "我不该认出来吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7612
translate chinese start_c47e4cec:

    # a "It’s... fine if you still recognize them."
    a "你……还认得它们也没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:7617
translate chinese start_395ca975:

    # a "Completely fine."
    a "完全没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:7619
translate chinese start_f30692b3:

    # j "You’re not mad?"
    j "你不生气吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7625
translate chinese start_50fef805:

    # a "I’m not mad."
    a "我没生气。"

# game/script.rpy:7631
translate chinese start_74a07d2d:

    # a "Give me that."
    a "给我。"

# game/script.rpy:7633
translate chinese start_05cbcfa2:

    # "Anna grabbed the gas canister from my hands"
    "Anna 从我手里拿过汽油罐。"

# game/script.rpy:7634
translate chinese start_91b0d04f:

    # "She poured the gas out onto the clothes and shoes and Post-it notes, down to the last drop."
    "她把汽油浇在衣服、鞋子和便利贴上，一滴不剩。"

# game/script.rpy:7641
translate chinese start_9d791cdb:

    # "Then she tossed the canister aside and stepped away."
    "然后她把罐子丢到一边，退开了。"

# game/script.rpy:7642
translate chinese start_fd4396c7:

    # "The canister made a tinny, empty sound as it hit the concrete."
    "罐子磕在水泥地上，发出一声空空的金属响。"

# game/script.rpy:7643
translate chinese start_03e5d7ff:

    # "{i}Tunk. Tunk.{/i}"
    "{i}咚。咚。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7644
translate chinese start_8625fee7:

    # "After that there was silence."
    "之后就是一片安静。"

# game/script.rpy:7648
translate chinese start_c736142e:

    # j "Anna?"
    j "Anna？"

# game/script.rpy:7649
translate chinese start_bb7094da:

    # j "Should I...?"
    j "我该……？"

# game/script.rpy:7657
translate chinese start_fe6fb6e4:

    # a "What do you think you should do?"
    a "你觉得你该怎么做？"

# game/script.rpy:7659
translate chinese start_f4b88989:

    # j "Are you really not mad?"
    j "你真的不生气吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7665
translate chinese start_cf40bf80:

    # a "Do what you think you need to do, Jack."
    a "做你觉得该做的事，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:7670
translate chinese start_4a80bffa:

    # a "And do it quick. It’s growing dark, and I didn’t bring a flashlight."
    a "而且要快。天要黑了，我没带手电。"

# game/script.rpy:7672
translate chinese start_db97c3d1:

    # "So I did what I thought I needed to do."
    "于是我做了我以为该做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:7676
translate chinese start_9485caf3:

    # "I lit a match. It took me three tries to get it right, because of my clumsy fingers."
    "我划着一根火柴。手指太笨，划了三次才成。"

# game/script.rpy:7677
translate chinese start_eaec445e:

    # "Cradling the little fire with my hands, I brought it over {i}her{/i} things."
    "我用双手护着那簇小火苗，把它送到{i}她{/i}的东西上。"

# game/script.rpy:7678
translate chinese start_cf3661cb:

    # "They were wet and stank of gasoline."
    "它们湿透了，散发着汽油味。"

# game/script.rpy:7679
translate chinese start_bc2a8155:

    # "I held the lit match above them."
    "我把点燃的火柴举在它们上方。"

# game/script.rpy:7687
translate chinese start_fa0c8bac:

    # a "Why are you hesitating?"
    a "你在犹豫什么？"

# game/script.rpy:7692
translate chinese start_0e58b18f:

    # a "Don’t you want to do this?"
    a "你不想这么做吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7694
translate chinese start_010cf1f9_1:

    # j "I..."
    j "我……"

# game/script.rpy:7696
translate chinese start_1ad5b5d6:

    # "{i}I don’t know.{/i}"
    "呃，我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:7697
translate chinese start_176c2905:

    # "I {i}needed{/i} to do what Anna wanted me to do, but the thought of doing it made me want to lie down and cry."
    "我{i}必须{/i}做 Anna 要我做的事，可一想到要这么做，我就想躺下来大哭一场。"

# game/script.rpy:7698
translate chinese start_a02276b2:

    # "I couldn't explain why those things were so dear to me. They just were."
    "我说不清那些东西为什么对我那么珍贵。它们就是很珍贵。"

# game/script.rpy:7699
translate chinese start_fab8e7a2:

    # "The flame had almost reached my fingers."
    "火苗已经快烧到我的手指。"

# game/script.rpy:7701
translate chinese start_018b6e66:

    # j "Anna... I don’t think—"
    j "Anna……我觉得不——"

# game/script.rpy:7708
translate chinese start_d7016927:

    # a "Do it!"
    a "动手！"

# game/script.rpy:7712
translate chinese start_a932ff4f:

    # "I dropped the match."
    "我把火柴丢了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:7716
translate chinese start_cb744121:

    # "The little fire touched gasoline and bloomed."
    "小火苗碰到汽油，一下子炸开。"

# game/script.rpy:7720
translate chinese start_2829bd5f:

    # "The sudden heat made me step back."
    "突如其来的热浪逼得我后退一步。"

# game/script.rpy:7721
translate chinese start_b8f505f4:

    # "Those things—those shoes and clothes and little yellow notes—were already crackling and turning into charcoal."
    "那些东西——鞋、衣服、黄色的小纸条——已经噼啪作响，变成了焦炭。"

# game/script.rpy:7730
translate chinese start_880e6380:

    # "Anna stood by me."
    "Anna 站在我身边。"

# game/script.rpy:7731
translate chinese start_58d33484:

    # "I waited for her to scold me, but she didn’t."
    "我等着她骂我，但她没有。"

# game/script.rpy:7739
translate chinese start_778f526f:

    # "She put her hand in mine. Our fingers interlocked."
    "她把手放进我的手里。我们的手指交缠在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:7744
translate chinese start_656dcb7b:

    # a "You did well."
    a "你做得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:7746
translate chinese start_564b2596:

    # j "I did?"
    j "我做得好？"

# game/script.rpy:7751
translate chinese start_210c06eb_3:

    # a "Yes."
    a "是的。"

# game/script.rpy:7757
translate chinese start_4c2975f5:

    # a "When it came down to it, you did what you should."
    a "真到了那一步，你还是做了该做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:7762
translate chinese start_f73808c5:

    # a "I’m proud of you."
    a "我为你骄傲。"

# game/script.rpy:7769
translate chinese start_379b4e14:

    # "A warmth filled my chest. My worry for those scattered pieces of nothing on the ground faded away."
    "一股暖意充满胸口。对地上那些散落的、什么都不是的东西的挂念，消散了。"

# game/script.rpy:7770
translate chinese start_76f97636:

    # "I was with the love of my life, and she loved me and was proud of me. How could I care about some..."
    "我和我此生所爱在一起，她爱我，为我骄傲。我何必在意那些……"

# game/script.rpy:7771
translate chinese start_744a801f:

    # "I couldn’t even remember what it had been anymore. Old clothes?"
    "我甚至都不记得那是什么了。旧衣服？"

# game/script.rpy:7772
translate chinese start_6dac522e:

    # "Whatever."
    "算了。"

# game/script.rpy:7779
translate chinese start_4639b388:

    # "Anna giggled."
    "Anna 咯咯地笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:7784
translate chinese start_4b8f84a5:

    # a "Hahaha..."
    a "哈哈哈……"

# game/script.rpy:7789
translate chinese start_06a13f7b:

    # a "...Hahahahahahahaha!"
    a "……哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/script.rpy:7795
translate chinese start_380e4f63:

    # a "Aaaaaahahahahahahaha..."
    a "啊啊哈哈哈哈哈哈……"

# game/script.rpy:7799
translate chinese start_7d130959:

    # a "{i}AAAHAHHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHHAAHAAHAHAHA!{/i}"
    a "{i}啊啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7801
translate chinese start_2db2049e:

    # "It made me so glad to see Anna happy."
    "看到 Anna 开心，我也高兴极了。"

# game/script.rpy:7802
translate chinese start_da771758:

    # "I pulled her closer."
    "我把她搂得更近。"

# game/script.rpy:7803
translate chinese start_4169fa30:

    # "After a good minute of laughing, she sighed as if spent and looked up at me."
    "笑了足足一分钟，她像被抽空了似的叹了口气，抬头看我。"

# game/script.rpy:7811
translate chinese start_756a1dc0:

    # a "Wasn’t that fun?"
    a "是不是很好玩？"

# game/script.rpy:7813
translate chinese start_bb4c40c2:

    # j "Yep."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:7815
translate chinese start_2c9764f8:

    # "The things on the ground had already gone out. They were black and unrecognizable."
    "地上的东西已经熄了。烧得发黑，认不出来。"

# game/script.rpy:7820
translate chinese start_feead56f:

    # a "Let’s go back home."
    a "我们回家吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7822
translate chinese start_fc38c351:

    # j "Okay, Anna!"
    j "好，Anna！"

# game/script.rpy:7827
translate chinese start_c69793d0:

    # a "Haha! You’re so happy, aren’t you!"
    a "哈哈！你这么开心，是不是！"

# game/script.rpy:7833
translate chinese start_8ae452c3:

    # a "And why wouldn’t you be? I’m happy, too."
    a "你怎么会不开心呢？我也很开心。"

# game/script.rpy:7838
translate chinese start_43fab191:

    # a "The happiest I’ve ever been."
    a "我从没这么开心过。"

# game/script.rpy:7843
translate chinese start_75749591:

    # j "Me too. The happiest I’ve ever been."
    j "我也是。我从没这么开心过。"

# game/script.rpy:7848
translate chinese start_a7aa6170:

    # a "Really?"
    a "真的？"

# game/script.rpy:7850
translate chinese start_bb4c40c2_1:

    # j "Yep."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:7857
translate chinese start_137a49fd:

    # a "Thank you, Jack."
    a "……谢谢你，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:7862
translate chinese start_c04408a7:

    # a "That means the world to me."
    a "这对我来说意义重大。"

# game/script.rpy:7866
translate chinese start_ac7d166a:

    # "We went away hand in hand."
    "我们牵着手离开了。"

# game/script.rpy:7876
translate chinese start_5a24c315:

    # "But before we walked out into the grass again, I looked back one last time at the things I had burned."
    "但在再次走进草丛之前，我回头最后看了一眼我烧掉的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:7877
translate chinese start_42b909bf:

    # "Something moved at the edge of my vision, up in one of the glassless windows."
    "视野边缘，高处一扇没有玻璃的窗户里，有什么动了一下。"

# game/script.rpy:7878
translate chinese start_8204824c:

    # "I looked again, but it was gone."
    "我再看时，它已经不在了。"

# game/script.rpy:7890
translate chinese start_2cee83a9:

    # j "This place is dangerous."
    j "这地方很危险。"

# game/script.rpy:7895
translate chinese start_32fb53c2_1:

    # a "Hm?"
    a "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:7897
translate chinese start_34d9afe4:

    # j "Are there people here?"
    j "这里有人吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7902
translate chinese start_392522e3:

    # a "Ah... You know what? There just might be."
    a "啊……说起来，说不定还真有。"

# game/script.rpy:7907
translate chinese start_45314021:

    # a "Bad people. We should get home as soon as we can."
    a "坏人。我们得尽快回家。"

# game/script.rpy:7909
translate chinese start_9f64a2bd_1:

    # j "Yes."
    j "好。"

# game/script.rpy:7911
translate chinese start_2ad153d5:

    # "{i}Home.{/i}"
    "{i}家。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7912
translate chinese start_da9ba1db:

    # "{i}Where it’s safe.{/i}"
    "{i}回到安全的地方。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7926
translate chinese start_cd523c4f:

    # y "That little slut."
    y "那个小骚货。"

# game/script.rpy:7927
translate chinese start_e0639448:

    # y "I hope she had a good look at us burning all that trash of hers."
    y "希望她好好看清了，我们是怎么烧掉她那堆垃圾的。"

# game/script.rpy:7928
translate chinese start_73877fe9:

    # y "At Jack burning it!"
    y "看清是 Jack 亲手烧的！"

# game/script.rpy:7929
translate chinese start_12226768:

    # y "God, I’m so proud of him it hurts."
    y "天啊，我为他骄傲得心都疼了。"

# game/script.rpy:7931
translate chinese start_ebd23be4:

    # nvl clear
    # y "I can’t believe I miscalculated, though."
    nvl clear
    y "不过我简直不敢信，我居然算错了。"

# game/script.rpy:7934
translate chinese start_e8c84160:

    # y "I thought Grace was gone for good."
    y "我以为 Grace 再也不会回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:7955
translate chinese start_d8030aad:

    # y "But then there she was, in {i}our{/i} hallway, asking where Jack was, and what I had done with him."
    y "可后来她就站在那儿，站在{i}我们{/i}的走廊里，问 Jack 在哪儿，问我把他怎么了。"

# game/script.rpy:7956
translate chinese start_adfb86a4:

    # y "All this while Jack was right on the other side of the door."
    y "而那时候，Jack 就在门另一头。"

# game/script.rpy:7958
translate chinese start_a967a74a:

    # nvl clear
    # y "Can you imagine what would’ve happened if I wasn’t there?"
    nvl clear
    y "你能想象如果我不在，会发生什么吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7961
translate chinese start_024f672e:

    # y "She would’ve knocked on the door, or rung the doorbell. And she would’ve probably called out, too."
    y "她会敲门，或者按门铃。多半还会喊出声。"

# game/script.rpy:7962
translate chinese start_c53a1d7f:

    # y "It would’ve scared Jack so badly. I can’t bear to think about it."
    y "那会把 Jack 吓坏的。我都不敢想。"

# game/script.rpy:7964
translate chinese start_85f3cae3:

    # nvl clear
    # y "Thankfully I wasn’t wrong about {i}everything{/i} to do with her."
    nvl clear
    y "还好，关于她的事，我并不是{i}全都{/i}看错了。"

# game/script.rpy:7967
translate chinese start_b0c12a7e:

    # y "She hasn’t called the police. I knew she wouldn’t."
    y "她没报警。我就知道她不会。"

# game/script.rpy:7968
translate chinese start_5ebe0f6c:

    # y "I just didn’t think she’d come back at all!"
    y "我只是没想到她还会回来！"

# game/script.rpy:7970
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_90:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:7980
translate chinese start_d6233e17:

    # "She was still as scared as a little lamb."
    "她还是像只小羊羔一样怕得要命。"

# game/script.rpy:7981
translate chinese start_92aa8ac0:

    # "Her hands shook while she demanded I tell her what happened to Jack."
    "她逼问我 Jack 出了什么事，手一直在抖。"

# game/script.rpy:7991
translate chinese start_fd2ba843:

    # g "He—he can't be in there, can he?"
    g "他、他不会在里面吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8010
translate chinese start_fe95c101:

    # "She stepped forward, but when I put myself between the door and her, she backed off again."
    "她往前一步，可我挡在门和她之间，她又退了回去。"

# game/script.rpy:8011
translate chinese start_ebbb71ad:

    # "I wonder how she didn’t pee herself, she was so scared!"
    "她怕成那样，居然没尿裤子！"

# game/script.rpy:8018
translate chinese start_5ec99ccb:

    # a "Jack doesn’t want to see you."
    a "Jack 不想见你。"

# game/script.rpy:8025
translate chinese start_ec1bc46f:

    # g "What are you doing to him?"
    g "你对他做了什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8031
translate chinese start_7ce4a643:

    # g "No one’s seen him since I went away—it’s like he’s disappeared."
    g "我走以后就没人见过他了——就像凭空消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:8037
translate chinese start_eff65d7d:

    # g "He’s been {i}here{/i} the whole time? God, what are you doing to him?!"
    g "他一直{i}在这儿{/i}？天啊，你把他怎么样了？！"

# game/script.rpy:8043
translate chinese start_5b9a9ef5:

    # a "Be quiet."
    a "闭嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:8045
translate chinese start_20289c2c:

    # "She was making so much noise."
    "她吵得太厉害了。"

# game/script.rpy:8050
translate chinese start_0b91bc52:

    # "I put a hand on her shoulder. I had to see if she had the guts to slap it away."
    "我把手放在她肩上。我得看看她有没有胆子把它拍开。"

# game/script.rpy:8056
translate chinese start_3ad3f012:

    # "She just stood there."
    "她就那样站在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:8061
translate chinese start_d9f9c0c5:

    # a "Jack is perfectly fine."
    a "Jack 好得很。"

# game/script.rpy:8067
translate chinese start_1ab39abc:

    # a "He’s happy, and he doesn’t want to see you again."
    a "他很幸福，而且不想再见到你。"

# game/script.rpy:8073
translate chinese start_30aff13a_1:

    # g "I..."
    g "我……"

# game/script.rpy:8078
translate chinese start_d89ebc56:

    # g "...I know he probably hates me now, but at least let me see him."
    g "……我知道他现在大概恨我，但至少让我见他一面。"

# game/script.rpy:8084
translate chinese start_3956a3c7:

    # g "I have to at least see him again."
    g "我至少要再见他一次。"

# game/script.rpy:8089
translate chinese start_6dbe255c:

    # "So annoying!"
    "真烦人！"

# game/script.rpy:8090
translate chinese start_a49bc905:

    # "Loneliness has made her desperate. Unpleasant."
    "孤独把她逼得走投无路。真让人不快。"

# game/script.rpy:8091
translate chinese start_34cfa837:

    # "That’s what being by yourself does."
    "一个人待着就会变成这样。"

# game/script.rpy:8092
translate chinese start_7504df6f:

    # "Look at dear Jack."
    "看看亲爱的 Jack 吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8093
translate chinese start_62744b77:

    # "We’ve only been together again for a short while, and he’s already such a sweetheart. And he was so prickly before."
    "我们才重新在一起没多久，他就变得这么乖巧。之前还浑身是刺呢。"

# game/script.rpy:8099
translate chinese start_d6d0377d:

    # a "If you see him now, he’ll tell you he hates you."
    a "你现在见他，他会告诉你他恨你。"

# game/script.rpy:8105
translate chinese start_ac370281:

    # a "Do you really want that?"
    a "你真的想这样吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8111
translate chinese start_44b3ac8f:

    # g "No, I don’t want that, but..."
    g "不，我不想那样，可是……"

# game/script.rpy:8117
translate chinese start_9bf2d252:

    # a "Then go away."
    a "那就滚吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8123
translate chinese start_31e017ab:

    # a "It’s as simple as that, don’t you think?"
    a "就这么简单，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8128
translate chinese start_a4fa5b5e:

    # a "Even someone like you should understand."
    a "连你这种人应该也明白吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8134
translate chinese start_6c231df7_1:

    # g "Wh-Why are you so...?"
    g "你、你为什么这么……？"

# game/script.rpy:8140
translate chinese start_8a7124a1:

    # g "I thought we were..."
    g "我以为我们是……"

# game/script.rpy:8145
translate chinese start_c6e4afbe:

    # "She swallowed hard."
    "她用力咽了口口水。"

# game/script.rpy:8151
translate chinese start_0db07855:

    # g "I have to see him."
    g "我必须见他。"

# game/script.rpy:8156
translate chinese start_0ef5088c:

    # g "Anna, {i}please{/i}."
    g "Anna，{i}求你了{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:8163
translate chinese start_717c03f3_1:

    # a "Hmph."
    a "哼。"

# game/script.rpy:8169
translate chinese start_a091fa98:

    # a "Being alone made you into a real bitch, you know that?"
    a "一个人待着把你变成了个十足的贱人，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8177
translate chinese start_285e8505:

    # g "Wh-What?"
    g "什、什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8184
translate chinese start_f7668ee7:

    # a "Or did it? Were you lonely after all?"
    a "还是说没有？你到底孤不孤独？"

# game/script.rpy:8190
translate chinese start_94612c4f:

    # a "It really makes me wonder."
    a "真让我好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:8196
translate chinese start_ff333b71:

    # a "With how little money you took with you, I was sure you’d be living on the streets."
    a "你带走那么点钱，我还以为你肯定在街头流浪。"

# game/script.rpy:8201
translate chinese start_09b8d44f:

    # a "But you’re clean. You don’t smell... more than usual."
    a "可你挺干净。身上也没……比平时更臭。"

# game/script.rpy:8208
translate chinese start_fb5b730c:

    # g "I’m... living with a friend."
    g "我……跟一个朋友住。"

# game/script.rpy:8213
translate chinese start_7e156a68:

    # g "{i}What does it matter?{/i}"
    g "{i}这有什么关系？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8218
translate chinese start_63099432:

    # a "That’s a lie. You don’t have any friends."
    a "撒谎。你根本没有朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:8226
translate chinese start_8fc0ffe9:

    # "Grace gritted her teeth and glared at me."
    "Grace 咬紧牙关，瞪着我。"

# game/script.rpy:8227
translate chinese start_fa2dd1a4:

    # "She wanted to run away in shame—she’s so simple, so obvious—but she couldn’t leave with Jack so close."
    "她想羞愧地逃走——她那么简单，一看就透——可 Jack 就在这么近的地方，她走不了。"

# game/script.rpy:8232
translate chinese start_bbe80ec7:

    # a "So, where are you staying?"
    a "那你住哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:8237
translate chinese start_68f76910:

    # a "Whose cock are you sucking for rent?"
    a "你为了抵房租，在给谁舔鸡巴？"

# game/script.rpy:8244
translate chinese start_b3f89944:

    # g "I-I’m not—"
    g "我、我没有——"

# game/script.rpy:8249
translate chinese start_836e2ce2:

    # a "Is that wrinkly old man you worked with?"
    a "跟你一起打工的那个皱巴巴的老头？"

# game/script.rpy:8255
translate chinese start_1b4cfd64:

    # g "It’s nothing like that!"
    g "根本不是那样！"

# game/script.rpy:8262
translate chinese start_97fb4cb3:

    # g "...I {i}am{/i} living with Don, but... but I’m not..."
    g "……我{i}确实{/i}住在 Don 那儿，可……可我不是……"

# game/script.rpy:8267
translate chinese start_8c96bbb3:

    # a "Oh, aren’t you?"
    a "不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8273
translate chinese start_00a0266d:

    # a "Then how are you {i}paying back{/i} his hospitality?"
    a "那你打算怎么{i}报答{/i}他的收留？"

# game/script.rpy:8279
translate chinese start_f268f5a9:

    # a "You don’t have any money. You quit your job, too. I checked."
    a "你没钱。工作也辞了。我查过了。"

# game/script.rpy:8286
translate chinese start_441bced9:

    # g "I’m not paying back anything..."
    g "我根本没在还什么……"

# game/script.rpy:8293
translate chinese start_5b57639b:

    # a "Don’t be shy."
    a "别害羞嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:8303
translate chinese start_f42edd4c:

    # g "Oh, screw you!"
    g "去你的！"

# game/script.rpy:8308
translate chinese start_a9826c37:

    # g "Move!"
    g "让开！"

# game/script.rpy:8313
translate chinese start_000c28a7:

    # "How violent."
    "真粗暴。"

# game/script.rpy:8314
translate chinese start_40d1cab7:

    # "It’s a good thing I separated her and Jack when I did."
    "幸好我及时把她和 Jack 分开了。"

# game/script.rpy:8315
translate chinese start_aea399a7:

    # "Any more of this girl’s influence, and who knows what could’ve happened?"
    "再让这女孩影响他下去，谁知道会出什么事？"

# game/script.rpy:8324
translate chinese start_21de7618:

    # "She tried to shove past me, but I had a little surprise in my pocket."
    "她想硬从我身边挤过去，可我口袋里有个小惊喜。"

# game/script.rpy:8331
translate chinese start_3176ece4:

    # g "A-Anna, that’s...!"
    g "A-Anna，那是……！"

# game/script.rpy:8339
translate chinese start_fdc5b7df_1:

    # a "Yep."
    a "没错。"

# game/script.rpy:8344
translate chinese start_0c4cb54f:

    # a "So don’t you dare touch me again."
    a "所以别再碰我一下。"

# game/script.rpy:8349
translate chinese start_6eb315d2:

    # a "I might do something bad."
    a "我说不定会做出什么事来。"

# game/script.rpy:8354
translate chinese start_b621f040:

    # "I pressed the knife against the side of her neck."
    "我把刀贴在她脖子侧面。"

# game/script.rpy:8355
translate chinese start_b9f1377e:

    # "It drew blood—I couldn’t help myself!"
    "割出血了——我也控制不住自己！"

# game/script.rpy:8356
translate chinese start_67f8bb2c:

    # "But it wasn’t a lot."
    "但流得不多。"

# game/script.rpy:8357
translate chinese start_cf992de8:

    # "I’m not going to kill someone out in the open like that. I’m not stupid."
    "我才不会在大庭广众之下杀人。我不傻。"

# game/script.rpy:8358
translate chinese start_aecd2114:

    # "Grace stood petrified."
    "Grace 僵在原地。"

# game/script.rpy:8365
translate chinese start_45717184:

    # g "You... you can’t do this."
    g "你……你不能这样。"

# game/script.rpy:8371
translate chinese start_3c41f0b4:

    # g "I’ll..."
    g "我会……"

# game/script.rpy:8378
translate chinese start_fc348f76:

    # a "You’ll call the cops?"
    a "你要报警？"

# game/script.rpy:8383
translate chinese start_e25688b3:

    # a "No, you won’t."
    a "不，你不会的。"

# game/script.rpy:8388
translate chinese start_2d6d40c2:

    # a "They won’t believe you. They never do."
    a "他们不会信你的。从来不会。"

# game/script.rpy:8394
translate chinese start_8872a4ff:

    # a "Right?"
    a "对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8396
translate chinese start_12eaabb0:

    # "She didn’t lash out, for once."
    "这一次她居然没有发作。"

# game/script.rpy:8397
translate chinese start_0c280694:

    # "She must have finally realized how useless it was to try."
    "她大概终于明白，挣扎是没用的。"

# game/script.rpy:8401
translate chinese start_eef308b4:

    # "So she shuffled away."
    "于是她拖着步子走开了。"

# game/script.rpy:8407
translate chinese start_30374646:

    # "I waved her off—it’s only polite. She didn’t even look back."
    "我挥手送她走——这是礼貌。她连头都没回。"

# game/script.rpy:8413
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_91:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8419
translate chinese start_690edded:

    # y "But then she kept following me around, even after that."
    y "可从那以后，她还是跟着我转。"

# game/script.rpy:8420
translate chinese start_20da6acf:

    # y "What a stalker!"
    y "真是个跟踪狂！"

# game/script.rpy:8422
translate chinese start_7cfdafd3:

    # nvl clear
    # y "So I had Jack burn her things. I know she was watching."
    nvl clear
    y "所以我让 Jack 烧了她的东西。我知道她看着。"

# game/script.rpy:8425
translate chinese start_354d5575:

    # y "It was beautiful."
    y "真美。"

# game/script.rpy:8426
translate chinese start_fce5af96:

    # y "Now she’ll back off for good."
    y "现在她该彻底退开了。"

# game/script.rpy:8428
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_92:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8447
translate chinese start_754d6c74:

    # a "I’m back~"
    a "我回来啦～"

# game/script.rpy:8449
translate chinese start_0f0cd25c:

    # j "Welcome back!"
    j "你回来啦！"

# game/script.rpy:8462
translate chinese start_4ce39664:

    # a "Hey, easy. You’ll trip."
    a "嘿，慢点。你会绊倒的。"

# game/script.rpy:8467
translate chinese start_588bcb26:

    # "The moment she touched me, those long hours of waiting were painted over by warmth."
    "她一碰到我，那漫长几个小时的等待就被暖意盖了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:8468
translate chinese start_f6a263fb:

    # "It made me so happy."
    "那让我高兴极了。"

# game/script.rpy:8475
translate chinese start_12b5c9eb:

    # a "Something smells good."
    a "什么东西闻起来好香。"

# game/script.rpy:8481
translate chinese start_9742b026:

    # a "Is it dinner?"
    a "是晚饭吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8483
translate chinese start_9f64a2bd_2:

    # j "Yes."
    j "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:8489
translate chinese start_3dc5832a:

    # a "Oh, you remembered!"
    a "噢，你还记得！"

# game/script.rpy:8494
translate chinese start_b5a4b049:

    # a "I’m so glad."
    a "我真高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:8502
translate chinese start_fdc3ea2e:

    # "I’d made a casserole."
    "我做了一锅焗菜。"

# game/script.rpy:8503
translate chinese start_3af2a111:

    # "Anna set the table, and I served it."
    "Anna 摆好桌子，我把菜端上去。"

# game/script.rpy:8512
translate chinese start_b5f85f83:

    # a "Mmmn."
    a "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:8518
translate chinese start_21197796:

    # a "That was {i}really{/i} tasty, Jack."
    a "那真是{i}太好吃了{/i}，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:8523
translate chinese start_9a6fb353:

    # j "Thank you."
    j "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:8525
translate chinese start_f23f5dc5:

    # "I wasn’t happy with the meal."
    "我对这顿饭并不满意。"

# game/script.rpy:8526
translate chinese start_dde2b956:

    # "It was tasteless. And the meat was tough."
    "没什么味道。肉还很老。"

# game/script.rpy:8527
translate chinese start_cc046310:

    # "But Anna said she liked it."
    "可 Anna 说她喜欢。"

# game/script.rpy:8528
translate chinese start_da35ef61:

    # "She was so kind."
    "她真好。"

# game/script.rpy:8530
translate chinese start_13b22386:

    # j "I wish I could help more."
    j "我希望能多帮上点忙。"

# game/script.rpy:8535
translate chinese start_2813e28f:

    # a "What do you mean?"
    a "什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:8537
translate chinese start_9ed5b5fd:

    # j "With... with money, I guess."
    j "钱……钱方面吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8543
translate chinese start_00a25a8d:

    # "I was being serious, but she laughed. That made me feel a bit stupid."
    "我是认真的，她却笑了。这让我觉得自己有点傻。"

# game/script.rpy:8549
translate chinese start_329ae074:

    # a "Oh, Jack. Money’s no problem at all."
    a "噢，Jack。钱根本不是问题。"

# game/script.rpy:8555
translate chinese start_869282f6:

    # a "I told you already I’ve got a lot saved up. And the rent here is nothing."
    a "我跟你说过了，我存了不少。而且这儿的房租等于不要钱。"

# game/script.rpy:8557
translate chinese start_e87529f8:

    # j "Oh, okay..."
    j "好……"

# game/script.rpy:8562
translate chinese start_9d0951c7:

    # "Anna hummed contentedly."
    "Anna 满足地哼了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:8567
translate chinese start_0ef59c5c:

    # "A minute later she stopped."
    "一分钟后她停了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:8573
translate chinese start_e78f5693:

    # a "There is something you can do, actually."
    a "其实，确实有件事你能做。"

# game/script.rpy:8575
translate chinese start_0d724a51_2:

    # j "Really?"
    j "真的？"

# game/script.rpy:8581
translate chinese start_eccfb68f:

    # a "Yes, really."
    a "是的，真的。"

# game/script.rpy:8587
translate chinese start_ac0bdbb9:

    # a "Ah, but... I’m not sure if you’d be up to it."
    a "啊，不过……我不确定你愿不愿意。"

# game/script.rpy:8589
translate chinese start_d0fb45ff:

    # j "Anything!"
    j "什么都行！"

# game/script.rpy:8590
translate chinese start_e6d72fe6:

    # j "I’ll do anything for you."
    j "我愿意为你做任何事。"

# game/script.rpy:8596
translate chinese start_9597dd09:

    # a "Okay, then."
    a "好吧，就这样了。"

# game/script.rpy:8598
translate chinese start_858a9a82:

    # j "What is it? How can I help?"
    j "是什么？我怎么帮？"

# game/script.rpy:8603
translate chinese start_d516e947:

    # a "Wait until before bedtime, okay?"
    a "等到睡前再说，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8605
translate chinese start_35bf5a71_1:

    # "I nodded."
    "我点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:8620
translate chinese start_79085c2d:

    # "When I heard what she wanted me to do, I didn’t take it well."
    "听到她要我做的事，我反应很大。"

# game/script.rpy:8621
translate chinese start_73520697:

    # "I was angry. Furious."
    "我生气了。勃然大怒。"

# game/script.rpy:8622
translate chinese start_419ced78:

    # "I felt betrayed."
    "我觉得被背叛了。"

# game/script.rpy:8632
translate chinese start_15d60cef:

    # j "You want me to..."
    j "你想让我……"

# game/script.rpy:8637
translate chinese start_4e9e4e60:

    # a "Yes, I do."
    a "是的，我想。"

# game/script.rpy:8642
translate chinese start_b1ccf0bb:

    # j "But... no!"
    j "可是……不行！"

# game/script.rpy:8643
translate chinese start_0c4e86ca:

    # j "You said... you said I’d never have to remember anything."
    j "你说过……你说过我永远不用再想起任何事。"

# game/script.rpy:8644
translate chinese start_1a0da326:

    # j "You promised!"
    j "你答应过的！"

# game/script.rpy:8655
translate chinese start_6dd1f99c:

    # "I got up from the bed and started pacing from wall to wall, never looking at Anna."
    "我从床上起来，在屋里来回踱步，一次也不看 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:8656
translate chinese start_82301b13:

    # "What she’d said hurt."
    "她的话刺痛了我。"

# game/script.rpy:8658
translate chinese start_2deb2203:

    # j "How could you lie like that?!"
    j "你怎么能这样骗我？！"

# game/script.rpy:8665
translate chinese start_ffc69412:

    # a "Oh, baby."
    a "噢，宝贝。"

# game/script.rpy:8670
translate chinese start_dd01c2a3:

    # a "Please don’t hate me."
    a "求你别恨我。"

# game/script.rpy:8674
translate chinese start_7bb03b13:

    # "I was shivering with anger. I thought I might faint."
    "我气得发抖，觉得自己快要晕过去。"

# game/script.rpy:8675
translate chinese start_cb2703db:

    # "...But I didn’t hate her."
    "……但我没有恨她。"

# game/script.rpy:8676
translate chinese start_a552ba95:

    # "I couldn’t."
    "我做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:8677
translate chinese start_f025e5fc:

    # "So I stopped walking and faced her."
    "于是我停下脚步，转身面对她。"

# game/script.rpy:8692
translate chinese start_39e6217a:

    # a "I know I said what I said, but this is important."
    a "我知道我说过那样的话，可这件事很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:8697
translate chinese start_ae7cca3b:

    # a "Don’t you believe me?"
    a "你不相信？"

# game/script.rpy:8699
translate chinese start_20abf0cf:

    # "There was only one thing I could say."
    "我只能说一句话。"

# game/script.rpy:8701
translate chinese start_984f6b91_4:

    # j "...Yeah."
    j "……嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:8702
translate chinese start_920baa84:

    # j "I believe you."
    j "我相信你。"

# game/script.rpy:8708
translate chinese start_b7b58ac8:

    # a "Thank you, Jack. I love you."
    a "谢谢你，Jack。我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:8710
translate chinese start_64b9ff08:

    # j "I love you, too."
    j "我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:8716
translate chinese start_f085df6c:

    # a "And I’m sorry."
    a "我很抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:8718
translate chinese start_7cc10c66:

    # j "Don’t...!"
    j "别……！"

# game/script.rpy:8719
translate chinese start_c4afc19d:

    # j "Don’t say you’re..."
    j "别说你……"

# game/script.rpy:8721
translate chinese start_69338f27:

    # "Hearing Anna say she was sorry was, for some reason, like a punch to the gut."
    "听到 Anna 道歉，不知为什么，像肚子上挨了一拳。"

# game/script.rpy:8722
translate chinese start_af076aee:

    # "It tugged at my memory."
    "它扯动了我的记忆。"

# game/script.rpy:8724
translate chinese start_8d507e92:

    # j "She... she always said..."
    j "她……她总是说……"

# game/script.rpy:8729
translate chinese start_f692bdb7:

    # a "I know."
    a "我知道。"

# game/script.rpy:8734
translate chinese start_8b31ca21:

    # a "But that’s not what I’m telling you to remember."
    a "但我要你想起来的不是那个。"

# game/script.rpy:8742
translate chinese start_4c4b514e:

    # a "You must never remember that woman. Forget all you have left of her."
    a "你绝对不可以想起那个女人。把她剩下的全都忘掉。"

# game/script.rpy:8744
translate chinese start_1dd75ccc:

    # j "Then...?"
    j "那……？"

# game/script.rpy:8752
translate chinese start_f69673f2:

    # a "What I want you to recall goes... much, much further back."
    a "要追溯到久远得多、久远得多的过去。"

# game/script.rpy:8757
translate chinese start_0d1481b2:

    # a "It won’t be easy, but when you do... when you remember... our love will be the deepest it’s ever been."
    a "这不容易，但等你做到了……等你想起来……我们的爱会比任何时候都深。"

# game/script.rpy:8764
translate chinese start_56dbd409:

    # a "Don’t you want that?"
    a "你不想要吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8766
translate chinese start_90a488b2:

    # j "I do."
    j "我想要。"

# game/script.rpy:8767
translate chinese start_c137f251:

    # j "I love you."
    j "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:8768
translate chinese start_7f68fa20:

    # j "I want that—I want to love you even more."
    j "我想要那样——我想更爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:8769
translate chinese start_e99c3bbf:

    # j "Tell me what I should remember."
    j "告诉我该想起什么。"

# game/script.rpy:8780
translate chinese start_1714f652:

    # n "Anna embraced me with happy tears in her eyes. But she wouldn’t tell me what I needed to remember."
    n "Anna 眼里含着喜极而泣的泪水抱住我。可她不肯告诉我要我记住的是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:8781
translate chinese start_d6ec5d9e:

    # n "She said it would be pointless if she told me. I had to remember it all by myself."
    n "她说，如果她告诉我，就没有意义了。我必须自己想起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8783
translate chinese start_6c6c833c:

    # nvl clear
    # n "Anna ordered me to sit down in front of the alarm clock every day for at least an hour."
    nvl clear
    n "Anna 要我每天坐在闹钟前，至少一个钟头。"

# game/script.rpy:8786
translate chinese start_46323d6a:

    # n "I was to do this while she was at work."
    n "要趁她上班的时候做。"

# game/script.rpy:8787
translate chinese start_ed928099:

    # n "I was to have my eyes closed."
    n "要闭着眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:8788
translate chinese start_c526bbad:

    # n "I was to try digging back in my memories."
    n "要试着往记忆深处挖。"

# game/script.rpy:8789
translate chinese start_37206c9f:

    # n "Far, far back."
    n "挖到很远、很远的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:8791
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_93:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8799
translate chinese start_7a4cfec4:

    # n "I did as ordered."
    n "我照做了。"

# game/script.rpy:8801
translate chinese start_c100aa6a:

    # nvl clear
    # n "But the first time I tried—the very next day—it was all so foggy in my mind that I couldn’t even start."
    nvl clear
    n "可第一次尝试——就是第二天——脑子里一片雾，我连开头都做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:8804
translate chinese start_fddf1469:

    # n "Thinking felt slow. It was like walking through molasses."
    n "思考变得很慢。像在糖浆里走路。"

# game/script.rpy:8805
translate chinese start_786da79e:

    # n "I only made myself tired."
    n "我只把自己弄累了。"

# game/script.rpy:8806
translate chinese start_aeae6011:

    # n "Before I fell asleep sitting up, one last thought came to me."
    n "坐着睡着之前，最后一个念头浮现出来。"

# game/script.rpy:8807
translate chinese start_c3a542dd:

    # n "{i}Was thinking always so hard?{/i}"
    n "{i}思考一直都这么费劲吗？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8809
translate chinese start_42ddeb1c:

    # nvl clear
    # n "{w=1.5}The second time, too, I gave up right away."
    nvl clear
    n "{w=1.5}第二次，我也一样马上就放弃了。"

# game/script.rpy:8813
translate chinese start_603ab932:

    # n "I couldn't do it."
    n "我做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:8814
translate chinese start_345c6ab6:

    # n "But I had promised Anna."
    n "可我答应过 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:8815
translate chinese start_f8e6c578:

    # n "The next day, I tried harder."
    n "第二天，我更用力地试。"

# game/script.rpy:8817
translate chinese start_5af78e6c:

    # nvl clear
    # n "My head hurt, and I felt like I was groping in the dark, scared and all alone."
    nvl clear
    n "我的头很疼，像在黑暗里摸索，害怕，而且孤零零的。"

# game/script.rpy:8820
translate chinese start_a4010a95:

    # n "But I did it."
    n "但我做到了。"

# game/script.rpy:8821
translate chinese start_1fed5cd7:

    # n "I had promised Anna."
    n "我答应过 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:8822
translate chinese start_f8eaed83:

    # n "I waded further in."
    n "我往更深处蹚去。"

# game/script.rpy:8824
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_94:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8842
translate chinese start_84920b91:

    # n "A flash of a smile made my chest hurt."
    n "一个笑容一闪而过，让我的胸口发疼。"

# game/script.rpy:8843
translate chinese start_f620bc0b:

    # n "But I kept going."
    n "但我继续下去。"

# game/script.rpy:8844
translate chinese start_eb7874bf:

    # n "For love."
    n "为了爱。"

# game/script.rpy:8846
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_95:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8850
translate chinese start_bb1f1aa2:

    # n "{i}...Huh?{/i}"
    n "{i}……咦？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8851
translate chinese start_32331280:

    # n "{i}Which one did I love?{/i}"
    n "{i}我爱的是哪一个？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8852
translate chinese start_b05ad4df:

    # n "{i}Which one did I hate...?{/i}"
    n "{i}我恨的又是哪一个……？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8854
translate chinese start_f6d76ba9:

    # nvl clear
    # n "{i}Things didn't use to be like this, did they?{/i}"
    nvl clear
    n "{i}从前不是这样的，对吧？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8858
translate chinese start_666d1211:

    # nvl clear
    # n "{i}This feels wrong.{/i}"
    nvl clear
    n "{i}这不对劲。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8861
translate chinese start_6e5c88c7:

    # n "{i}Something went terribly wrong.{/i}"
    n "{i}有什么地方出了大错。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8862
translate chinese start_874bf963:

    # n "{i}I need to make sense of it.{/i}"
    n "{i}我必须把它理清楚。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:8864
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_96:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8875
translate chinese start_5298b508:

    # n "Days later, while going back in my memory, I reached a wall."
    n "几天之后，往回挖的时候，我撞上了一堵墙。"

# game/script.rpy:8876
translate chinese start_22bb562b:

    # n "A dam."
    n "一座坝。"

# game/script.rpy:8877
translate chinese start_9b8c10e0:

    # n "I felt I shouldn't try to climb over it, so I didn't."
    n "我觉得不该翻过去，就没翻。"

# game/script.rpy:8878
translate chinese start_5c535ca3:

    # n "There were things out there I didn't want to see."
    n "墙那边有些我不想看见的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:8880
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_97:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8885
translate chinese start_cb504d4b:

    # n "So I went back to the puddle I'd been searching through."
    n "于是我退回那摊一直在翻找的水洼里。"

# game/script.rpy:8889
translate chinese start_fc912790:

    # n "It was a stew of love and fear and hate, given and taken seemingly at random."
    n "那是一锅爱、恐惧与恨的乱炖，给予和索取都像是随机的。"

# game/script.rpy:8890
translate chinese start_88b26fde:

    # n "It was a mess."
    n "那是一团乱麻。"

# game/script.rpy:8891
translate chinese start_3c44e536:

    # n "But it was a mess in {i}my{/i} head."
    n "可那是{i}我{/i}脑子里的一团乱麻。"

# game/script.rpy:8892
translate chinese start_5230b021:

    # n "I would make it make sense."
    n "我会理清它。"

# game/script.rpy:8894
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_98:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:8921
translate chinese start_5d7281ff:

    # a "Ja~ck!"
    a "Ja~ck！"

# game/script.rpy:8923
translate chinese start_d9e51776:

    # j "Yes, Anna?"
    j "怎么了，Anna？"

# game/script.rpy:8935
translate chinese start_b1ab83d8:

    # a "I’m going to work. Aren’t you going to say bye?"
    a "我要去上班了。你不跟我说再见吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8937
translate chinese start_9995d971:

    # j "Oh. Bye, Anna."
    j "噢。再见，Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:8943
translate chinese start_138a3dfa:

    # a "And a goodbye kiss?"
    a "还有告别的吻呢？"

# game/script.rpy:8951
translate chinese start_e7bc9f9b_1:

    # "We kissed."
    "我们接了吻。"

# game/script.rpy:8956
translate chinese start_ba242ca9:

    # "Anna placed a hand on my forehead."
    "Anna 把手放在我额头上。"

# game/script.rpy:8961
translate chinese start_8e20dbf6:

    # a "Are you okay? You might have a fever."
    a "你没事吧？你可能发烧了。"

# game/script.rpy:8966
translate chinese start_dd68ac19:

    # a "I can give you something for that."
    a "我可以给你点药。"

# game/script.rpy:8968
translate chinese start_b799ab6b:

    # "I smiled."
    "我笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:8970
translate chinese start_c4d26428:

    # j "I’m okay!"
    j "我没事！"

# game/script.rpy:8971
translate chinese start_6d0ca900:

    # j "It’s just..."
    j "只是……"

# game/script.rpy:8977
translate chinese start_0d671fa0:

    # a "What is it? Trouble?"
    a "怎么了？出什么事了？"

# game/script.rpy:8982
translate chinese start_828b01e9:

    # a "You can tell me anything."
    a "什么都可以跟我说。"

# game/script.rpy:8984
translate chinese start_a3e427d1:

    # j "Um... Do you know that sandwich shop?"
    j "呃……你知道那家三明治店吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8990
translate chinese start_b8e61764:

    # a "Which one?"
    a "哪一家？"

# game/script.rpy:8992
translate chinese start_69b8e251:

    # j "Next to the... where I..."
    j "就在那家……我之前……"

# game/script.rpy:8998
translate chinese start_479a4f95:

    # a "Next to the store?"
    a "店旁边那家？"

# game/script.rpy:9000
translate chinese start_35bf5a71_2:

    # "I nodded."
    "我点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:9006
translate chinese start_90bcea38:

    # a "You want a sandwich from there?"
    a "你想吃那儿的三明治？"

# game/script.rpy:9008
translate chinese start_fcceffc0_2:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:9009
translate chinese start_c648fd3c:

    # j "If that's okay."
    j "如果可以的话。"

# game/script.rpy:9015
translate chinese start_c185e831:

    # a "Well... there {i}is{/i} always a huge line there..."
    a "那个……那儿{i}总是{/i}排很长的队……"

# game/script.rpy:9017
translate chinese start_3cda1452:

    # j "Please, Anna?"
    j "求你了？"

# game/script.rpy:9018
translate chinese start_fe242e5a:

    # j "It would mean a lot to me."
    j "这对我很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:9024
translate chinese start_816849e1:

    # a "Oh, how can I resist?"
    a "噢，我怎么拒绝得了？"

# game/script.rpy:9029
translate chinese start_0260e0b4:

    # a "Of course, darling. I’ll get you anything."
    a "当然，亲爱的。你想要什么我都给你买。"

# game/script.rpy:9035
translate chinese start_bcdae304:

    # a "What kind of sandwich do you want?"
    a "你要哪种三明治？"

# game/script.rpy:9037
translate chinese start_4df3525d:

    # j "Anything you pick."
    j "你挑就好。"

# game/script.rpy:9042
translate chinese start_954b4cb6:

    # a "Hmm."
    a "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:9047
translate chinese start_1ccb0082:

    # a "I’ll get you something light."
    a "我给你买点清淡的。"

# game/script.rpy:9053
translate chinese start_eb130730:

    # a "You’re not getting much exercise. I don’t want you to get fat."
    a "你运动得太少。我可不想你变胖。"

# game/script.rpy:9059
translate chinese start_5f7df103:

    # a "Is that all right?"
    a "这样可以吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9064
translate chinese start_ff10fc7f:

    # j "Yep!"
    j "嗯！"

# game/script.rpy:9070
translate chinese start_fef4dd9d:

    # a "Great."
    a "太好了！"

# game/script.rpy:9075
translate chinese start_4a87817e:

    # a "And don’t forget your remembering session."
    a "别忘了你的“回想课”。"

# game/script.rpy:9080
translate chinese start_4306e521:

    # a "You’ve been doing those, right?"
    a "你一直在做吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9082
translate chinese start_fcceffc0_3:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:9088
translate chinese start_4d679efb_1:

    # a "And?"
    a "然后呢？"

# game/script.rpy:9090
translate chinese start_5de26d45:

    # "I frowned and shook my head."
    "我皱着眉摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:9096
translate chinese start_81fdebf9:

    # a "Nothing yet?"
    a "还没有？"

# game/script.rpy:9101
translate chinese start_c696ec41:

    # a "Oh, well. It’s not even been two weeks yet."
    a "噢，算了。还不到两个星期呢。"

# game/script.rpy:9107
translate chinese start_480e4bae:

    # a "You’ll get there soon. I’m sure you will."
    a "你很快就能做到的。我相信你。"

# game/script.rpy:9109
translate chinese start_0d927604:

    # j "Yeah. I will."
    j "嗯，我会的。"

# game/script.rpy:9113
translate chinese start_2e702329:

    # "Anna pinched my cheek, kissed me again, and left."
    "Anna 捏了捏我的脸，又吻了我一下，走了。"

# game/script.rpy:9121
translate chinese start_6445d69b:

    # "And I went and threw up in the toilet."
    "然后我去卫生间吐了。"

# game/script.rpy:9123
translate chinese start_c48454be:

    # j "Oh, God."
    j "噢，天啊。"

# game/script.rpy:9125
translate chinese start_469e3260:

    # "I brushed my teeth and washed my mouth three times over."
    "我刷了牙，漱了三遍口。"

# game/script.rpy:9129
translate chinese start_ab88f17d:

    # j "I can’t... I can’t go on like this."
    j "我受不了……我不能再这样下去了。"

# game/script.rpy:9131
translate chinese start_0890374e:

    # "I couldn’t keep living here."
    "我不能再住在这里了。"

# game/script.rpy:9139
translate chinese start_f95ca9ad:

    # "I waited ten minutes, until I was sure Anna was gone."
    "我等了十分钟，确认 Anna 已经走了。"

# game/script.rpy:9140
translate chinese start_36a1de30:

    # "Then I pulled back the heavy curtains."
    "然后我拉开了厚重的窗帘。"

# game/script.rpy:9148
translate chinese start_971db37c:

    # "Down on the street there was a single person, looking sad and abandoned."
    "街上只有一个身影，看上去落寞又无依。"

# game/script.rpy:9149
translate chinese start_38e73957:

    # "I waved at her."
    "我朝她挥手。"

# game/script.rpy:9150
translate chinese start_9dd6230e:

    # "She looked up, nodded, and walked into the building."
    "她抬起头，点了点头，走进了楼里。"

# game/script.rpy:9172
translate chinese start_7dc0e46f:

    # g "Hi, Jack."
    g "嗨，Jack！"

# game/script.rpy:9177
translate chinese start_aaf97b6f:

    # "I was so happy to see her I wanted to cry."
    "看到她，我高兴得想哭。"

# game/script.rpy:9179
translate chinese start_bbece5d7:

    # j "Oh, Grace..."
    j "噢，Grace……"

# game/script.rpy:9185
translate chinese start_02b02090:

    # n "We’d started seeing each other in secret five days ago."
    n "五天前，我们开始偷偷见面。"

# game/script.rpy:9186
translate chinese start_18b5d70d:

    # n "I knew how long exactly—I had started counting the days again."
    n "我清楚记得有多久——我又开始数日子了。"

# game/script.rpy:9187
translate chinese start_c5e9e05f:

    # n "That big cloud of confusion in my brain was gone."
    n "脑子里那团混沌的雾散了。"

# game/script.rpy:9188
translate chinese start_833e3019:

    # n "I wasn’t Anna’s dog anymore."
    n "我不再是 Anna 的狗了。"

# game/script.rpy:9190
translate chinese start_667c3842:

    # nvl clear
    # n "It was Anna's own fault."
    nvl clear
    n "那是 Anna 自己的错。"

# game/script.rpy:9193
translate chinese start_2c700723:

    # n "What else could she expect, having me dig around my past like that?"
    n "让我那样去刨过去，她还能指望什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9195
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_99:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:9203
translate chinese start_ad455d20:

    # n "But it was scary how close I’d come to letting go."
    n "可我离彻底放弃只差一点点，想想都后怕。"

# game/script.rpy:9204
translate chinese start_c0e6d2fa:

    # n "If things were a bit different, I might have kept on being a half-mute idiot forever."
    n "要是稍有不同，我可能就永远当那个半哑的傻子了。"

# game/script.rpy:9205
translate chinese start_64b6da76:

    # n "And I never would have let Grace inside."
    n "也永远不会让 Grace 进来。"

# game/script.rpy:9207
translate chinese start_b5ff4acf:

    # nvl clear
    # n "When I first heard Grace's voice again, I thought I’d finally snapped."
    nvl clear
    n "再次听到 Grace 的声音时，我以为自己终于疯了。"

# game/script.rpy:9210
translate chinese start_b1d3d901:

    # n "I thought I was hallucinating."
    n "我以为自己出现了幻觉。"

# game/script.rpy:9211
translate chinese start_ad1c8346:

    # n "But I opened the door, and there she was."
    n "可我开了门，她就在那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:9213
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_100:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:9234
translate chinese start_b057c731:

    # j "Grace...?"
    j "Grace……？"

# game/script.rpy:9235
translate chinese start_212f426a:

    # j "Grace, I’m... I’m so happy to see you."
    j "Grace，我……我太高兴见到你了。"

# game/script.rpy:9236
translate chinese start_82144e05:

    # j "I thought..."
    j "我以为……"

# game/script.rpy:9241
translate chinese start_b75b1cd2:

    # j "After your message, I thought I’d never..."
    j "看了你留的信，我以为我再也不会……"

# game/script.rpy:9247
translate chinese start_edb71dcb:

    # g "Don’t say that!"
    g "不，别这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:9253
translate chinese start_b8f6c8c2:

    # g "Don’t say anything... just for a minute."
    g "什么也别说……就一分钟。"

# game/script.rpy:9257
translate chinese start_295af2f3:

    # "We put our arms around each other."
    "我们相互搂住了对方。"

# game/script.rpy:9258
translate chinese start_aad83eb3:

    # "We’d only been apart for a few weeks, but so many things had happened that it felt like years."
    "我们才分开几个星期，可发生了太多事，像过了好几年。"

# game/script.rpy:9269
translate chinese start_9509a788:

    # g "I knew it... You don’t hate me."
    g "我就知道……你不恨我。"

# game/script.rpy:9271
translate chinese start_98c6c13b:

    # "I didn’t know what she was talking about, and I didn’t really care."
    "我不知道她在说什么，也不太在意。"

# game/script.rpy:9272
translate chinese start_96f17334:

    # "Only one thing mattered right now."
    "现在只有一件事要紧。"

# game/script.rpy:9274
translate chinese start_c0e87736:

    # j "Let’s go."
    j "我们走。"

# game/script.rpy:9275
translate chinese start_49175573:

    # j "Let’s... get out of here."
    j "我们……离开这儿吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9277
translate chinese start_af7dfccf:

    # "I’d been working up the courage to leave, ever since I had become myself again."
    "自从重新变回我自己，我一直在攒离开的勇气。"

# game/script.rpy:9278
translate chinese start_9af04894:

    # "As stupid as it seemed, I was afraid of going outside."
    "说来可笑，我怕出门。"

# game/script.rpy:9279
translate chinese start_2fdef8ae:

    # "But with Grace here, I could leave—I could do anything."
    "可有 Grace 在，我就能走——什么都能做。"

# game/script.rpy:9285
translate chinese start_ac3343b3:

    # g "We... can't."
    g "我们……不能。"

# game/script.rpy:9287
translate chinese start_9fbca821_1:

    # j "Huh?"
    j "啊？"

# game/script.rpy:9292
translate chinese start_ef347c33:

    # g "You’re not going to leave here."
    g "你不能离开这里。"

# game/script.rpy:9297
translate chinese start_1d0a02dd_1:

    # g "Not yet."
    g "还不行。"

# game/script.rpy:9299
translate chinese start_0a1c2e27:

    # j "Why not?!"
    j "为什么不行？！"

# game/script.rpy:9300
translate chinese start_6ba7b0c0:

    # j "Do you have any idea what it’s like for me in here?"
    j "你知道我在这儿过的是什么日子吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9306
translate chinese start_62b9bb5b:

    # g "I can’t imagine, Jack. And I’m so, so sorry I didn’t believe you."
    g "我无法想象，Jack。我太抱歉了，当初没信你。"

# game/script.rpy:9311
translate chinese start_c43b1c79:

    # g "You knew how dangerous Anna was right from the start."
    g "你从一开始就知道 Anna 有多危险。"

# game/script.rpy:9313
translate chinese start_4bda487e:

    # j "That’s all the more reason to get the hell away."
    j "那就更该赶紧跑。"

# game/script.rpy:9320
translate chinese start_9a95c91d:

    # g "I told you, not yet."
    g "我说了，还不行。"

# game/script.rpy:9327
translate chinese start_f9efd990:

    # g "This isn’t something we can run away from."
    g "这件事不是逃就能躲开的。"

# game/script.rpy:9334
translate chinese start_b2fcd71d:

    # g "I so wish we could just pack up and leave, but..."
    g "我多希望能收拾东西一走了之，可是……"

# game/script.rpy:9341
translate chinese start_947dd035:

    # g "...Anna is going to follow us wherever we go."
    g "……不管我们去哪儿，Anna 都会跟着。"

# game/script.rpy:9346
translate chinese start_376730e8:

    # j "God{i}dammit!{/i}" with vpunch
    j "{i}该死！{/i}" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:9348
translate chinese start_34ad3c2d:

    # "I stomped on the ground like an angry child."
    "我像个生气的孩子一样跺了跺脚。"

# game/script.rpy:9349
translate chinese start_f4e843ff:

    # "Grace was right. Anna had followed me here. If we left now she’d do it again."
    "Grace 说得对。Anna 跟着我来了这儿。我们现在走，她还会再来一次。"

# game/script.rpy:9351
translate chinese start_86485320:

    # j "We have to report her to the—"
    j "我们得去报警，找警察——"

# game/script.rpy:9357
translate chinese start_30c38302:

    # g "No, Jack. No police."
    g "不行，Jack。不能报警。"

# game/script.rpy:9364
translate chinese start_855d9996:

    # g "They’d trust her first, a million times over."
    g "他们会先信她，一千万次都会先信她。"

# game/script.rpy:9366
translate chinese start_c39a1faf:

    # j "I guess they would..."
    j "大概真会……"

# game/script.rpy:9368
translate chinese start_55dcfa68:

    # "Besides, I wasn’t even sure if she’d done anything actually illegal."
    "再说，我甚至不确定她做过的算不算真的违法。"

# game/script.rpy:9370
translate chinese start_e40cb386:

    # j "...But what, then?"
    j "那怎么办呢？"

# game/script.rpy:9371
translate chinese start_ccf555e5:

    # j "What do we do?"
    j "我们该怎么办？"

# game/script.rpy:9377
translate chinese start_671043f4:

    # g "I don’t know!"
    g "呃，我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:9383
translate chinese start_210cb820:

    # g "Ugh, why is this happening to us?!"
    g "唉，为什么这些事要落在我们头上？！"

# game/script.rpy:9385
translate chinese start_47d0a269:

    # "Even as we talked, we kept our ears to the hallway."
    "我们就连说话时，也一直竖着耳朵听走廊。"

# game/script.rpy:9386
translate chinese start_d2e3601a:

    # "Though we both knew Anna was at work, the slightest echo of a footstep was enough to make us jump."
    "虽然我们都知道 Anna 在上班，可一点点脚步声的回响就能把我们吓得一激灵。"

# game/script.rpy:9392
translate chinese start_3a201ab0:

    # g "Why can’t she just leave us alone?"
    g "她就不能放过我们吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9398
translate chinese start_2a7c833e:

    # g "What does she even {i}want{/i} from you?!"
    g "她到底想从你身上{i}要{/i}什么？！"

# game/script.rpy:9400
translate chinese start_ee7bd049:

    # j "...I think I might have a clue."
    j "……我大概有个头绪。"

# game/script.rpy:9404
translate chinese start_540e06f3:

    # "I told Grace about how Anna was trying to make me remember stuff from years ago."
    "我把 Anna 想让我想起多年前的事告诉了 Grace。"

# game/script.rpy:9417
translate chinese start_ac194deb:

    # j "But it was so long ago."
    j "已经是很久以前了。"

# game/script.rpy:9418
translate chinese start_ee08c44e:

    # j "{i}Anything{/i} could’ve made her obsessed with me."
    j "{i}任何事{/i}都可能让她对我着迷。"

# game/script.rpy:9424
translate chinese start_da257d3d:

    # g "Jack..."
    g "Jack……"

# game/script.rpy:9426
translate chinese start_a475dd4c_4:

    # j "What?"
    j "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9431
translate chinese start_9c3d4c11:

    # g "I’m sorry to say this... I know you always hated it when I did..."
    g "说这些我很抱歉……我知道你一直讨厌我这样……"

# game/script.rpy:9433
translate chinese start_17697de5:

    # j "What is it?"
    j "到底什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9435
translate chinese start_ffa028ba:

    # "I had a good feeling what she’d say. I didn’t like it."
    "我大致猜到她要说什么。我不喜欢。"

# game/script.rpy:9442
translate chinese start_db26f60d:

    # g "You really do have to remember."
    g "你真的必须想起来。"

# game/script.rpy:9444
translate chinese start_85b1e28b:

    # "I pinched the bridge of my nose. There was a big headache coming on, right behind the eyes."
    "我捏了捏鼻梁。眼睛后面正酝酿着一场剧烈的头痛。"

# game/script.rpy:9446
translate chinese start_13874236:

    # j "...I know."
    j "我知道。"

# game/script.rpy:9453
translate chinese start_a57d0f45:

    # g "We can't win against her like this."
    g "这样下去我们赢不了她。"

# game/script.rpy:9459
translate chinese start_e9c34543:

    # g "Not when she knows so much more than we do."
    g "更别说她知道的比我们多那么多。"

# game/script.rpy:9461
translate chinese start_b7e55f8e:

    # j "I know, all right?!"
    j "我知道，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9467
translate chinese start_a063a8f6:

    # g "Do you think you can do it?"
    g "你觉得你做得到吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9469
translate chinese start_aadbb343:

    # j "I don’t {i}want{/i} to do it."
    j "我{i}不想{/i}去想。"

# game/script.rpy:9470
translate chinese start_aba70cee:

    # j "But I think I can. I’ve never tried."
    j "但我想我能做到。我只是没试过。"

# game/script.rpy:9472
translate chinese start_9450539d:

    # "Not seriously. Not since those first few days."
    "没认真试过。从最初那几天之后就没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9478
translate chinese start_62a9b3e7:

    # g "Good. Please do try."
    g "很好。请你试试。"

# game/script.rpy:9484
translate chinese start_271940c8:

    # g "And thank you for not giving in, Jack."
    g "还有，谢谢你没有屈服，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:9489
translate chinese start_76ee9a95:

    # g "I know it must be hard."
    g "我知道这一定很难。"

# game/script.rpy:9494
translate chinese start_42424fcf:

    # g "Do you need anything from the outside? I could sneak something in."
    g "你需要我从外面带点什么吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9501
translate chinese start_5b13ef85:

    # g "I don’t have a lot, but..."
    g "我钱不多，不过……"

# game/script.rpy:9503
translate chinese start_a9b68e15:

    # j "No, I don’t need anything."
    j "不用，我什么都不需要。"

# game/script.rpy:9504
translate chinese start_c99317e9:

    # j "Anna keeps me {i}well fed.{/i}"
    j "Anna 把我{i}喂得很好{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:9506
translate chinese start_cb864ef4:

    # "I put as much contempt as I could into those words."
    "我把能挤出的轻蔑都塞进了这句话里。"

# game/script.rpy:9508
translate chinese start_754ead99:

    # j "Are you doing all right, though?"
    j "不过你还好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9509
translate chinese start_e1095684:

    # j "You don’t have any money, do you? I think Anna’s got some stashed somewhere around here..."
    j "你没什么钱吧？我记得 Anna 在这屋里藏了些……"

# game/script.rpy:9511
translate chinese start_4a41f29c:

    # "Grace refused."
    "Grace 拒绝了。"

# game/script.rpy:9518
translate chinese start_c0a73de0:

    # g "We can’t risk her noticing."
    g "不能冒险让她发现。"

# game/script.rpy:9523
translate chinese start_23efaa81:

    # g "And besides, I’m doing okay."
    g "再说，我过得还行。"

# game/script.rpy:9528
translate chinese start_773e0dc1:

    # g "I’m staying with a friend. They’re a big help."
    g "我住在一个朋友那儿。他帮了我很大忙。"

# game/script.rpy:9533
translate chinese start_b9cdc77a_2:

    # j "Oh."
    j "噢。"

# game/script.rpy:9534
translate chinese start_558df01f:

    # j "All right, then."
    j "那好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9536
translate chinese start_ca6ac677:

    # "So she’d landed on her feet."
    "看来她是站稳了。"

# game/script.rpy:9537
translate chinese start_9499c11d:

    # "It made me happy to hear that."
    "听她这么说，我很高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:9542
translate chinese start_0bc16c43:

    # g "I’ll be going now, Jack."
    g "我该走了，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:9544
translate chinese start_fcd0d97a:

    # j "What, already?"
    j "怎么，这就要走？"

# game/script.rpy:9545
translate chinese start_27f6f99a:

    # j "Anna won’t be home for hours."
    j "Anna 还有好几个小时才回来。"

# game/script.rpy:9551
translate chinese start_7dff4e9e:

    # g "She’s not {i}supposed{/i} to. We’ve got to be careful."
    g "她{i}本不该{/i}那么早回。我们得小心。"

# game/script.rpy:9557
translate chinese start_3c9b9fd3:

    # g "And being here at all is making me so nervous I could die."
    g "光是待在这儿就让我紧张得要命。"

# game/script.rpy:9562
translate chinese start_e0385144:

    # j "You’re right."
    j "你说得对。"

# game/script.rpy:9563
translate chinese start_2459a639:

    # j "Besides, we’ll have plenty of time to spend together once this is over."
    j "再说，等这件事完了，我们有的是时间在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:9569
translate chinese start_3ba7493a:

    # g "...Yeah."
    g "……嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:9574
translate chinese start_421f40d3:

    # g "Just us two."
    g "只有我们两个。"

# game/script.rpy:9579
translate chinese start_7c73926b:

    # "We looked at each other lovingly."
    "我们深情地看着对方。"

# game/script.rpy:9590
translate chinese start_5f8a446b:

    # "Then a door slammed shut somewhere in the building."
    "这时，楼里某处有一扇门砰地关上了。"

# game/script.rpy:9596
translate chinese start_9a5dac7c:

    # g "I really need to go."
    g "我真的得走了。"

# game/script.rpy:9601
translate chinese start_00930e7e:

    # g "Bye, Jack."
    g "再见，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:9603
translate chinese start_bc8497f6:

    # j "Bye, Grace."
    j "再见，Grace。"

# game/script.rpy:9604
translate chinese start_c137f251_1:

    # j "I love you."
    j "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:9610
translate chinese start_ef5d6c7a_2:

    # j "Ah..."
    j "啊……"

# game/script.rpy:9612
translate chinese start_507ed9b1:

    # "I’d wondered if it was still okay for me to tell Grace I loved her, but the words went and said themselves."
    "我还在想自己是否还有资格对 Grace 说“我爱你”，可话自己就跑了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:9620
translate chinese start_8f0b1dea:

    # "Grace stood on her tiptoes to kiss me on the cheek."
    "Grace 踮起脚，吻了我的脸颊。"

# game/script.rpy:9630
translate chinese start_e4a4b2b4:

    # g "I love you, too."
    g "我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:9644
translate chinese start_c66cc8d7:

    # n "Locking the door after her was one of the most difficult things I had ever done."
    n "在她身后把门锁上，是我做过最难的事之一。"

# game/script.rpy:9645
translate chinese start_63153380:

    # n "But seeing her had given me the courage I needed."
    n "可见到她，给了我所需要的勇气。"

# game/script.rpy:9646
translate chinese start_b6a589d8:

    # n "I felt I could do anything."
    n "我觉得自己什么都能做到。"

# game/script.rpy:9648
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_101:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:9656
translate chinese start_b555ba7e:

    # n "And now here we were, five days later, two secret meetings later."
    n "而现在，五天过去，两次秘密见面之后，我们又到了这里。"

# game/script.rpy:9657
translate chinese start_9bc714de:

    # n "I couldn’t go on."
    n "我撑不下去了。"

# game/script.rpy:9659
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_102:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:9677
translate chinese start_b194a717:

    # j "Grace, I’m sorry."
    j "Grace，对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:9682
translate chinese start_649910e2:

    # g "You can’t stay here anymore?"
    g "你不能再待下去了？"

# game/script.rpy:9687
translate chinese start_aabaa784:

    # j "I really, really can’t."
    j "我真的、真的不行。"

# game/script.rpy:9688
translate chinese start_dabce1d4:

    # j "I’m at my limit."
    j "我已经到极限了。"

# game/script.rpy:9689
translate chinese start_9b1793cd:

    # j "No, I’m way past my limit. I’m surprised I’ve still got it together."
    j "不，我早就过了极限。我还撑得住，连我自己都意外。"

# game/script.rpy:9694
translate chinese start_77803128:

    # g "Oh, baby, I’m sorry..."
    g "噢，宝贝，对不起……"

# game/script.rpy:9699
translate chinese start_a03df67a:

    # g "Have you... made any progress?"
    g "你……有进展吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9701
translate chinese start_3386db20:

    # "It was an echo of Anna’s constant questioning."
    "这话和 Anna 没完没了地盘问一模一样。"

# game/script.rpy:9702
translate chinese start_7ef7c3c9:

    # "But Grace wasn’t doing it on purpose, I told myself. I kept my anger in check."
    "我告诉自己，Grace 不是故意的。我把火压了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:9704
translate chinese start_d5a557c5:

    # j "No. Nothing."
    j "没有。什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:9705
translate chinese start_b7d41ca7:

    # j "I can’t remember anything from that time. It’s like one big blind spot."
    j "那段时间我什么都想不起来。就像一整块盲区。"

# game/script.rpy:9706
translate chinese start_ceb3c1ad:

    # j "I can’t do it. It’s hopeless."
    j "我做不到。没指望了。"

# game/script.rpy:9711
translate chinese start_a96c0ee6:

    # g "If you say it’s really hopeless... then I guess it’s no use at all."
    g "如果你说真的没希望……那大概就是没用了。"

# game/script.rpy:9717
translate chinese start_fbc6f11e:

    # g "You said the same thing last time, too, but I still made you try."
    g "上次你也这么说，可我还是让你试了。"

# game/script.rpy:9723
translate chinese start_e082ff7a:

    # g "It’s my fault you’re in so much pain."
    g "你受了这么多苦，都是我的错。"

# game/script.rpy:9725
translate chinese start_b854bd0e:

    # j "It’s not your fault."
    j "不是你的错。"

# game/script.rpy:9726
translate chinese start_a2c321ac:

    # j "It’s {i}hers.{/i}"
    j "是{i}她{/i}的错。"

# game/script.rpy:9728
translate chinese start_f81fc8c9:

    # "I heaved a sigh."
    "我重重叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:9730
translate chinese start_ed41990c:

    # j "I need to pack a few things."
    j "我得收拾几件东西。"

# game/script.rpy:9731
translate chinese start_fee5aa88:

    # j "Wait here. I’ll be ready in five."
    j "在这儿等。我五分钟就好。"

# game/script.rpy:9739
translate chinese start_bc067613:

    # g "That’s... a ’no,’ again."
    g "这又是……一个“不”字。"

# game/script.rpy:9741
translate chinese start_a475dd4c_5:

    # j "What?"
    j "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9742
translate chinese start_eb291ca5:

    # j "You can’t mean..."
    j "你不会是想……"

# game/script.rpy:9747
translate chinese start_e268efa0:

    # g "I want you to stay here, Jack."
    g "我要你留在这儿，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:9749
translate chinese start_a27d115f:

    # j "There’s no way I can."
    j "我不可能留下。"

# game/script.rpy:9756
translate chinese start_fed0758f:

    # g "Just a {i}little{/i} bit more. I promise."
    g "就再{i}一点点{/i}。我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:9763
translate chinese start_99c6e8da:

    # "She came up to me and felt my upper arms."
    "她走到我面前，捏了捏我的上臂。"

# game/script.rpy:9770
translate chinese start_803256ca:

    # g "You’re so thin now."
    g "你现在好瘦。"

# game/script.rpy:9777
translate chinese start_8e196528:

    # g "But you could still hold her down, right?"
    g "可你还是能把她按住吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9782
translate chinese start_5a3fa350:

    # "A chill went over me."
    "一阵寒意爬上我的背。"

# game/script.rpy:9784
translate chinese start_61bb6c3f:

    # j "What do you mean?"
    j "你什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:9785
translate chinese start_5774558a:

    # j "Aren’t we running away?"
    j "我们不是要逃吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9792
translate chinese start_942f99d8:

    # g "We can’t run away."
    g "我们逃不掉。"

# game/script.rpy:9797
translate chinese start_d74b2df4:

    # g "She’ll find us again, and then what?"
    g "她会再找到我们，然后呢？"

# game/script.rpy:9802
translate chinese start_5445efb0:

    # g "I can’t live like that, always afraid. I’m sure you can’t, either."
    g "我没法那样活着，永远害怕。我知道你也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:9804
translate chinese start_28bec4ba:

    # j "So you’re going to...?"
    j "所以你要……？"

# game/script.rpy:9806
translate chinese start_5a69f6cb:

    # "She couldn’t mean..."
    "她不会是想要……"

# game/script.rpy:9811
translate chinese start_ada80d9a:

    # "Grace whispered a \"Yes.\""
    "Grace 低声说了句“是的”。"

# game/script.rpy:9813
translate chinese start_224497b4:

    # j "No!"
    j "不！"

# game/script.rpy:9814
translate chinese start_f84afc61:

    # j "It’s wrong. Plain wrong."
    j "这是错的。根本就是错的。"

# game/script.rpy:9820
translate chinese start_e4fa4cbf:

    # g "Yeah, it is."
    g "是啊，确实。"

# game/script.rpy:9826
translate chinese start_6d0b815c:

    # g "But what else is there to do?"
    g "但我还能怎么样呢？"

# game/script.rpy:9831
translate chinese start_40d06fa0:

    # g "She’s backed us into a corner. It’s practically self-defense."
    g "她把我们逼到角落了。这几乎就是自卫。"

# game/script.rpy:9833
translate chinese start_91edd54a:

    # j "I... I guess if you look at it that way..."
    j "我……要是这么看的话，大概……"

# game/script.rpy:9835
translate chinese start_e8285d98:

    # "{i}No!{/i}"
    "{i}不！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:9836
translate chinese start_b4061ccc:

    # "{i}Absolutely not!{/i}"
    "{i}绝对不行！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:9837
translate chinese start_dba9ca7d:

    # "My head pounded at the temples."
    "我太阳穴跳着疼。"

# game/script.rpy:9844
translate chinese start_d010cc1b:

    # g "I’m so happy you agree."
    g "你同意，我太高兴了。"

# game/script.rpy:9849
translate chinese start_0f6d46f1:

    # g "I so wish we could do it today, but I need to prepare."
    g "我多希望今天就动手，可我得先准备。"

# game/script.rpy:9855
translate chinese start_0c67db58:

    # g "Can you stand being here until tomorrow evening?"
    g "你能在这儿撑到明天傍晚吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9857
translate chinese start_984f6b91_5:

    # j "...Yeah."
    j "……能。"

# game/script.rpy:9864
translate chinese start_fe4fe58b:

    # g "Perfect! Thank you."
    g "太好了！谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:9869
translate chinese start_abf83858:

    # g "Tomorrow, Anna has a morning shift, and she’ll be back by early afternoon."
    g "明天 Anna 上早班，下午早些时候就会回来。"

# game/script.rpy:9874
translate chinese start_ee7b2d9e:

    # g "Let’s go for six o’clock."
    g "就定六点吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9879
translate chinese start_522d391c:

    # g "Okay?"
    g "行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9881
translate chinese start_53d71353_1:

    # j "Okay."
    j "行。"

# game/script.rpy:9886
translate chinese start_46e7916d:

    # g "Six o’clock."
    g "六点。"

# game/script.rpy:9891
translate chinese start_5dd35e9c:

    # g "Please have her immobilized by then."
    g "到时候请务必让她动不了。"

# game/script.rpy:9893
translate chinese start_47284e4d:

    # j "Immobilized, how?"
    j "动不了，怎么弄？"

# game/script.rpy:9895
translate chinese start_ee856f79:

    # "I was already swept up in this plan."
    "我已经被卷进这个计划里了。"

# game/script.rpy:9896
translate chinese start_7f3112dc:

    # "I didn’t think twice about what Grace said anymore."
    "Grace 说的话，我已经不再多想了。"

# game/script.rpy:9902
translate chinese start_75b82302:

    # g "The more immobilized, the better."
    g "越动不了越好。"

# game/script.rpy:9907
translate chinese start_936da985:

    # g "If you just sat on her, that’d be all right, I guess. But tying her down would be a big help."
    g "你就坐她身上大概也行。不过要是能把她绑起来，那就帮大忙了。"

# game/script.rpy:9913
translate chinese start_23018df6:

    # g "And if you could knock her out, that would be amazing!"
    g "你要是能把她打晕，那就太棒了！"

# game/script.rpy:9915
translate chinese start_e81bc87f:

    # j "I’ll... see what I can do."
    j "我……看看能怎么办。"

# game/script.rpy:9920
translate chinese start_29d99e09:

    # g "Thank you."
    g "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:9926
translate chinese start_9e299842:

    # g "I’ll be outside, in the hallway."
    g "我在外面，走廊里。"

# game/script.rpy:9931
translate chinese start_a7dcaabb:

    # g "When she’s all tied up—or passed out or whatever—shout out so I know it’s safe, okay?"
    g "她被绑好之后——或者晕过去，随便哪种——喊一声，让我知道安全了，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9933
translate chinese start_e0890363:

    # j "All right."
    j "好。"

# game/script.rpy:9934
translate chinese start_17692730:

    # j "And then...? What will you do then?"
    j "然后……？然后你做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9941
translate chinese start_b191139b:

    # "To answer, Grace took a small knife out of her pocket."
    "Grace 没有回答，只是从口袋里拿出一把小刀。"

# game/script.rpy:9942
translate chinese start_d7dd6450:

    # "She turned it in her hand a few times."
    "她在手里转了几下。"

# game/script.rpy:9943
translate chinese start_b11fb3e5:

    # "Only then did I realize the full weight of what she would do."
    "到这时我才真正意识到她要做的事有多沉重。"

# game/script.rpy:9944
translate chinese start_960aed6f:

    # "And only then did I realize how she didn’t seem bothered by it."
    "也到这时我才意识到，她似乎一点也不为此困扰。"

# game/script.rpy:9946
translate chinese start_52811763:

    # j "Grace... what happened?"
    j "Grace，发生什么事了？"

# game/script.rpy:9953
translate chinese start_4a14c5d2:

    # g "What do you mean?"
    g "你什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:9958
translate chinese start_b6dc5569:

    # j "This isn’t like you."
    j "这不像你。"

# game/script.rpy:9959
translate chinese start_70c3335a:

    # j "The Grace I know..."
    j "我认识的 Grace……"

# game/script.rpy:9961
translate chinese start_2da1bf27:

    # "I hesitated."
    "我犹豫了。"

# game/script.rpy:9963
translate chinese start_a66e8a55:

    # j "What did Anna do to you?"
    j "Anna 对你做了什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9969
translate chinese start_e3d3be01:

    # "Grace’s good mood seemed to evaporate."
    "Grace 的好心情像是瞬间蒸发了。"

# game/script.rpy:9973
translate chinese start_d839cbc8:

    # "She pressed her face against my chest."
    "她把脸埋进我的胸口。"

# game/script.rpy:9978
translate chinese start_df3ae3ee:

    # g "She... did a lot."
    g "她……做了很多。"

# game/script.rpy:9984
translate chinese start_6ad7cbfc:

    # g "She..."
    g "她……"

# game/script.rpy:9992
translate chinese start_5fa530a9:

    # g "...I felt like I was dirt."
    g "……我觉得自己像块烂泥。"

# game/script.rpy:9998
translate chinese start_fc7230e7:

    # g "And I promised myself that would never happen again."
    g "我对自己发誓，那种事再也不会发生。"

# game/script.rpy:10000
translate chinese start_89c26239:

    # "The knife was still in her hand. It looked so sharp."
    "刀还在她手里。看着那么锋利。"

# game/script.rpy:10007
translate chinese start_21e40eee:

    # g "She took you from me, too."
    g "她也把你从我身边夺走了。"

# game/script.rpy:10014
translate chinese start_1b3a6853:

    # g "That’s the one thing I really can’t forgive."
    g "只有这一件事，我实在无法原谅。"

# game/script.rpy:10021
translate chinese start_2e316475:

    # g "Imagine how happy we’d be if she never existed."
    g "想想看，要是她从来不存在，我们会多幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:10023
translate chinese start_44a2c7dd:

    # "I put my arms around her."
    "我张开双臂抱住了她。"

# game/script.rpy:10025
translate chinese start_115945b2_1:

    # j "I get it."
    j "我明白。"

# game/script.rpy:10026
translate chinese start_199bf840:

    # j "Then let me do it. Give me the knife."
    j "那就让我来。把刀给我。"

# game/script.rpy:10027
translate chinese start_34a9def6:

    # j "I don’t want to see you do this."
    j "我不想看你做这种事。"

# game/script.rpy:10029
translate chinese start_dd2730a7:

    # "{i}Maybe I’ll be able to work something out,{/i} I thought."
    "{i}也许我能想出办法，{/i}我想。"

# game/script.rpy:10030
translate chinese start_4ac9c61c:

    # "{i}Maybe it won’t have to lead to bloodshed.{/i}"
    "{i}也许不必闹到见血。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:10031
translate chinese start_d05ea80e:

    # "I hated the sight of blood."
    "我见不得血。"

# game/script.rpy:10036
translate chinese start_7337d37b:

    # g "I’m sorry, Jack."
    g "我很抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:10041
translate chinese start_1ca99566:

    # g "This is something {i}I{/i} have to do."
    g "这件事必须由{i}我{/i}来做。"

# game/script.rpy:10047
translate chinese start_cc72f31b:

    # g "...No, it's not just that."
    g "……不，不只是那样。"

# game/script.rpy:10057
translate chinese start_e191c101:

    # g "The truth is, I want to do it myself."
    g "说实话，我想亲手做。"

# game/script.rpy:10063
translate chinese start_3d917e97:

    # g "It’s like nothing will ever feel right again if {i}I{/i} don’t do it."
    g "如果{i}我{/i}不做，好像什么都没法再好起来。"

# game/script.rpy:10065
translate chinese start_cb35d1af:

    # "Grace put a hand on my chin."
    "Grace 把手放在我的下巴上。"

# game/script.rpy:10073
translate chinese start_35388b15:

    # "I leaned in closer, but she stopped me before we kissed."
    "我凑近了些，可她在我们接吻之前拦住了我。"

# game/script.rpy:10080
translate chinese start_c3b875b5:

    # g "I love you, Jack."
    g "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:10082
translate chinese start_64b9ff08_1:

    # j "I love you, too."
    j "我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:10084
translate chinese start_3086b83f:

    # "Her skin felt hot."
    "她的皮肤很烫。"

# game/script.rpy:10085
translate chinese start_7fb6f17b:

    # "She was giving off heat like a furnace."
    "她像火炉一样散着热。"

# game/script.rpy:10090
translate chinese start_43e5c950:

    # g "Are you scared?"
    g "你害怕吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10092
translate chinese start_fcceffc0_4:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:10097
translate chinese start_a8f14585:

    # g "Please don’t be."
    g "请别害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:10103
translate chinese start_e2306ffb:

    # g "One day, we’ll look back on this and laugh."
    g "总有一天，我们回头看这些会笑出来。"

# game/script.rpy:10121
translate chinese start_e9865641:

    # "I wake up with a bitter taste in my mouth."
    "我醒来时嘴里发苦。"

# game/script.rpy:10123
translate chinese start_d40b16bd:

    # j "One day we’ll look back and laugh..."
    j "总有一天我们会回头笑着说……"

# game/script.rpy:10125
translate chinese start_016a165c:

    # "{i}I’m sure as hell not laughing now.{/i}"
    "{i}反正我现在一点也笑不出来。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:10127
translate chinese start_0f29cbf3:

    # q "That’s a good thought to have."
    q "这么想很好。"

# game/script.rpy:10129
translate chinese start_100c0d36:

    # j "What the—"
    j "搞什么——"

# game/script.rpy:10130
translate chinese start_4128c832:

    # j "...Oh, it’s you."
    j "……哦，是你。"

# game/script.rpy:10131
translate chinese start_d9ab89ff:

    # j "Don’t sneak up on me like that. Christ."
    j "别那样突然冒出来。天啊。"

# game/script.rpy:10140
translate chinese start_28415248:

    # a "You should laugh as much as you can, you know?"
    a "你该尽量多笑笑，知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10145
translate chinese start_5814b70e:

    # a "It helps reduce stress."
    a "能减压。"

# game/script.rpy:10147
translate chinese start_2a874ad0:

    # j "It’s hard to find things funny with you around."
    j "有你在旁边，很难觉得什么好笑。"

# game/script.rpy:10148
translate chinese start_6537f6be:

    # j "Do you have to come here so often? I see more than enough of you in my dreams."
    j "你非得这么常来吗？我在梦里见你已经够多了。"

# game/script.rpy:10150
translate chinese start_bbd1b0a0:

    # "That long, shameful month I spent with her keeps coming to me while I sleep."
    "跟她在一起那漫长又羞耻的一个月，总在我睡着时回来找我。"

# game/script.rpy:10151
translate chinese start_8cccee7c:

    # "It's souring my mood. I can’t even pretend around Anna anymore."
    "它把我的心情弄坏了。在 Anna 面前我连装都装不下去了。"

# game/script.rpy:10152
translate chinese start_9da38063:

    # "Maybe I should write about it in the journal, after all..."
    "也许我还是该把它写进日记里……"

# game/script.rpy:10153
translate chinese start_b0a917a7:

    # "No, screw that. It’d be too embarrassing to write down."
    "不，算了。写下来太丢人。"

# game/script.rpy:10159
translate chinese start_82d7ddd8:

    # a "Jack, that’s so sweet!"
    a "Jack，你真贴心！"

# game/script.rpy:10161
translate chinese start_70135d65:

    # j "Huh? What is?"
    j "哈？什么贴心？"

# game/script.rpy:10166
translate chinese start_65a66db6:

    # a "So you dream about me."
    a "所以你梦见我了。"

# game/script.rpy:10172
translate chinese start_702e1714:

    # a "I have dreams about you, too. Every night."
    a "我也梦到你。每天晚上。"

# game/script.rpy:10174
translate chinese start_0defe654:

    # j "Yeah, but mine are nightmares."
    j "是啊，不过我的是噩梦。"

# game/script.rpy:10181
translate chinese start_6453dbe0:

    # a "Looks like someone’s cranky from having just woken up."
    a "看来有人刚睡醒就闹脾气。"

# game/script.rpy:10187
translate chinese start_25ee6f97:

    # a "You better not be so rude to your doctor, though. He’s not as nice as I am."
    a "不过你对医生可别这么无礼。他脾气没我好。"

# game/script.rpy:10192
translate chinese start_b4817d5c:

    # a "He might kick you out if you misbehave."
    a "你要是乱来，他可能把你赶出去。"

# game/script.rpy:10198
translate chinese start_2111be40:

    # a "I’ve seen him do that."
    a "我见过他这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:10200
translate chinese start_37944f07:

    # "{i}That's fine.{/i}"
    "{i}这样也罢。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:10201
translate chinese start_897c092c:

    # "{i}I might be happier out on the street.{/i}"
    "{i}流落街头我可能还开心些。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:10225
translate chinese start_496aba0e:

    # "The doctor comes along soon enough."
    "医生很快就来了。"

# game/script.rpy:10226
translate chinese start_d4b1726b:

    # "He has good news for me, he says."
    "他说，他有个好消息要告诉我。"

# game/script.rpy:10228
translate chinese start_c8b8f960:

    # doc "It’s looking good, Mr. Friday. Far better than before."
    doc "情况不错，Mr. Friday。比之前好多了。"

# game/script.rpy:10229
translate chinese start_5113f219:

    # doc "Your blood pressure’s fine. And the other things, too."
    doc "血压正常。其他指标也没问题。"

# game/script.rpy:10231
translate chinese start_25442765:

    # j "That’s great news, doctor."
    j "这真是好消息，医生。"

# game/script.rpy:10233
translate chinese start_2e42afab:

    # "My attention is split between what he’s saying and what I see in his coat pocket."
    "一半在他外套口袋里的东西上。"

# game/script.rpy:10234
translate chinese start_7217ed9f:

    # "It’s glinting."
    "它在反光。"

# game/script.rpy:10235
translate chinese start_310de7e5:

    # "Is it a pen?"
    "是支笔吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10236
translate chinese start_eb1f00ff:

    # "No, it’s not a pen. It’s something else."
    "不，那不是钢笔。是别的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:10237
translate chinese start_f7b3dc7a:

    # "My heart beats faster."
    "我的心跳更快了。"

# game/script.rpy:10238
translate chinese start_106b2b5d:

    # "Thankfully I still remember to ask an important question."
    "幸好我还记得问一个要紧的问题。"

# game/script.rpy:10240
translate chinese start_21443752:

    # j "So... when can I...?"
    j "那……我什么时候能……？"

# game/script.rpy:10242
translate chinese start_fbd818a7:

    # doc "Leave?"
    doc "出院？"

# game/script.rpy:10244
translate chinese start_b69910c8:

    # j "Yeah. When are you going to release me?"
    j "嗯。你打算什么时候让我出院？"

# game/script.rpy:10246
translate chinese start_5eb04300:

    # "The doctor scratches his head, then counts on his fingers."
    "医生挠了挠头，又掰着手指数了数。"

# game/script.rpy:10248
translate chinese start_44620799:

    # doc "Wednesday next week."
    doc "下周三。"

# game/script.rpy:10250
translate chinese start_3cd12e7a:

    # j "Next {i}week{/i}?"
    j "下{i}周{/i}？"

# game/script.rpy:10252
translate chinese start_e0ebcf31:

    # doc "Yes."
    doc "是的。"

# game/script.rpy:10254
translate chinese start_db70966e:

    # j "Wow. Thanks, doctor."
    j "哇。谢谢医生。"

# game/script.rpy:10256
translate chinese start_536b8821:

    # doc "You’re welcome."
    doc "不客气。"

# game/script.rpy:10258
translate chinese start_d4bb181c:

    # "It’s way earlier than I expected. I’d prepared myself for being here for a few more weeks."
    "比我预想的早太多。我本来已做好准备在这儿再待几周。"

# game/script.rpy:10260
translate chinese start_90f5ca7b:

    # j "Thank you so, so much."
    j "太感谢你了，真的。"

# game/script.rpy:10261
translate chinese start_4912c0dd:

    # j "Here."
    j "来。"

# game/script.rpy:10263
translate chinese start_72e7830b:

    # "I put out a hand for him to shake."
    "我伸出手，想跟他握手。"

# game/script.rpy:10264
translate chinese start_96bb71b6:

    # "After a second, he takes it."
    "他停了一下，才握住。"

# game/script.rpy:10273
translate chinese start_6473bb13:

    # "I pull him closer, and he stumbles, nearly sprawling across my bed."
    "我把他往自己这边一拉，他踉跄了一下，差点扑到我床上。"

# game/script.rpy:10274
translate chinese start_72e7535b:

    # "It’s a very sloppy handshake."
    "这握手实在潦草。"

# game/script.rpy:10279
translate chinese start_345ff6f2:

    # j "Sorry, doctor."
    j "抱歉，医生。"

# game/script.rpy:10280
translate chinese start_000f5f5e:

    # j "My bad."
    j "是我不好。"

# game/script.rpy:10285
translate chinese start_6e5a68b1:

    # "He coughs."
    "他咳了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:10287
translate chinese start_f7c47b36:

    # doc "Ah... it’s fine."
    doc "不，没事的啦。"

# game/script.rpy:10289
translate chinese start_18098f69:

    # j "You’ve really helped me."
    j "你真的帮了我大忙。"

# game/script.rpy:10290
translate chinese start_54716fb0:

    # j "A {i}lot.{/i}"
    j "{i}大{/i}忙。"

# game/script.rpy:10292
translate chinese start_4b77d16b:

    # doc "All in a day’s work."
    doc "分内的事罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:10293
translate chinese start_3c606fc5:

    # doc "So yes, next week."
    doc "所以，是的，下星期。"

# game/script.rpy:10294
translate chinese start_07de3afe:

    # doc "And then you’ve got rehab."
    doc "然后你还有康复治疗。"

# game/script.rpy:10296
translate chinese start_77a81e45:

    # j "Hm? Rehab, doc?"
    j "嗯？康复治疗，医生？"

# game/script.rpy:10302
translate chinese start_0465f596:

    # doc "Oh, yes."
    doc "哈，是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:10303
translate chinese start_4afadc51:

    # doc "After you leave here, it’s straight to the physical rehab facility for you."
    doc "你离开这儿之后，直接去康复中心。"

# game/script.rpy:10304
translate chinese start_36997ecd:

    # doc "We don’t have an inpatient facility here, but there is a great one on the other side of town. I’m sending you there."
    doc "我们这儿没有住院康复部，但城那头有一家很好的。我安排你去那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:10306
translate chinese start_66e39a04:

    # j "I’m not... going home?"
    j "我……不回家吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10311
translate chinese start_859a6ffb:

    # doc "No, of course not. You’d end up hurting yourself, or with a limp."
    doc "当然不是。你会把自己弄伤，或者落个瘸腿。"

# game/script.rpy:10312
translate chinese start_54ad6ac0:

    # doc "Is that what you want?"
    doc "你是想这样吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10313
translate chinese start_4e4155f7:

    # doc "No, no. That won’t do."
    doc "不，不。那可不行。"

# game/script.rpy:10314
translate chinese start_8cbaec08:

    # doc "That won’t do at all."
    doc "那绝对不行。"

# game/script.rpy:10316
translate chinese start_9cea4c69:

    # "He jots down some notes."
    "他记了几笔。"

# game/script.rpy:10318
translate chinese start_399a3f5c:

    # doc "Wednesday... that’s in four days..."
    doc "星期三……那就是四天后……"

# game/script.rpy:10319
translate chinese start_baf1c9c1:

    # doc "The nurses have been exercising you, right?"
    doc "护士有帮你做活动训练吧？"

# game/script.rpy:10321
translate chinese start_e1c7f2d2:

    # j "They what?"
    j "他们什么？"

# game/script.rpy:10323
translate chinese start_f1282348:

    # doc "Huh?"
    doc "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:10325
translate chinese start_fbc5d15c:

    # j "Exercising me?"
    j "给我做训练？"

# game/script.rpy:10327
translate chinese start_2ffe2343:

    # doc "They haven’t?"
    doc "没有吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10329
translate chinese start_de530aac:

    # "He turns to Anna."
    "他转向 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:10331
translate chinese start_45a73c5c:

    # doc "What’s this about, nurse?"
    doc "这是怎么回事，护士？"

# game/script.rpy:10341
translate chinese start_6ed48ebd:

    # a "Excuse me?"
    a "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:10343
translate chinese start_fd49c7cc:

    # doc "You should’ve been giving him some mild exercise."
    doc "你们该给他做些轻度的活动。"

# game/script.rpy:10344
translate chinese start_c1dbf047:

    # doc "Well?"
    doc "怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:10350
translate chinese start_2ea248fe:

    # a "Uh... you never told us that, doctor."
    a "呃……您从没跟我们说过，医生。"

# game/script.rpy:10355
translate chinese start_4b10157c:

    # doc "Can’t you tell by yourself?"
    doc "你自己看不出来吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10357
translate chinese start_4fbc0ce7:

    # "The doctor starts mumbling to himself while making more notes."
    "医生一边继续记录，一边自言自语地嘟囔。"

# game/script.rpy:10359
translate chinese start_9801e360:

    # doc "Christ, I really have to do everything here, don’t I?"
    doc "老天，这儿什么都得我来，是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:10360
translate chinese start_5e97e02d:

    # doc "No, no, that’s fine. Not like you’re paid to do these things, or anything..."
    doc "不，不，没关系。又不是说你们干这些有工钱……"

# game/script.rpy:10362
translate chinese start_5bc75dd0:

    # j "And how long will I stay there, doctor?"
    j "那我要在那儿待多久，医生？"

# game/script.rpy:10364
translate chinese start_16376a14:

    # "He raises his hands, as if giving up on me."
    "他举起双手，像是要放弃我。"

# game/script.rpy:10366
translate chinese start_7883910b:

    # doc "It’s always that with you, isn’t it?"
    doc "你总是这样，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10367
translate chinese start_ae07b375:

    # doc "Look, how long you’ll stay at the facility is up the people there. I can’t tell you that."
    doc "这样，你在那儿待多久，由那边的人决定。我说不了。"

# game/script.rpy:10368
translate chinese start_204fe34a:

    # doc "{i}But{/i}... don’t hold your breath."
    doc "{i}不过{/i}……别抱太大希望。"

# game/script.rpy:10370
translate chinese start_7a350154:

    # "I let out a laugh."
    "我笑了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:10372
translate chinese start_028b741f:

    # j "Man, you’re really going to milk me dry, aren’t you?"
    j "老兄，你这是要把我榨干啊？"

# game/script.rpy:10373
translate chinese start_9cc5b92d:

    # j "I bet you've got a deal with the people over there, doctor."
    j "我打赌你和那边的人有分成吧，医生。"

# game/script.rpy:10374
translate chinese start_dfeace60:

    # j "Don’t you know I’m poor as hell?"
    j "您不知道我穷得要命吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10376
translate chinese start_e35cf04a:

    # "He makes a grave face."
    "他板起脸。"

# game/script.rpy:10378
translate chinese start_14dfbcda:

    # doc "The thought never crossed my mind."
    doc "我从没这么想过。"

# game/script.rpy:10379
translate chinese start_2959f4e4:

    # doc "I live only to help people like yourself, Mr. Friday. So I don’t appreciate hearing such accusations."
    doc "我活着就是为了帮助像你这样的人，Mr. Friday。所以我不喜欢听到这样的指责。"

# game/script.rpy:10380
translate chinese start_81327910:

    # doc "I’d like you to be more careful about what you say."
    doc "希望你说话注意点。"

# game/script.rpy:10381
translate chinese start_9dbdae2a:

    # doc "Understood?"
    doc "明白了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10383
translate chinese start_07cb168a:

    # j "U-Understood."
    j "明、明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:10385
translate chinese start_691ee71f:

    # doc "Good."
    doc "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:10389
translate chinese start_cee1fbcf:

    # "And he rushes off, leather shoes creaking."
    "他匆匆走了，皮鞋吱吱作响。"

# game/script.rpy:10397
translate chinese start_0abc3494:

    # a "Well, then."
    a "好吧，就这样了。"

# game/script.rpy:10402
translate chinese start_fe4fb516:

    # "Anna grabs hold of my right leg—the one that isn’t broken."
    "Anna 抓住我的右腿——没断的那条。"

# game/script.rpy:10404
translate chinese start_cd88fbb2:

    # j "Hey!"
    j "喂！"

# game/script.rpy:10405
translate chinese start_cd84508d:

    # j "What do you think you’re doing?"
    j "你以为你在干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:10411
translate chinese start_7a30222b:

    # a "It’s exercise."
    a "这是复健。"

# game/script.rpy:10417
translate chinese start_79989ce7:

    # a "You remember what the doctor said, don’t you?"
    a "你记得医生说的吧？"

# game/script.rpy:10419
translate chinese start_5137a406:

    # j "Ah, right."
    j "啊，对。"

# game/script.rpy:10420
translate chinese start_2439bafe:

    # j "Well... I suppose it’s fine."
    j "好吧……应该没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:10425
translate chinese start_5d25557c:

    # "She brings my knee up to my chest."
    "她把我的膝盖往我胸口抬。"

# game/script.rpy:10426
translate chinese start_9ecdbf4e:

    # "The joints in my leg pop."
    "我腿上的关节咔咔作响。"

# game/script.rpy:10427
translate chinese start_52b7e8e8:

    # "It’s stiff. I haven’t used it in a long time."
    "腿很僵。我很久没用过它了。"

# game/script.rpy:10434
translate chinese start_587917b1:

    # a "How is it? Any pain?"
    a "怎么样？疼吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10436
translate chinese start_33503d0b:

    # j "No..."
    j "不疼……"

# game/script.rpy:10437
translate chinese start_a0a6584b:

    # j "A little sore, but it doesn’t hurt."
    j "有点酸，但不疼。"

# game/script.rpy:10442
translate chinese start_06a2448b:

    # a "Okay."
    a "好。"

# game/script.rpy:10444
translate chinese start_dfacceb7:

    # "She brings my leg back down."
    "她把我的腿放回去。"

# game/script.rpy:10449
translate chinese start_08adba4a:

    # a "I’ll keep going, then... if you don’t mind."
    a "那我继续……你要是不介意的话。"

# game/script.rpy:10454
translate chinese start_ba00197c:

    # j "Keep going as you please."
    j "你随意继续。"

# game/script.rpy:10456
translate chinese start_17bbb99f:

    # "She repeats the whole motion, ever-so-gently."
    "她把整个动作又做了一遍，极尽轻柔。"

# game/script.rpy:10458
translate chinese start_495e49ed:

    # j "If this’ll help me start walking faster, I’m fine with it."
    j "要是这能让我更快走路，我不介意。"

# game/script.rpy:10463
translate chinese start_97016968:

    # a "Mhm."
    a "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:10465
translate chinese start_257eab2b:

    # "Her hands are on me."
    "她的手在我身上。"

# game/script.rpy:10466
translate chinese start_e38eb514:

    # "When she helps me fold my leg up, her neck is so close I could..."
    "她帮我屈腿的时候，脖子离我那么近，我可以……"

# game/script.rpy:10468
translate chinese start_8b8898fd:

    # j "How do you feel about what the doctor said?"
    j "医生说的话，你怎么想？"

# game/script.rpy:10473
translate chinese start_1a4d0360:

    # a "Hmm?"
    a "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:10478
translate chinese start_15a7446e:

    # a "What did he say?"
    a "他说什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:10480
translate chinese start_03cfd0ba:

    # j "That I’m out of here by next week."
    j "我下周就能出去。"

# game/script.rpy:10482
translate chinese start_0ad82878:

    # "I whisper so the other patients can’t hear."
    "我压低声音，不让别的病人听见。"

# game/script.rpy:10484
translate chinese start_edf95cd4:

    # j "How does that make you feel?"
    j "你听了是什么感觉？"

# game/script.rpy:10485
translate chinese start_9d18cfdb:

    # j "Are you {i}angry?{/i}"
    j "你{i}生气了吗？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:10492
translate chinese start_c294a0a9:

    # "Anna’s smile doesn’t break, but her fingers press against me more forcefully."
    "Anna 的笑容没垮，可她的手指按得更用力了。"

# game/script.rpy:10498
translate chinese start_4a756e3f:

    # a "I’m not angry, of course."
    a "我当然不生气。"

# game/script.rpy:10503
translate chinese start_c6b306ab:

    # a "It’s nice that you’re getting better."
    a "你能好起来，真好。"

# game/script.rpy:10505
translate chinese start_dc7d97cc_1:

    # j "Oh yeah?"
    j "是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10511
translate chinese start_0609737b:

    # a "And I’ll still visit you at the facility."
    a "而且我还是会去康复中心看你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10513
translate chinese start_32172b21:

    # j "I’m sure you will."
    j "你肯定会的。"

# game/script.rpy:10514
translate chinese start_f92754d3:

    # j "Oh, but what if they’re very strict about visiting hours?"
    j "噢，可要是他们管探视时间管得很严呢？"

# game/script.rpy:10515
translate chinese start_2725e3f9:

    # j "That’d be a bummer, wouldn’t it?"
    j "那就扫兴了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:10521
translate chinese start_64df9b0f:

    # "For the first time in so long, I feel like I have the upper hand. It’s going to my head."
    "这么久以来第一次，我觉得自己占了上风。这让我有点飘飘然。"

# game/script.rpy:10523
translate chinese start_a9d3fe00:

    # j "And who knows. Maybe I’ll tell them I don’t want any visitors."
    j "谁知道呢。也许我会告诉他们我不想见任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:10528
translate chinese start_7889e9ef:

    # a "To focus on your recovery?"
    a "专心养身体？"

# game/script.rpy:10530
translate chinese start_5e2b7498:

    # j "Yeah, of course."
    j "对，当然。"

# game/script.rpy:10536
translate chinese start_1ff1d2fd:

    # a "That’s good. I want you healthy, darling."
    a "那很好。我要你健健康康的，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:10538
translate chinese start_f87604fd:

    # "She stops exercising me mid-motion."
    "她做到一半停下了手上的动作。"

# game/script.rpy:10544
translate chinese start_09d1c77e:

    # a "I can wait. How long do you think I waited before?"
    a "我可以等。你猜我之前等了多久？"

# game/script.rpy:10549
translate chinese start_4a4308cf:

    # a "I’m a patient girl."
    a "我是个有耐心的女孩。"

# game/script.rpy:10551
translate chinese start_537fe521:

    # "Her fingers find their way up my inner leg."
    "她的手指顺着我的大腿内侧往上爬。"

# game/script.rpy:10557
translate chinese start_a315e5f5:

    # a "I can wait no problem."
    a "我可以等，没问题。"

# game/script.rpy:10564
translate chinese start_992969a3:

    # a "Because after this is done, you’ll be mine again."
    a "因为这一切结束之后，你就又是我的了。"

# game/script.rpy:10575
translate chinese start_8c1dff34:

    # a "All mine."
    a "完完全全属于我。"

# game/script.rpy:10581
translate chinese start_e6a5ba62:

    # a "Forever~"
    a "永远～"

# game/script.rpy:10590
translate chinese start_bd8a8304:

    # "I grab her by the wrist. My fingernails dig into her skin."
    "我抓住她的手腕。指甲掐进她的皮肤。"

# game/script.rpy:10595
translate chinese start_e16344af:

    # a "Ouch."
    a "哎哟。"

# game/script.rpy:10601
translate chinese start_2c658a92:

    # a "You’re hurting me~"
    a "你弄疼我了～"

# game/script.rpy:10603
translate chinese start_1c271ae8:

    # j "Shut up."
    j "闭嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:10604
translate chinese start_b041d9ed:

    # j "How come... What makes you so..."
    j "怎么会……你怎么能这么……"

# game/script.rpy:10605
translate chinese start_cf135c3e:

    # j "I’m—I’m never living with you again, you know that?!"
    j "我、我再也不会跟你住在一起了，你听见没有？！"

# game/script.rpy:10611
translate chinese start_06ebcf12_2:

    # a "Oh, sweetie."
    a "噢，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:10617
translate chinese start_c5e25d6c:

    # a "You’ll do as I say."
    a "你要照我说的做。"

# game/script.rpy:10619
translate chinese start_cf307bc7:

    # j "Gh..."
    j "呃……"

# game/script.rpy:10620
translate chinese start_5e4ace8e_1:

    # j "Of course."
    j "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:10621
translate chinese start_3ae62dfe:

    # j "You still have Grace."
    j "你还有 Grace。"

# game/script.rpy:10627
translate chinese start_6e82c6a5:

    # a "Well, yes, that’s one reason."
    a "嗯，是的，那是一个原因。"

# game/script.rpy:10633
translate chinese start_8947ebe1:

    # a "But there’s one much dearer to my heart."
    a "但有一样东西，在我心里要珍贵得多。"

# game/script.rpy:10638
translate chinese start_3c43ae5b_1:

    # a "Do you know what that is?"
    a "你知道是什么吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10640
translate chinese start_e5365112:

    # "I glare back."
    "我瞪回去。"

# game/script.rpy:10647
translate chinese start_1bbfb211:

    # a "It’s that you love me."
    a "那是因为你爱我。"

# game/script.rpy:10649
translate chinese start_e930ae6d:

    # j "I don’t."
    j "我不爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:10656
translate chinese start_c3e66ba7:

    # a "You do."
    a "你爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:10661
translate chinese start_e4c2acc0:

    # a "You love me even if you don’t know you love me."
    a "就算你自己还没发觉，你也爱着我。"

# game/script.rpy:10666
translate chinese start_6b6cd99d:

    # a "Deep down, you love me more than anything in the world."
    a "你心底里，爱我胜过世上的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:10672
translate chinese start_79eaada7:

    # a "Just like I love you."
    a "就像我爱你一样。"

# game/script.rpy:10677
translate chinese start_a729af40:

    # a "But you’ve spent so long living all these lies that you’ve started believing them yourself."
    a "可你在那些谎言里活得太久，连自己都信了。"

# game/script.rpy:10683
translate chinese start_0e9e8684:

    # a "Don’t worry, though. I’ll help you remember all over again."
    a "不过别担心。我会帮你重新想起来。"

# game/script.rpy:10685
translate chinese start_87223e16:

    # "She finally lets go of me."
    "她终于放开了我。"

# game/script.rpy:10696
translate chinese start_d5dbefa3:

    # a "Get plenty of rest."
    a "好好休息。"

# game/script.rpy:10701
translate chinese start_96454a80:

    # a "You have a {i}lot{/i} ahead of you."
    a "你前头还有{i}很多{/i}事呢。"

# game/script.rpy:10705
translate chinese start_7c303a6b:

    # "She goes away, leaving me to myself and to my broken body."
    "她走了，把我留给我自己，和这具破败的身体。"

# game/script.rpy:10706
translate chinese start_66f5f666:

    # "That night, I dream of how I got to be like this."
    "那天夜里，我梦到自己是怎么变成这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:10727
translate chinese start_a15416af:

    # "The evening of the day Grace told me we would kill Anna together, I worried so much that I got a fever."
    "Grace 说我们要一起杀掉 Anna 的那天晚上，我担心得发起了烧。"

# game/script.rpy:10729
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_103:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:10739
translate chinese start_464adb4a:

    # a "Goodness."
    a "天啊。"

# game/script.rpy:10741
translate chinese start_9efb2a3e:

    # "I was laying down on the bed. Anna put a cold, wet towel over my forehead."
    "我躺在床上。Anna 把一块冰凉的湿毛巾放在我额头上。"

# game/script.rpy:10746
translate chinese start_826b4a22:

    # a "I {i}did{/i} think you had a bit of a fever."
    a "我{i}就{/i}觉得你有点发烧。"

# game/script.rpy:10753
translate chinese start_559f8c75:

    # a "But you said you were fine when I left!"
    a "可我出门的时候你还好好的！"

# game/script.rpy:10755
translate chinese start_bf115662:

    # "I mumbled something. I might have been trying to tell her to stay away."
    "我含糊地说了句什么。也许是想叫她走开。"

# game/script.rpy:10756
translate chinese start_be09aaf7:

    # "It was seeing Anna—thinking about what we’d do to her—that had scared me so much that it made me sick."
    "是见到 Anna——是想到我们要对她做的事——把我吓得这么厉害，都吓病了。"

# game/script.rpy:10757
translate chinese start_90b2e925:

    # "I was weak."
    "我很虚弱。"

# game/script.rpy:10764
translate chinese start_ee511b60:

    # a "I can’t understand what you’re saying. Whatever it is, you can tell me later."
    a "我听不懂你在说什么。不管是什么，等会儿再说。"

# game/script.rpy:10769
translate chinese start_147c3c73:

    # a "For now, just rest."
    a "先好好休息。"

# game/script.rpy:10775
translate chinese start_24ae0ea6:

    # "My thermometer reading made her frown."
    "体温计上的数字让她皱起了眉。"

# game/script.rpy:10780
translate chinese start_f7ec6606:

    # a "If this goes up any more, I’m taking you to the hospital."
    a "再往上升，我就送你去医院。"

# game/script.rpy:10782
translate chinese start_93e4760d:

    # "I croaked out that I was fine."
    "我哑着嗓子说我没事。"

# game/script.rpy:10791
translate chinese start_06ebcf12_3:

    # a "Oh, sweetie."
    a "噢，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:10796
translate chinese start_c8aa4ff7:

    # a "You {i}will{/i} be fine. But only if you do as I say."
    a "你{i}会{/i}没事的。但前提是你照我说的做。"

# game/script.rpy:10801
translate chinese start_a8032f1b:

    # a "Try to get some sleep. I’ll get you some medicine and a nice cup of ginger root tea."
    a "试着睡一会儿。我去给你拿点药，再泡一杯暖暖的姜茶。"

# game/script.rpy:10803
translate chinese start_5210cba0_1:

    # j "...Thanks."
    j "……谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:10815
translate chinese start_dfbe9047:

    # n "I managed to sleep for the next hour, though I’d wake up constantly."
    n "接下来一小时我睡着了，只是不停地醒。"

# game/script.rpy:10823
translate chinese start_446d8c7f:

    # n "After that, I took a shower."
    n "之后我洗了个澡。"

# game/script.rpy:10824
translate chinese start_d631b463:

    # n "The water was so cold on my skin it hurt, but Anna had warned me not to set it to hot, so I didn’t."
    n "水冷得像针扎在皮肤上一样疼，可 Anna 警告过我不许把水调热，我就没调。"

# game/script.rpy:10832
translate chinese start_a3dd49d1:

    # n "I put on a fresh set of clothes. Then I lay down on the clean sheets Anna had laid out."
    n "我换上一套干净衣服，然后躺在 Anna 铺好的干净床单上。"

# game/script.rpy:10833
translate chinese start_1d020267:

    # n "Within ten minutes, everything was clammy with sweat again."
    n "不到十分钟，一切又被汗浸得黏湿。"

# game/script.rpy:10835
translate chinese start_5f00a5f6:

    # nvl clear
    # n "Anna didn’t blame me. She didn’t have a bad word to say—didn’t even sigh, though I knew she was tired."
    nvl clear
    n "Anna 没有怪我。她一句怨言都没有——连气都没叹一声，尽管我知道她累了。"

# game/script.rpy:10838
translate chinese start_bb69498b:

    # n "She was a saint."
    n "她简直是个圣人。"

# game/script.rpy:10839
translate chinese start_afeb5c77:

    # n "She was being so kind to me, and I was going to help kill her."
    n "她对我这么好，而我要帮着杀死她。"

# game/script.rpy:10841
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_104:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:10849
translate chinese start_45d51a36:

    # n "{i}There must be,{/i} I thought, {i}some other way.{/i}"
    n "{i}一定还有别的办法，{/i}我想。"

# game/script.rpy:10850
translate chinese start_87e1d3cf:

    # n "I couldn’t let this end in violence. I just couldn’t."
    n "我不能让这件事以暴力收场。我就是不能。"

# game/script.rpy:10851
translate chinese start_fa7527c8:

    # n "So my fever-numb brain came up with the best plan it could."
    n "于是我被烧得发木的脑子想出了它能想到的最好办法。"

# game/script.rpy:10853
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_105:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:10873
translate chinese start_ba2c6a07:

    # a "Hmm. I don’t know, Jack."
    a "嗯……我说不好，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:10879
translate chinese start_36fd9ce1:

    # a "Are you sure?"
    a "你确定？"

# game/script.rpy:10881
translate chinese start_e5618540:

    # j "Yes. I feel so much better now."
    j "确定。我现在好多了。"

# game/script.rpy:10888
translate chinese start_ba05d214:

    # a "I can take a day off. It’ll probably be fine."
    a "我可以请一天假。应该没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:10890
translate chinese start_daf1078e:

    # j "I’ll be okay."
    j "我会没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:10891
translate chinese start_00e4b1fa:

    # j "See?"
    j "你看。"

# game/script.rpy:10893
translate chinese start_b5129cee:

    # "I handed her the thermometer."
    "我把体温计递给她。"

# game/script.rpy:10894
translate chinese start_cd5a742f:

    # "It was a mercury thermometer, and I had carefully let it reach only a near-fever point."
    "那是支水银体温计，我小心地只让它升到接近发烧的位置。"

# game/script.rpy:10895
translate chinese start_9ea54a3d:

    # "I didn’t lie when I said I felt better, but I {i}did{/i} still have a fever."
    "我说好多了并不是撒谎，可我{i}确实{/i}还在发烧。"

# game/script.rpy:10900
translate chinese start_80524d96:

    # a "Well, all right then."
    a "好吧，就这样了。"

# game/script.rpy:10905
translate chinese start_86f27df8:

    # a "Please stay safe. And call if there’s any problems."
    a "注意安全。有什么事就打电话。"

# game/script.rpy:10910
translate chinese start_de575a73:

    # a "Anything at all. Okay?"
    a "哪怕再小的事也行。"

# game/script.rpy:10912
translate chinese start_53d71353_2:

    # j "Okay."
    j "好。"

# game/script.rpy:10916
translate chinese start_40fb37b9:

    # "She left, and I got to work."
    "她走了，我开始干活。"

# game/script.rpy:10926
translate chinese start_0a997e0a:

    # n "There was a trace of my past somewhere in the apartment—there had to be."
    n "公寓里一定留着我的过去的痕迹——一定留着。"

# game/script.rpy:10927
translate chinese start_da47d106:

    # n "I didn’t know where it was or what it would look like, but I hoped that Anna had brought {i}something{/i} with her here."
    n "我不知道它在哪儿、长什么样，但我希望 Anna 带了{i}点什么{/i}过来。"

# game/script.rpy:10928
translate chinese start_fc29bbce:

    # n "I was going to find it."
    n "我要把它找出来。"

# game/script.rpy:10930
translate chinese start_1edc4317:

    # nvl clear
    # n "Then I’d confront Anna with it, and whatever happened after that, I wasn’t going to let anyone get killed."
    nvl clear
    n "然后我拿它去质问 Anna，之后无论发生什么，我都不会让任何人被杀。"

# game/script.rpy:10933
translate chinese start_10a2ddac:

    # n "{i}I really should’ve done this before,{/i} I thought."
    n "{i}我真该早一点这么做，{/i}我想。"

# game/script.rpy:10934
translate chinese start_3945ac0b:

    # n "It would have saved me a lot of grief."
    n "那样能省掉我不少痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:10935
translate chinese start_1a2ffe06:

    # n "But it was no use thinking about what could’ve been. So I searched."
    n "可想着“本来会怎样”没有用。于是我翻找起来。"

# game/script.rpy:10937
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_106:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:10954
translate chinese start_d852a981:

    # n "I didn’t have to search long."
    n "我没找多久。"

# game/script.rpy:10955
translate chinese start_b29f423e:

    # n "I found what I was looking for in Anna’s nightstand, in the top drawer. It was the only thing there."
    n "我在 Anna 床头柜最上面的抽屉里找到了要找的东西。抽屉里只有它。"

# game/script.rpy:10956
translate chinese start_da7e802c:

    # n "Anna had come to trust me so much that she hadn’t bothered hiding it."
    n "Anna 已经信任我到懒得把它藏起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:10957
translate chinese start_f7f0977b:

    # n "Or she’d wanted me to find it."
    n "又或者，她是想让我找到。"

# game/script.rpy:10959
translate chinese start_93ac9272:

    # nvl clear
    # n "When I saw it, I didn’t think it was the clue I was looking for."
    nvl clear
    n "看到它时，我并不觉得这就是我要找的线索。"

# game/script.rpy:10962
translate chinese start_63f58e2d:

    # n "It was a picture book."
    n "那是一本图画书。"

# game/script.rpy:10963
translate chinese start_3b16bb3f:

    # n "A badly made one, too—thick pieces of paper stapled together, the drawings smeared on with crayons."
    n "而且做得很粗糙——几张厚纸钉在一起，画是用蜡笔涂上去的。"

# game/script.rpy:10965
translate chinese start_262a85cc:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I read it on a whim. I was curious."
    nvl clear
    n "我一时兴起读了起来。我好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:10968
translate chinese start_1b05f74e:

    # n "By the last page I wasn’t curious anymore."
    n "读到最后一页，我已经不好奇了。"

# game/script.rpy:10969
translate chinese start_64848233:

    # n "This wasn’t a picture book. It was a confession."
    n "这不是图画书。这是一份自白。"

# game/script.rpy:10971
translate chinese start_76b2fe88_107:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:10989
translate chinese start_8d464ae7:

    # "THE LITTLE WOLF"
    "小狼"

# game/script.rpy:10999
translate chinese start_4f6f9861:

    # "There once was a Little Wolf."
    "从前有一只小狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11000
translate chinese start_6967bab3:

    # "It had a Mommy Wolf, and it had a Daddy Wolf, but Mommy Wolf and Daddy Wolf didn’t love the Little Wolf."
    "他有一个狼妈妈，还有一个狼爸爸，可狼妈妈和狼爸爸不爱小狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11001
translate chinese start_83e70fa4:

    # "Why is that?"
    "为什么呢？"

# game/script.rpy:11011
translate chinese start_83e14959:

    # "They didn’t love it and they didn’t love each other, and they fought and fought and fought and fought, and then one day something happened and the Little Wolf was all by itself."
    "他们不爱他，也不爱彼此，他们吵啊吵啊吵啊吵，然后有一天，出了一件事，小狼就只剩自己一个了。"

# game/script.rpy:11012
translate chinese start_37f6fb6a:

    # "But the Little Wolf didn’t stay alone for long."
    "可小狼没有独自待太久。"

# game/script.rpy:11022
translate chinese start_34464364:

    # "One day a family of Sheep took it in."
    "有一天，一家羊收留了他。"

# game/script.rpy:11023
translate chinese start_835e4136:

    # "There was Mommy Sheep, and Daddy Sheep, and the Little Lamb, and the big dog named Buddy."
    "有羊妈妈，有羊爸爸，有小羊羔，还有一条叫 Buddy 的大狗。"

# game/script.rpy:11024
translate chinese start_ee3a1b5c:

    # "They were a happy family."
    "他们是幸福的一家。"

# game/script.rpy:11025
translate chinese start_bac3dad0:

    # "But they didn’t like Wolves."
    "但他们不喜欢狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11026
translate chinese start_af66b71b:

    # "Daddy Sheep said to the Little Wolf, \"Wolves should all be locked away.\" And he also said, \"You are lucky to be alive.\""
    "羊爸爸对小狼说：“狼都该被关起来。”他还说：“你能活着，是运气好。”"

# game/script.rpy:11027
translate chinese start_713cb8bb:

    # "They did not know that the Little Wolf was a Wolf."
    "他们不知道，小狼是狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11037
translate chinese start_d3a7ee20:

    # "So the Little Wolf played along, and it went baa baa like a Sheep and ate grass like a Sheep, and for a while it was happy."
    "于是小狼就跟着装，像羊一样咩咩叫，像羊一样吃草，有一阵子他也很快活。"

# game/script.rpy:11038
translate chinese start_8917cc14:

    # "But it wasn’t happy for long."
    "但他没能快活多久。"

# game/script.rpy:11039
translate chinese start_7b88a665:

    # "The Little Wolf was a Wolf. It was hungry."
    "小狼是狼。他饿了。"

# game/script.rpy:11040
translate chinese start_943f44ec:

    # "It needed to hunt."
    "他需要捕猎。"

# game/script.rpy:11041
translate chinese start_6f977349:

    # "It knew how to hunt, too."
    "他也会打猎。"

# game/script.rpy:11042
translate chinese start_fce58bb1:

    # "It had seen Daddy Wolf hunt. It had seen him do all kinds of things."
    "他见过狼爸爸打猎。见过他做各种各样的事。"

# game/script.rpy:11052
translate chinese start_322d143f:

    # "The first thing that the Little Wolf hunted was the big dog named Buddy."
    "小狼猎到的第一个东西，是那条叫 Buddy 的大狗。"

# game/script.rpy:11053
translate chinese start_da73eb0e:

    # "Mommy Sheep and Daddy Sheep were really scared!"
    "羊妈妈和羊爸爸吓坏了！"

# game/script.rpy:11054
translate chinese start_0ae73cb1:

    # "\"Oh no!\" they said. \"There are wolves around. We should be careful.\""
    "“哦不！”他们说，“附近有狼。我们得小心。”"

# game/script.rpy:11055
translate chinese start_f7f449d1:

    # "They didn’t know the Little Wolf had done it."
    "他们不知道是小狼干的。"

# game/script.rpy:11056
translate chinese start_1c00729c:

    # "But the Little Lamb did know."
    "可小羊羔知道。"

# game/script.rpy:11057
translate chinese start_9d579cbb:

    # "The Little Lamb didn’t like the Little Wolf."
    "小羊羔不喜欢小狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11067
translate chinese start_82a09687:

    # "The Little Wolf was afraid. The Little Lamb was going to tell Mommy Sheep and Daddy Sheep everything!"
    "小狼害怕了。小羊羔要把一切都告诉羊妈妈和羊爸爸！"

# game/script.rpy:11068
translate chinese start_e1c5e916:

    # "And it did tell them, but the Sheep didn’t believe the Little Lamb."
    "小羊羔真的说了，可那些羊不相信他。"

# game/script.rpy:11069
translate chinese start_e8a1503d:

    # "They didn't believe one word."
    "他们一个字都不信。"

# game/script.rpy:11070
translate chinese start_83e70fa4_1:

    # "Why is that?"
    "为什么呢？"

# game/script.rpy:11080
translate chinese start_f4d90983:

    # "And days passed, and weeks passed, and the Little Wolf was hungry again."
    "日子过去了，星期过去了，小狼又饿了。"

# game/script.rpy:11081
translate chinese start_ce46f468:

    # "Very hungry."
    "非常饿。"

# game/script.rpy:11082
translate chinese start_40d83f5f:

    # "And so one night it went to Mommy Sheep and Daddy Sheep's room."
    "于是一天夜里，他去了羊妈妈和羊爸爸的房间。"

# game/script.rpy:11092
translate chinese start_205a1d51:

    # "It ripped them open while they were sleeping."
    "趁他们睡着，他把他们撕开了。"

# game/script.rpy:11093
translate chinese start_cd6f9ed2:

    # "It got their blood all over itself."
    "他们的血溅了他一身。"

# game/script.rpy:11094
translate chinese start_8725ec24:

    # "And then the Little Wolf went to the Little Lamb."
    "然后小狼去找小羊羔。"

# game/script.rpy:11104
translate chinese start_a65de2aa:

    # "The Little Lamb was awake."
    "小羊羔醒着。"

# game/script.rpy:11105
translate chinese start_f7d4013c:

    # "The Little Lamb had heard the noise of its parents being hunted."
    "他听见了父母被猎杀的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:11106
translate chinese start_aaf6072e:

    # "It saw the blood. And it smelled the blood, too."
    "他看见了血。也闻到了血。"

# game/script.rpy:11107
translate chinese start_06e6349a:

    # "The Little Wolf came closer."
    "小狼走近了。"

# game/script.rpy:11108
translate chinese start_df814a7e:

    # "And as the Little Wolf came closer, it saw that the Little Lamb was not a Lamb at all."
    "小狼越走越近，才发现小羊羔根本不是羊。"

# game/script.rpy:11118
translate chinese start_6a75e48a:

    # "It was a Wolf."
    "那也是一只狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11119
translate chinese start_f4c363c5:

    # "Just like the Little Wolf."
    "和他一样。"

# game/script.rpy:11120
translate chinese start_2472517a:

    # "It had been hiding here with all those Sheep."
    "他一直藏在这些羊中间。"

# game/script.rpy:11121
translate chinese start_a51aff7f:

    # "Maybe it did not even know that it was a Wolf."
    "也许他连自己是狼都不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:11122
translate chinese start_53b1df25:

    # "The Little Wolf did not kill it."
    "小狼没有杀他。"

# game/script.rpy:11123
translate chinese start_21d979aa:

    # "The Little Wolf could not hunt one of its own."
    "小狼没法猎杀同类。"

# game/script.rpy:11133
translate chinese start_68b48068:

    # "So the Little Wolf went away."
    "于是小狼离开了。"

# game/script.rpy:11134
translate chinese start_b411f0b4:

    # "But before it left, the Little Wolf promised they would meet again."
    "但离开之前，小狼答应他们还会再见。"

# game/script.rpy:11135
translate chinese start_95d3c4ad:

    # "They would be two Wolves in a world of Sheep."
    "他们会是羊群世界里的两只狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11152
translate chinese start_dba70561:

    # j "...You bitch."
    j "……你这个婊子。"

# game/script.rpy:11157
translate chinese start_dc13dc80:

    # "I found it hard to stand back up."
    "我发现我很难再站起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11159
translate chinese start_9437323e:

    # j "Oh, you bitch."
    j "噢，你这个婊子。"

# game/script.rpy:11160
translate chinese start_e0bb5826:

    # j "This is what you wanted me to remember?"
    j "这就是你想让我想起来的？"

# game/script.rpy:11161
translate chinese start_374fb41f:

    # j "This is what you...?"
    j "你就是要我……？"

# game/script.rpy:11163
translate chinese start_ca63d0ef:

    # "This psycho had taken everything from me. Had almost done so a second time."
    "这个疯子夺走了我的一切。差一点又夺走一次。"

# game/script.rpy:11164
translate chinese start_f787c1ee:

    # "And for what...?"
    "为了什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:11166
translate chinese start_e1616514:

    # j "I swear..."
    j "我发誓……"

# game/script.rpy:11168
translate chinese start_645cc74b:

    # "I spoke aloud. I imagined my family there with me."
    "我把话说出了声。我想象家人就在我身边。"

# game/script.rpy:11169
translate chinese start_4a8f14bf:

    # "The family she'd taken."
    "被她夺走的那家人。"

# game/script.rpy:11171
translate chinese start_6d9eb2f2:

    # j "I swear—I swear I’ll..."
    j "我发誓——我发誓我要……"

# game/script.rpy:11173
translate chinese start_fe258c26:

    # "I’d what?"
    "我要怎样？"

# game/script.rpy:11174
translate chinese start_394d8303:

    # "Not even killing her seemed enough anymore."
    "现在连杀了她都不够。"

# game/script.rpy:11175
translate chinese start_f2ab87d5:

    # "Or maybe it {i}would{/i} be enough."
    "又或者，这样{i}就{/i}够了。"

# game/script.rpy:11176
translate chinese start_1e0b8d15:

    # "As long as we made it hurt."
    "只要让她够痛。"

# game/script.rpy:11188
translate chinese start_2753933b:

    # "{i}Where am I?{/i}"
    "{i}我在哪儿？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:11192
translate chinese start_932445f4:

    # "I stir—stirred?—only slightly awakening, dazed, not knowing if what I’m feeling around me is a dream or delusion or reality."
    "我动了动——是动了吗？——只醒来一点点，昏昏沉沉，分不清周身的感觉是梦、是幻觉，还是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:11193
translate chinese start_16035fcf:

    # "I’m sitting up, but I am not sitting still."
    "我坐着，可我坐得并不安稳。"

# game/script.rpy:11194
translate chinese start_75f1596a:

    # "There is rumbling underneath me. There is wind in my face."
    "身下有轰隆的震响。脸上有风。"

# game/script.rpy:11195
translate chinese start_14f026b1:

    # "Somehow, through all this, I sense that it’s nighttime."
    "不知怎的，这一切之中，我感觉到是夜里。"

# game/script.rpy:11196
translate chinese start_c7f5d54d:

    # "I try to speak. My limp mouth only manages a rasping breath."
    "我想说话。不听使唤的嘴只挤出一口沙哑的气。"

# game/script.rpy:11205
translate chinese start_7891e355:

    # a "Oh."
    a "噢。"

# game/script.rpy:11211
translate chinese start_a2722089:

    # a "Awake already?"
    a "已经醒了？"

# game/script.rpy:11217
translate chinese start_a20e82fc:

    # a "Tsk tsk. That won’t do."
    a "啧，啧。这可不行。"

# game/script.rpy:11223
translate chinese start_de2eff61:

    # "A familiar bee-sting of pain pinches the back of my neck."
    "后颈像被蜜蜂蜇了一下，一阵熟悉的疼。"

# game/script.rpy:11224
translate chinese start_44931e45:

    # "I feel myself sinking."
    "我感觉自己在往下沉。"

# game/script.rpy:11225
translate chinese start_5d809a6c:

    # "Then I feel nothing."
    "然后我什么也感觉不到了。"

# game/script.rpy:11226
translate chinese start_e96c1c61:

    # "I am gone—no more rumbling, no more wind in my face, no more me."
    "我消失了——没有轰响，没有脸上的风，没有我。"

# game/script.rpy:11238
translate chinese start_4952e416:

    # "By the time Anna came home, I had been stewing in my hate for hours."
    "Anna 回来的时候，我已经在恨意里煎熬了几个钟头。"

# game/script.rpy:11239
translate chinese start_0a911b09:

    # "My hate for her had become a living thing, eating away at me."
    "对她的恨成了活物，在啃食我。"

# game/script.rpy:11249
translate chinese start_754d6c74_1:

    # a "I’m back~"
    a "我回来啦～"

# game/script.rpy:11255
translate chinese start_3c96174d:

    # a "Jack? Hello?"
    a "Jack？有人吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11259
translate chinese start_6d9e7510:

    # "I tried to say hi back, but I couldn’t."
    "我想回一声，可发不出声。"

# game/script.rpy:11260
translate chinese start_4816434f:

    # "If I said anything at all, the hate would come spilling out of me. And it wasn’t time yet."
    "只要我一开口，恨就会从身上泼出来。而时候还没到。"

# game/script.rpy:11273
translate chinese start_93bd9776:

    # a "Where are you, Jack?"
    a "你在哪儿，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:11275
translate chinese start_a7652b0e:

    # "Anna sounded worried. This made me happy."
    "Anna 的声音听着担心。这让我高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:11276
translate chinese start_1dfd5643:

    # "I couldn’t fake it anymore. If she saw me, she would know."
    "我装不下去了。她看见我，就会知道。"

# game/script.rpy:11282
translate chinese start_a96be735:

    # "I ran to the bathroom, slammed the door shut and locked it."
    "我冲进浴室，砰地关上门，上了锁。"

# game/script.rpy:11283
translate chinese start_cacfb579:

    # "{i}I’ll be here,{/i} I thought."
    "{i}我就待在这儿，{/i}我想。"

# game/script.rpy:11284
translate chinese start_1eb28366:

    # "{i}Until it’s time, I’ll stay here.{/i}"
    "{i}在时候到之前，我就待在这儿。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:11285
translate chinese start_b86f77cc:

    # "{i}If I see her, I’ll lose my mind.{/i}"
    "{i}我看见她，就会失控。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:11287
translate chinese start_ab2d7260:

    # "Anna’s footsteps came pattering over to where I was."
    "Anna 的脚步声啪嗒啪嗒地朝我这边过来。"

# game/script.rpy:11289
translate chinese start_6facc5ff:

    # a "Sweetie, are you okay?"
    a "宝贝，你没事吧？"

# game/script.rpy:11291
translate chinese start_38f6c44a:

    # "She tried the handle, found it locked."
    "她试了试门把手，发现锁着。"

# game/script.rpy:11293
translate chinese start_cc2af92c:

    # a "You’re still sick?"
    a "你还没好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11294
translate chinese start_39631024:

    # a "Oh, I knew I shouldn’t have gone to work."
    a "噢，我就知道我不该去上班。"

# game/script.rpy:11296
translate chinese start_6afc54a3:

    # "There was a pause, then she tried again to open the door."
    "停了一下，她又试着开门。"

# game/script.rpy:11298
translate chinese start_f8ed234a:

    # a "H-Hey, at least say something. You’re scaring me."
    a "喂、喂，至少说句话。你这样吓到我了。"

# game/script.rpy:11299
translate chinese start_02c667a9:

    # a "Jack, can you hear me?"
    a "Jack，你听得见吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11301
translate chinese start_e7c11d2f:

    # j "I’m {i}fine.{/i}"
    j "我{i}没事{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:11303
translate chinese start_ab9b6a86:

    # "A sigh of relief."
    "她松了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:11305
translate chinese start_bec6623b:

    # a "Oh, good."
    a "噢，太好了。"

# game/script.rpy:11306
translate chinese start_0fdcd1cf:

    # a "Let me in now, darling."
    a "现在让我进去吧，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:11308
translate chinese start_1dd4185e_1:

    # j "No."
    j "不行。"

# game/script.rpy:11309
translate chinese start_feba8c2e:

    # j "I’m... staying here... for a while."
    j "我要……在这儿……待一会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:11311
translate chinese start_59c95a54:

    # a "Please open the door, Jack. You don’t sound all that good."
    a "把门打开吧，Jack。你听着不太好。"

# game/script.rpy:11312
translate chinese start_53be6311:

    # a "You sound like you’re in pain."
    a "听你的声音，好像很疼。"

# game/script.rpy:11314
translate chinese start_b0bd16d0:

    # j "{i}I said I’m fine!{/i}"
    j "{i}我说了我没事！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:11316
translate chinese start_bc6d5adc:

    # "There came another long moment of silence."
    "又是长长一阵沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:11318
translate chinese start_5b8f8e1b:

    # a "Please... please tell me what’s wrong."
    a "求你……求你告诉我怎么了。"

# game/script.rpy:11326
translate chinese start_0f884bbe:

    # "This time I didn’t answer. I lay down on the cold tiled floor."
    "这次我没回答。我躺到冰凉的瓷砖地上。"

# game/script.rpy:11327
translate chinese start_a9eec0fd:

    # "I would stay like this until I felt it was about six o’clock."
    "我打算就这么待着，直到感觉差不多六点。"

# game/script.rpy:11328
translate chinese start_6258b8dd:

    # "It’s not like I had a clock in here with me, but it was better to guess than to go out now."
    "这里当然没有钟，可现在出去，还不如靠猜。"

# game/script.rpy:11330
translate chinese start_e8d0305a_3:

    # a "Jack?"
    a "Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:11332
translate chinese start_2976074e_1:

    # j "Go away."
    j "走开。"

# game/script.rpy:11334
translate chinese start_272e5a6b:

    # "She walked away, and I thought that was it."
    "她走开了，我以为就这样了。"

# game/script.rpy:11335
translate chinese start_f6bf3226:

    # "But I heard her come back a minute later."
    "可一分钟后，我听见她回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:11337
translate chinese start_04704164:

    # a "I’m coming in, Jack."
    a "我进来了，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:11338
translate chinese start_4c0439e8:

    # a "Stand back from the door."
    a "离门远一点。"

# game/script.rpy:11340
translate chinese start_eb2abefe:

    # j "The hell are you—"
    j "你他妈在干——"

# game/script.rpy:11347
translate chinese start_021fa6e3:

    # "Something large and heavy struck the door."
    "什么又大又沉的东西砸在门上。"

# game/script.rpy:11349
translate chinese start_2c1eebd2:

    # j "Stop it!"
    j "停下！"

# game/script.rpy:11353
translate chinese start_6a8f80dd:

    # "It struck again, and then once more."
    "又砸了一下，再一下。"

# game/script.rpy:11354
translate chinese start_f6547f69:

    # "The flimsy wooden door was starting to cave in at the handle."
    "那扇薄木门的门把手处开始凹下去。"

# game/script.rpy:11355
translate chinese start_5deb26e2:

    # "Any more and it would splinter."
    "再砸就要裂开了。"

# game/script.rpy:11357
translate chinese start_5cb0c35a:

    # j "Anna, stop."
    j "Anna，住手。"

# game/script.rpy:11364
translate chinese start_635dae67:

    # "There was a dull thud as she let something heavy drop to the floor."
    "她把什么沉重的东西扔到地上，一声闷响。"

# game/script.rpy:11366
translate chinese start_e06a2836:

    # a "Haah... Haah..."
    a "哈……哈……"

# game/script.rpy:11367
translate chinese start_48acf1f7:

    # a "Come out... then."
    a "那就……出来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11369
translate chinese start_2da1bf27_1:

    # "I hesitated."
    "我犹豫了。"

# game/script.rpy:11371
translate chinese start_73e3c6db_1:

    # a "All right."
    a "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11373
translate chinese start_788b1d96:

    # "She grunted as she picked her tool back up again."
    "她哼了一声，又把工具捡了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11375
translate chinese start_2ce72bc6:

    # j "No, wait!"
    j "不，等等！"

# game/script.rpy:11376
translate chinese start_accbb4d5:

    # j "Stop. I’m coming out."
    j "住手。我出来了。"

# game/script.rpy:11382
translate chinese start_f3a73b82:

    # "The door handle was smashed so badly it almost refused to open."
    "门把手被砸得变了形，门几乎打不开了。"

# game/script.rpy:11397
translate chinese start_81141f5c:

    # a "Oh, Jack!"
    a "噢，Jack……"

# game/script.rpy:11401
translate chinese start_05582c95:

    # "Anna dropped what turned out to be a sledgehammer—dropped it next to her purse, which was on the floor."
    "Anna 把手里的东西扔到地上——那是一把大铁锤——放在地上她的手包旁边。"

# game/script.rpy:11410
translate chinese start_ab16170b:

    # "She all but jumped on me with open arms."
    "她几乎是张开双臂扑了上来。"

# game/script.rpy:11416
translate chinese start_8d0b0526:

    # a "Don’t do that to me again!"
    a "别再这样对我了！"

# game/script.rpy:11424
translate chinese start_87597947:

    # "I backed off away from her."
    "我往后退开了。"

# game/script.rpy:11430
translate chinese start_bb8e4b4e:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/script.rpy:11436
translate chinese start_910c8351:

    # a "Something is {i}wrong{/i}. I can feel it."
    a "有{i}哪里不对{/i}。我能感觉到。"

# game/script.rpy:11442
translate chinese start_bb368308:

    # a "What happened, Jack?"
    a "出什么事了，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:11444
translate chinese start_e338d961:

    # j "{i}Nothing{/i} happened!"
    j "{i}什么都没{/i}发生！"

# game/script.rpy:11453
translate chinese start_a93293cd:

    # a "Is it your..."
    a "是不是你的……"

# game/script.rpy:11455
translate chinese start_6b619700:

    # "She went to feel my temperature with her hand, but I slapped it away."
    "她伸手来摸我的额头，被我一把拍开。"

# game/script.rpy:11457
translate chinese start_247c18be:

    # j "Don’t touch me."
    j "别碰我。"

# game/script.rpy:11463
translate chinese start_dd307f67:

    # "My words stunned her—for a second."
    "我的话让她怔住了——只一秒。"

# game/script.rpy:11470
translate chinese start_3ecdd609:

    # a "Tch."
    a "啧。"

# game/script.rpy:11476
translate chinese start_d877c9e4:

    # a "And we were making such great progress."
    a "我们本来进展得多好啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11481
translate chinese start_9e2e2d83:

    # a "What went wrong?"
    a "哪里出错了？"

# game/script.rpy:11483
translate chinese start_6be6658d:

    # j "You know what went wrong! You know damn well!"
    j "你知道哪里出错了！你他妈清楚得很！"

# game/script.rpy:11484
translate chinese start_17dbb502:

    # j "Everything’s been wrong—ever since the beginning!"
    j "一切从一开始就错了！"

# game/script.rpy:11490
translate chinese start_6b7749c1:

    # a "You’re not making any sense, Jack."
    a "你说的毫无道理，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:11495
translate chinese start_14dd803c:

    # a "For now, just calm down. It’s going to be all right."
    a "先冷静下来。会没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:11497
translate chinese start_b1eec810:

    # j "No! Stay away from me!"
    j "不！离我远点！"

# game/script.rpy:11501
translate chinese start_9099492d:

    # "My back touched a wall. I stumbled." with vpunch
    "我的背抵到了墙。我踉跄了一下。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:11510
translate chinese start_b7d33ffd:

    # "Anna bent down as if to tie her shoelaces."
    "Anna 弯下腰，像是在系鞋带。"

# game/script.rpy:11528
translate chinese start_24d9279e:

    # "I saw her hand go into her purse."
    "我看见她的手伸进了手包。"

# game/script.rpy:11540
translate chinese start_674bd06f:

    # "Then she leapt."
    "然后她扑了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:11541
translate chinese start_5b67ae6a:

    # "She was on me before I could react."
    "我还没来得及反应，她已经扑上来。"

# game/script.rpy:11542
translate chinese start_0b779041:

    # "I thought she’d stab me with something—gut me then and there."
    "我以为她要用什么刺我——当场把我剖开。"

# game/script.rpy:11554
translate chinese start_fc9dd766:

    # "Instead she wrapped her arms around me, and put her lips to mine."
    "她却抱住我，把嘴唇贴了上来。"

# game/script.rpy:11556
translate chinese start_15044d06:

    # j "Mmmh?!"
    j "唔？！"

# game/script.rpy:11558
translate chinese start_c932fc06:

    # "I tried to pry her off, but she’d coiled herself around my body like a snake." with vpunch
    "我想把她掰开，她却像蛇一样缠住了我。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:11559
translate chinese start_55506a9a:

    # "I couldn’t find purchase." with hpunch
    "我抓不住任何东西。" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:11560
translate chinese start_a42b073f:

    # "I panicked."
    "我慌了。"

# game/script.rpy:11573
translate chinese start_fd37db9c:

    # "Her kissing was violent—hardly kissing at all."
    "她的吻很凶——几乎算不上吻。"

# game/script.rpy:11574
translate chinese start_d7f8bf15:

    # "More like she was biting my lips off."
    "更像是在把我的嘴唇咬下来。"

# game/script.rpy:11578
translate chinese start_a9fa55fa:

    # "I tried to put my hands between us and rip her from me, but Anna wouldn’t budge."
    "我想把手插进我们之间把她扯开，可 Anna 纹丝不动。"

# game/script.rpy:11579
translate chinese start_16a7b611:

    # "I felt powerless."
    "我感到无力。"

# game/script.rpy:11583
translate chinese start_9f5c6f56:

    # "I couldn’t even scream—I tried to, but it was too muffled for anyone to hear."
    "我连叫都叫不出来——我试了，可声音闷得没人听得见。"

# game/script.rpy:11597
translate chinese start_caa8f055:

    # "Then, in a moment of luck, I managed to stumble around—Anna still on me—until she was the one with her back to the wall."
    "然后，运气来了，我踉跄着转了个身——Anna 还挂在我身上——直到变成她背靠着墙。"

# game/script.rpy:11608
translate chinese start_ff5ceea7:

    # "I half-ran-half-fell into the wall." with vpunch
    "我半跑半摔地撞上墙。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:11617
translate chinese start_ea040315:

    # "Anna took the brunt of the impact."
    "冲击全落在了 Anna 身上。"

# game/script.rpy:11632
translate chinese start_25cf2e64:

    # a "Owie..."
    a "好痛……"

# game/script.rpy:11634
translate chinese start_0f123125:

    # j "Haah... Haah... Hahaha..."
    j "哈……哈……哈哈哈……"

# game/script.rpy:11640
translate chinese start_52f0ce3e:

    # a "That {i}hurt!{/i}"
    a "{i}好疼！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:11642
translate chinese start_1da4a52d:

    # "She was down on her knees now, rubbing the back of her head with her left hand."
    "她跪在地上，用左手揉着后脑。"

# game/script.rpy:11644
translate chinese start_9d8a6722:

    # j "Go... fuck yourself..."
    j "去……你妈的……"

# game/script.rpy:11648
translate chinese start_f90fc706:

    # "My lips pulsed with pain, felt raw."
    "我的嘴唇一跳一跳地疼，火辣辣的。"

# game/script.rpy:11649
translate chinese start_44a3fc90:

    # "I touched them, and my hand came back bloody."
    "我摸了一下，手收回来时全是血。"

# game/script.rpy:11651
translate chinese start_2b54ee02:

    # j "...Goddammit."
    j "……该死。"

# game/script.rpy:11652
translate chinese start_00af60f2:

    # j "You’re a real..."
    j "你实在是个——"

# game/script.rpy:11654
translate chinese start_69fd3112:

    # "I realized very late that there had been another flash of pain during our struggle—a feeling like someone had pinched me very strongly on my left shoulder."
    "我很晚才意识到，刚才扭打时还有过一阵疼——像有人在左肩上狠狠掐了一下。"

# game/script.rpy:11655
translate chinese start_b81f822b:

    # "I looked at the spot and found nothing there."
    "我看那个地方，什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:11657
translate chinese start_f9e24bba:

    # j "Anna... what was...?"
    j "Anna……那是……？"

# game/script.rpy:11671
translate chinese start_74b5d227:

    # "Anna looked at me, smiled, and opened up her right hand."
    "Anna 看着我，笑了笑，张开右手。"

# game/script.rpy:11672
translate chinese start_4bc505ab:

    # "It took me a few seconds to see what she was holding there—my eyes were having trouble focusing."
    "我花了几秒才看清她手里是什么——我的眼睛对不上焦。"

# game/script.rpy:11674
translate chinese start_416a130e:

    # j "Oh..."
    j "噢……"

# game/script.rpy:11676
translate chinese start_c490fff5:

    # "A syringe."
    "一支注射器。"

# game/script.rpy:11677
translate chinese start_db924cd4:

    # "An {i}empty{/i} syringe."
    "一支{i}空的{/i}注射器。"

# game/script.rpy:11679
translate chinese start_79b916d8:

    # j "Oh {i}shit{/i}..."
    j "噢{i}操{/i}……"

# game/script.rpy:11684
translate chinese start_6fd305cf:

    # a "That sure was tricky."
    a "这招可真够狡猾的。"

# game/script.rpy:11686
translate chinese start_944f0c3e:

    # j "What was—what did you drug me with?!"
    j "那是——你给我打了什么？！"

# game/script.rpy:11692
translate chinese start_e6808643:

    # "She waved the question away, like it was no concern of mine."
    "她摆摆手把问题挥开，像那与我无关。"

# game/script.rpy:11698
translate chinese start_ad759196:

    # a "Something to help you go into a nice, long sleep."
    a "能帮你好好睡上一大觉的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:11703
translate chinese start_050272d9:

    # a "Isn’t that nice?"
    a "不错吧？"

# game/script.rpy:11709
translate chinese start_8e054769:

    # a "Then we can begin your re-education."
    a "然后我们就可以开始你的再教育了。"

# game/script.rpy:11715
translate chinese start_82a43dfb:

    # a "...Your re-re-education."
    a "……再、再教育。"

# game/script.rpy:11717
translate chinese start_85e3d093:

    # j "Don’t fuck with me!"
    j "别耍我！"

# game/script.rpy:11728
translate chinese start_8660194e:

    # "I took a step towards her."
    "我朝她迈了一步。"

# game/script.rpy:11729
translate chinese start_17a9077e:

    # "My legs felt heavy."
    "腿很沉。"

# game/script.rpy:11730
translate chinese start_bf997787:

    # "Was it just me, or was it already getting hard to move?"
    "是我的错觉，还是我已经开始动不了了？"

# game/script.rpy:11732
translate chinese start_5f4a1326:

    # j "I’ll never go through that again!"
    j "我绝不会再经历一次那种事！"

# game/script.rpy:11733
translate chinese start_8cf42779:

    # j "You hear?!"
    j "听见没有？！"

# game/script.rpy:11740
translate chinese start_2af78814:

    # "I grabbed at her, but my hand struck the wall instead—almost a second after Anna had moved out of the way."
    "我伸手去抓她，手却打在墙上——Anna 已经闪开快一秒了。"

# game/script.rpy:11757
translate chinese start_a3c7cbb2:

    # a "Easy, now."
    a "慢点，别急。"

# game/script.rpy:11759
translate chinese start_78d39659:

    # "She put a hand on my shoulder."
    "她把手放在我肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:11764
translate chinese start_aff4bce8:

    # a "Just what are you trying to do?"
    a "你到底想干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:11766
translate chinese start_57a64f64:

    # j "Fuck off!"
    j "滚开！"

# game/script.rpy:11773
translate chinese start_8f029aae:

    # "I twisted around to get at her."
    "我扭身想去够她。"

# game/script.rpy:11774
translate chinese start_54cb9e12:

    # "But it was like moving underwater."
    "可那像在水里动作。"

# game/script.rpy:11780
translate chinese start_16b1e9b5:

    # a "Oh, please don’t do this, Jack."
    a "噢，求你别这样，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:11786
translate chinese start_0c9dd489:

    # a "You’re making it too fun to tease you."
    a "你这样，逗起来太有意思了。"

# game/script.rpy:11791
translate chinese start_0fc71c4c:

    # a "I won’t be able to hold back."
    a "我会忍不住的。"

# game/script.rpy:11801
translate chinese start_89d417bf:

    # "I stumbled down, just barely catching myself before my head hit the floor."
    "我往前栽，勉强在脑袋砸到地之前撑住。"

# game/script.rpy:11807
translate chinese start_b5df142f:

    # "My eyes wandered up to the ceiling."
    "我的视线飘向天花板。"

# game/script.rpy:11808
translate chinese start_cfabfaf0:

    # "My limbs were lead. I felt I could not move."
    "四肢像铅。我觉得自己动不了。"

# game/script.rpy:11823
translate chinese start_1851d0fe:

    # a "There you go."
    a "这就对了。"

# game/script.rpy:11825
translate chinese start_67a1da06:

    # j "Help..."
    j "救命……"

# game/script.rpy:11827
translate chinese start_923d4530:

    # "I was a fly."
    "我像一只苍蝇。"

# game/script.rpy:11833
translate chinese start_32fb53c2_2:

    # a "Hm?"
    a "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:11835
translate chinese start_67a1da06_1:

    # j "Help..."
    j "救命……"

# game/script.rpy:11837
translate chinese start_a2674f22:

    # "Trapped in a spider’s web."
    "困在蛛网里。"

# game/script.rpy:11844
translate chinese start_a56b917d:

    # a "Honestly, what are you doing?"
    a "说真的，你在干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:11846
translate chinese start_67a1da06_2:

    # j "Help..."
    j "救命……"

# game/script.rpy:11848
translate chinese start_8f60cd48:

    # "With no way out."
    "无路可出。"

# game/script.rpy:11853
translate chinese start_bfa98a81:

    # a "Stop that."
    a "停下！"

# game/script.rpy:11855
translate chinese start_47d37599:

    # j "{i}HELP!{/i}"
    j "{i}救命！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:11861
translate chinese start_284e64e1:

    # a "The neighbors will think we’re weird."
    a "邻居会以为我们很奇怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:11863
translate chinese start_48fc0caa:

    # "I went to shout again, but something caught in my throat, and instead I nearly coughed my lungs out on the floor."
    "我又想喊，可喉咙里堵住了什么，结果差点把肺都咳出来。"

# game/script.rpy:11872
translate chinese start_a1f33fec:

    # a "Are you all tuckered out now, sweetie?"
    a "累坏了吧，宝贝？"

# game/script.rpy:11877
translate chinese start_31ab0974:

    # a "Goodness, you really had some fight in you. You’re pretty scary."
    a "天啊，你还真能挣扎。挺吓人的。"

# game/script.rpy:11882
translate chinese start_42843a5d:

    # a "Next time I’ll definitely..."
    a "下次我一定……"

# game/script.rpy:11888
translate chinese start_f974c65d:

    # a "Hm? What’s that?"
    a "嗯？那是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:11890
translate chinese start_b0aaaa85:

    # "I heard it then, too."
    "这时我也听见了。"

# game/script.rpy:11894
translate chinese start_2e8296ad:

    # "The front door handle rattled. Then someone banged on it twice."
    "前门把手响了。接着有人敲了两下。"

# game/script.rpy:11899
translate chinese start_3320c3ed:

    # a "Ah."
    a "啊……"

# game/script.rpy:11905
translate chinese start_0bceaff6_1:

    # "Anna laughed."
    "Anna 笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:11911
translate chinese start_43954998:

    # a "I think I know who this is."
    a "我想我知道这是谁。"

# game/script.rpy:11913
translate chinese start_2a37ff36:

    # "And it dawned on me, too."
    "我也明白过来了。"

# game/script.rpy:11914
translate chinese start_eb7373d9:

    # "I tried to shout again, but I was still coughing."
    "我又想喊，可我还在咳。"

# game/script.rpy:11929
translate chinese start_0e8243a0:

    # "Anna went to the front door on tiptoes and checked the peep hole."
    "Anna 踮脚走到前门，看了看猫眼。"

# game/script.rpy:11935
translate chinese start_b60be04a:

    # "She had to put a hand over her mouth to stop herself from giggling."
    "她不得不用手捂住嘴，才没笑出声。"

# game/script.rpy:11941
translate chinese start_c94ad6f5:

    # "To me she mouthed the words, \"Guess who?\""
    "她对我无声地做口型：“猜是谁？”"

# game/script.rpy:11942
translate chinese start_e9e94457:

    # "I knew who."
    "我知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:11943
translate chinese start_37f6909d:

    # "She was here early. And I’d failed her."
    "她来早了。而我辜负了她。"

# game/script.rpy:11953
translate chinese start_3739d974:

    # "Anna waited until the banging started again."
    "Anna 等到敲门声再度响起。"

# game/script.rpy:11961
translate chinese start_7702b7dd:

    # "In a single, fluid motion, she unlocked the door, opened it, and stood back."
    "她一个流畅的动作开了锁、拉开门，然后退开。"

# game/script.rpy:11971
translate chinese start_db5a6b1f:

    # g "Ah!"
    g "啊！"

# game/script.rpy:11973
translate chinese start_788de25c:

    # "Grace stumbled in, her toothpick of a knife in hand."
    "Grace 踉跄着进来，手里握着那把牙签似的小刀。"

# game/script.rpy:11975
translate chinese start_9f7aad0c:

    # j "Gra..."
    j "Grace……"

# game/script.rpy:11981
translate chinese start_7117c9bf:

    # g "Jack!"
    g "Jack！"

# game/script.rpy:11987
translate chinese start_0d412032:

    # g "What—"
    g "什么——"

# game/script.rpy:11992
translate chinese start_9170ec15:

    # "Anna was a blur."
    "Anna 快得像一团影。"

# game/script.rpy:12000
translate chinese start_16488cea:

    # "She elbowed Grace in the stomach, then jumped back as if expecting Grace to slash at her."
    "她一肘撞在 Grace 肚子上，随即往后跳开，像是怕 Grace 挥刀。"

# game/script.rpy:12001
translate chinese start_b422efd2:

    # "Grace did nothing of the sort."
    "Grace 根本没能这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:12005
translate chinese start_be6f1721:

    # "Her knife slipped from her hand. She fell down right after it."
    "刀从她手里滑落。她跟着倒了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:12020
translate chinese start_9f5b302d:

    # a "...Huh?"
    a "啥？"

# game/script.rpy:12025
translate chinese start_1e780950:

    # a "That’s it?"
    a "就这样？"

# game/script.rpy:12031
translate chinese start_8eae93ed:

    # a "...Really?"
    a "真的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12035
translate chinese start_47138a0c:

    # "After closing and locking the door again, Anna stepped closer, fearless now."
    "重新关上门锁好后，Anna 走近了些，此刻已无所畏惧。"

# game/script.rpy:12036
translate chinese start_8d2e53d2:

    # "She kicked Grace in the ribs."
    "她一脚踢在 Grace 的肋骨上。"

# game/script.rpy:12047
translate chinese start_e6055f9f:

    # g "Gah!"
    g "呃啊！"

# game/script.rpy:12058
translate chinese start_f8257783:

    # a "You invade someone’s home, and this is all you can do?"
    a "闯进别人家里，你就这点本事？"

# game/script.rpy:12064
translate chinese start_403be28c:

    # a "Someone’s {i}precious{/i} home?"
    a "闯进别人{i}珍爱{/i}的家？"

# game/script.rpy:12071
translate chinese start_605fc3f6:

    # g "Please... stop..."
    g "求你……别……"

# game/script.rpy:12077
translate chinese start_255ddad0:

    # g "I’m... sorry..."
    g "我很抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:12087
translate chinese start_d4bbd073:

    # "Anna sighed."
    "Anna 叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:12093
translate chinese start_6462a9db:

    # a "You’re hopeless."
    a "你真是没救了。"

# game/script.rpy:12097
translate chinese start_8cf4476a:

    # "She went to her purse and rummaged through it."
    "她走到手包那儿翻找。"

# game/script.rpy:12113
translate chinese start_366bb12f:

    # a "I knew you had your hand in this. You’re the only one who can corrupt my Jack this way."
    a "我就知道有你一份。只有你能把我的 Jack 带坏成这样。"

# game/script.rpy:12118
translate chinese start_62c102ca:

    # a "Well, no more."
    a "好了，到此为止。"

# game/script.rpy:12122
translate chinese start_9087512e:

    # "Anna brought back another syringe, this one still filled with a clear liquid."
    "Anna 又拿出一支注射器，这支里还装着透明液体。"

# game/script.rpy:12132
translate chinese start_02652d3d:

    # a "This is a Jack dose."
    a "这是按 Jack 的剂量配的。"

# game/script.rpy:12139
translate chinese start_c342d7e5:

    # a "Try not to die, okay?"
    a "尽量别死，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12141
translate chinese start_32ac5142:

    # j "Stop..."
    j "住手……"

# game/script.rpy:12142
translate chinese start_b7af8d89:

    # j "Stop that..."
    j "停下！"

# game/script.rpy:12149
translate chinese start_87025e0c:

    # "I had managed to stand back up."
    "我勉强又站了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:12150
translate chinese start_5b4c4326:

    # "I wasn’t going to let this freak hurt Grace."
    "我不会让这个疯子伤害 Grace。"

# game/script.rpy:12152
translate chinese start_c7892273:

    # j "Leave her alone!"
    j "放开她！"

# game/script.rpy:12153
translate chinese start_4f21252a:

    # j "Chrissake, don’t do that!"
    j "老天，别这样！"

# game/script.rpy:12160
translate chinese start_1775a024:

    # a "Do what?"
    a "做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:12162
translate chinese start_6ea28b54:

    # "I looked again."
    "我又看了一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:12163
translate chinese start_ae878c35:

    # "It had already been done. The syringe was empty."
    "已经做完了。注射器空了。"

# game/script.rpy:12164
translate chinese start_53a23370:

    # "I’d been too slow."
    "我太慢了。"

# game/script.rpy:12169
translate chinese start_60f0051d:

    # a "Sit down and be a good, patient boy again."
    a "坐下，重新做个听话的好孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:12175
translate chinese start_f4f4a6fa:

    # a "While I decide what I’ll do with this girl."
    a "让我想想该拿这女孩怎么办。"

# game/script.rpy:12179
translate chinese start_6c15297e:

    # "Anna wandered off into another room. She shouted from there."
    "Anna 晃进了另一个房间。她在那里面喊了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:12181
translate chinese start_f2f11093:

    # a "Do we have any rope, Jack?"
    a "我们有绳子吗，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:12182
translate chinese start_16d5ecc8:

    # a "I’m sure I bought some."
    a "我记得我买过一些。"

# game/script.rpy:12191
translate chinese start_741d8229:

    # "I rushed to where Grace was on the floor."
    "我冲到倒在地上的 Grace 身边。"

# game/script.rpy:12202
translate chinese start_8af28214:

    # "She wasn’t squirming in pain anymore."
    "她不再疼得扭动了。"

# game/script.rpy:12203
translate chinese start_dae36859:

    # "Instead she was lying down incredibly still. For a second I thought she was dead, and my heart sank."
    "她却躺在那儿，一动不动。有一秒我以为她死了，心一下沉了。"

# game/script.rpy:12204
translate chinese start_d967a656:

    # "But she was still alive."
    "可她还活着。"

# game/script.rpy:12209
translate chinese start_62263757:

    # "She was breathing quick, shallow breaths. Her eyes were closed but fluttering."
    "她呼吸又快又浅。眼睛闭着，眼睫却在颤。"

# game/script.rpy:12211
translate chinese start_0c6f6644:

    # j "Shit..."
    j "操……"

# game/script.rpy:12215
translate chinese start_64069980:

    # "I needed to get her to a doctor."
    "我得送她去看医生。"

# game/script.rpy:12216
translate chinese start_bc85a9c5:

    # "I looked up to the entrance."
    "我抬头看向门口。"

# game/script.rpy:12220
translate chinese start_5f5237f2:

    # "By some miracle, Anna had left the key in the door."
    "不知怎么的，Anna 把钥匙留在了门上。"

# game/script.rpy:12222
translate chinese start_896cf3d8:

    # a "What about duct tape, Jack?"
    a "胶带呢，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:12223
translate chinese start_f838c8f2:

    # a "Hey, Jack?"
    a "喂，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:12234
translate chinese start_f942a42e:

    # "I managed to turn the key in the lock, even in the state I was in."
    "就算成了这副样子，我还是把钥匙拧动了。"

# game/script.rpy:12235
translate chinese start_55a2168d:

    # "I turned back to Grace."
    "我转回 Grace 那边。"

# game/script.rpy:12251
translate chinese start_f07cbba0:

    # "Though she probably couldn’t hear me, I had to tell her something."
    "她大概听不见，可我得跟她说句话。"

# game/script.rpy:12253
translate chinese start_a0d72b68:

    # j "Grace, I’ll... go get help."
    j "Grace，我……我去找人帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:12254
translate chinese start_911a21b6:

    # j "I’ll be back soon."
    j "我很快就回来。"

# game/script.rpy:12263
translate chinese start_ca8ec731:

    # "I couldn’t carry her out. I was on the verge of collapsing on my own."
    "我抱不动她出去。我自己都快倒了。"

# game/script.rpy:12264
translate chinese start_d197e095:

    # "The best I could do was get someone down on the street to help me."
    "我能做的，只有到街上叫人帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:12265
translate chinese start_7bb325a6:

    # "I turned the handle, using both hands."
    "我用两只手转动门把。"

# game/script.rpy:12266
translate chinese start_ad4374d7:

    # "The door wouldn’t open."
    "门打不开。"

# game/script.rpy:12268
translate chinese start_71206505:

    # j "What the..."
    j "什么……"

# game/script.rpy:12269
translate chinese start_4b970e4c:

    # j "Oh, no..."
    j "噢，不！"

# game/script.rpy:12277
translate chinese start_635ae9ab:

    # "The door was bolted shut."
    "门被插上了插销。"

# game/script.rpy:12278
translate chinese start_f6c82fb6:

    # "Anna must have added the bolt lock on her own. Mine and Grace’s apartment didn’t have one."
    "插销锁一定是 Anna 自己装的。我和 Grace 那间公寓没有这个。"

# game/script.rpy:12279
translate chinese start_6ce63439:

    # "I tried to unlock it, but my fingers wouldn’t move like I wanted them to."
    "我想拉开插销，可手指不听使唤。"

# game/script.rpy:12280
translate chinese start_d0295c30:

    # "I tried and tried again."
    "我一遍又一遍地试。"

# game/script.rpy:12281
translate chinese start_68225aa2:

    # "At best I managed to get my nails caught on the bolt, almost ripping them off."
    "最好的情况也只是指甲卡在插销上，几乎把指甲掀掉。"

# game/script.rpy:12282
translate chinese start_4f36a261:

    # "I nearly cried from frustration."
    "我急得差点哭出来。"

# game/script.rpy:12284
translate chinese start_30c117dd:

    # j "Damn it, damn it, damn it..."
    j "见鬼，见鬼，见鬼……"

# game/script.rpy:12288
translate chinese start_615d15ca:

    # "On the verge of giving up and letting go, I looked around the small apartment—and found my means of escape."
    "就在要放弃、要撒手的时候，我环顾这间小公寓——找到了逃出去的办法。"

# game/script.rpy:12303
translate chinese start_faa9a4cb:

    # a "Ugh, I’ll either have to use my really nice cuffs on her or go to the..."
    a "唉，我要么得用我那副挺好的手铐铐她，要么去……"

# game/script.rpy:12310
translate chinese start_7d41866f:

    # a "Hm? Jack?"
    a "嗯？Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:12315
translate chinese start_4d0d6a78:

    # a "Where are...?"
    a "你们在哪……？"

# game/script.rpy:12321
translate chinese start_5a9e021d:

    # a "Oh, shit!"
    a "噢，不！"

# game/script.rpy:12325
translate chinese start_d6b3b58d:

    # "Anna had seen me hanging out the window legs-first."
    "Anna 看见了我腿先探出窗的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:12326
translate chinese start_904adff0:

    # "She ran over to me. I slid further back."
    "她朝我跑过来。我又往外挪了挪。"

# game/script.rpy:12335
translate chinese start_189277c7:

    # a "Jack, you’ll fall!"
    a "Jack，你会掉下去的！"

# game/script.rpy:12337
translate chinese start_fcceffc0_5:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:12339
translate chinese start_779f1568:

    # "It was a miracle I’d managed to slide back the curtains and open the window with my useless hands."
    "我用那双废手拉开窗帘、打开窗户，简直是奇迹。"

# game/script.rpy:12341
translate chinese start_7be6c42c:

    # j "Stay away from me."
    j "离我远点。"

# game/script.rpy:12343
translate chinese start_5b73bf59:

    # "I was holding on to the windowsill with open palms, and I was slipping."
    "我摊开手掌抓着窗台，正在往下滑。"

# game/script.rpy:12349
translate chinese start_58bde009:

    # a "No! You’ll hurt yourself!"
    a "不！你会伤到自己的！"

# game/script.rpy:12354
translate chinese start_58740a85:

    # a "Take my hand."
    a "抓住我的手。"

# game/script.rpy:12358
translate chinese start_3fd0fe1d:

    # "I glanced at the street below."
    "我瞥了一眼下面的街。"

# game/script.rpy:12359
translate chinese start_4934a669:

    # "When I’d gone to climb out, it didn’t look like much of a drop. This was only the second floor, after all."
    "爬出来的时候，看着不算高。毕竟只是二楼。"

# game/script.rpy:12360
translate chinese start_dbcc3902:

    # "Now I wasn’t so sure."
    "现在我没那么确定了。"

# game/script.rpy:12361
translate chinese start_2d45e068:

    # "There was {i}so much{/i} empty space between me and the hard concrete."
    "我跟硬水泥地之间，隔着{i}那么{/i}大一片空当。"

# game/script.rpy:12373
translate chinese start_0493e31e:

    # a "Take my hand, Jack!"
    a "抓住我的手，Jack！"

# game/script.rpy:12375
translate chinese start_a58b7feb:

    # "If I landed well, though, I’d be fine..."
    "不过要是落得好，我会没事的……"

# game/script.rpy:12376
translate chinese start_35f09726:

    # "...probably."
    "大概吧。"

# game/script.rpy:12383
translate chinese start_a0ba3501:

    # a "What are you waiting for?!"
    a "你还在等什么？！"

# game/script.rpy:12389
translate chinese start_a9c5a660:

    # "Anna grabbed my wrists."
    "Anna 抓住了我的手腕。"

# game/script.rpy:12393
translate chinese start_b1c24079_1:

    # j "Bye."
    j "再见。"

# game/script.rpy:12406
translate chinese start_58085003:

    # "My hands let go."
    "我的手松开了。"

# game/script.rpy:12407
translate chinese start_4a67d6bb:

    # "I was not connected to anything."
    "我跟任何东西都不再相连。"

# game/script.rpy:12408
translate chinese start_bc8fd2a1:

    # "I floated."
    "我飘了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:12418
translate chinese start_875901b9:

    # j "Gah..." with vpunch
    j "呃……" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:12420
translate chinese start_80e08afc:

    # "The impact knocked the wind right out of me."
    "那一撞把我肺里的气全撞没了。"

# game/script.rpy:12421
translate chinese start_585d3b77:

    # "There wasn’t much pain. But I knew I’d landed badly."
    "不太疼。可我知道自己落得很糟。"

# game/script.rpy:12422
translate chinese start_5ea5dcc7:

    # "I looked down at my body."
    "我低头看自己的身体。"

# game/script.rpy:12423
translate chinese start_458bcdae:

    # "My leg was a shape no leg should be."
    "我的腿成了一个腿不该有的形状。"

# game/script.rpy:12442
translate chinese start_a576399c:

    # "I come back to consciousness gasping for air."
    "我喘着气回到意识里。"

# game/script.rpy:12443
translate chinese start_c9906b5d:

    # "I look at my leg."
    "我看向我的腿。"

# game/script.rpy:12444
translate chinese start_a5e800b3:

    # "There’s a blanket over it."
    "上面盖着一条毯子。"

# game/script.rpy:12445
translate chinese start_b2c911b2:

    # "I push the blanket aside. My leg is there—in a cast."
    "我把毯子推开。我的腿还在——打着石膏。"

# game/script.rpy:12446
translate chinese start_1a68b7de:

    # "It’s ramrod straight."
    "它笔直地挺着。"

# game/script.rpy:12447
translate chinese start_2a84643c:

    # "The sight calms me."
    "看到这一幕，我平静下来。"

# game/script.rpy:12458
translate chinese start_b189acde:

    # "Only then do I realize that I’m not in my hospital bed."
    "到这时我才发现，我不在医院病床上。"

# game/script.rpy:12462
translate chinese start_313b99c9:

    # "I am in a wheelchair, in some abandoned place."
    "我在一张轮椅上，在一处废弃的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:12463
translate chinese start_6a962f42:

    # "It’s cold."
    "很冷。"

# game/script.rpy:12471
translate chinese start_0ee48bf2:

    # a "Good morning, sleepyhead."
    a "早上好，小懒虫。"

# game/script.rpy:12476
translate chinese start_b090affa:

    # "Anna is there, with a large sack of who-knows-what at her feet."
    "Anna 在那儿，脚边放着一个大袋子，天知道装的是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:12477
translate chinese start_a431fd0b:

    # "I wait until my breath is back before speaking."
    "我等到喘匀了气才开口。"

# game/script.rpy:12479
translate chinese start_0967d678:

    # j "Of course you’re here."
    j "你当然在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:12480
translate chinese start_fa93dac8:

    # j "Has there ever been a bad moment in my life without you?"
    j "我这辈子有哪个倒霉时刻是没有你的？"

# game/script.rpy:12485
translate chinese start_96878f94:

    # "She says nothing, only smiles."
    "她什么也没说，只是笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:12486
translate chinese start_02513e4d:

    # "I look around."
    "我环顾四周。"

# game/script.rpy:12488
translate chinese start_e705420c:

    # j "So you kidnapped me."
    j "所以你绑架了我。"

# game/script.rpy:12489
translate chinese start_7db33281:

    # j "The hospital will find you."
    j "医院会找到你的。"

# game/script.rpy:12496
translate chinese start_9a7f2114:

    # a "No, no, no!"
    a "不不不！"

# game/script.rpy:12501
translate chinese start_ca0712af:

    # a "I didn’t kidnap you, dear."
    a "我没有绑架你，亲爱的。"

# game/script.rpy:12506
translate chinese start_501691b0:

    # a "You were discharged. I did all the paperwork and everything."
    a "你出院了。所有手续都是我去办的。"

# game/script.rpy:12514
translate chinese start_be3e542c:

    # a "You got out a little early! I’m sure that makes you glad."
    a "你提前出来了！我肯定你很高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:12521
translate chinese start_7ba5f5b6:

    # a "But you were sleeping, so I had to sign for you as well."
    a "不过你在睡觉，所以你的字也得我代签。"

# game/script.rpy:12527
translate chinese start_514b0145:

    # a "The doctor didn’t mind much, though. He even let me cancel your rehab facility stay."
    a "医生倒不太在意。他甚至让我取消了你的康复中心。"

# game/script.rpy:12529
translate chinese start_27d5fd58:

    # j "Goddammit..."
    j "该死……"

# game/script.rpy:12531
translate chinese start_fd051e7d:

    # "That asshole of a doctor..."
    "那个混蛋医生……"

# game/script.rpy:12532
translate chinese start_284555a8:

    # "So nobody is looking for me."
    "所以没人会来找我。"

# game/script.rpy:12533
translate chinese start_8da1345d:

    # "This is it. She has me where she wants me."
    "就是这样。她把我弄到了她想让我在的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:12534
translate chinese start_aca74319:

    # "She’s won."
    "她赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:12535
translate chinese start_10294e0f:

    # "...Or at least that’s what I want her to think."
    "……至少我想让她这么以为。"

# game/script.rpy:12536
translate chinese start_0ce4bcd6:

    # "I slip my thumb under my cast and smile."
    "我把拇指伸到石膏下面，笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:12537
translate chinese start_80b2aec9:

    # "It’s still there. Right where I put it."
    "它还在。就在我放的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:12539
translate chinese start_d59dcc94:

    # j "Why did you bring me here, Anna?"
    j "你为什么把我带到这儿来，Anna？"

# game/script.rpy:12540
translate chinese start_123012f2:

    # j "And where is here?"
    j "那这儿是哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:12546
translate chinese start_845aaade:

    # a "You mean you don’t recognize it?"
    a "你的意思是你不认得了？"

# game/script.rpy:12551
translate chinese start_b97e5d44:

    # a "Take a look outside."
    a "看看外面。"

# game/script.rpy:12555
translate chinese start_7ad9ad77:

    # "I look out the busted windows."
    "我透过破掉的窗户往外看。"

# game/script.rpy:12556
translate chinese start_71bcf3d8:

    # "We are fairly high up. On the ground below us is a sea of tall grass."
    "我们在相当高的地方。下面地上是一片高高的草海。"

# game/script.rpy:12560
translate chinese start_fef36f89:

    # "In the middle of the grass is a square of dark concrete."
    "草中间有一块方形的水泥地，颜色发暗。"

# game/script.rpy:12561
translate chinese start_8d1221d8:

    # j "This is..."
    j "这是……"

# game/script.rpy:12574
translate chinese start_d03564c5:

    # a "This is where you showed your love to me."
    a "这就是你向我表达爱意的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:12580
translate chinese start_ee19f2f4:

    # a "By burning everything that reminded you of that... girl."
    a "你烧掉了所有让你想起那个……女孩的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:12582
translate chinese start_781515e8:

    # j "Tell me where she is. Now."
    j "告诉我她在哪儿。现在。"

# game/script.rpy:12588
translate chinese start_7891e355_1:

    # a "Oh."
    a "噢。"

# game/script.rpy:12594
translate chinese start_be0a85a1:

    # a "I {i}was{/i} surprised how nonchalant you were about this."
    a "你在这件事上那么淡定，我{i}还{/i}挺意外的。"

# game/script.rpy:12598
translate chinese start_393c45fc:

    # "Anna kicks the bag at her feet, and it whines."
    "Anna 踢了踢脚边的袋子，袋子里发出呜咽。"

# game/script.rpy:12600
translate chinese start_63563a7e:

    # j "Oh God..."
    j "天啊……"

# game/script.rpy:12602
translate chinese start_6ac80af4:

    # "It isn’t a bag. It’s Grace, bound and gagged."
    "那不是袋子。是 Grace，被绑着、塞着嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:12604
translate chinese start_fc0e54c2:

    # j "Untie her, goddammit!"
    j "把她解开，该死的！"

# game/script.rpy:12605
translate chinese start_05838a22:

    # j "Can’t you see she’s hurt?!"
    j "你看不出她受伤了吗？！"

# game/script.rpy:12614
translate chinese start_ed4cba80:

    # a "She's not hurt!"
    a "她没受伤！"

# game/script.rpy:12620
translate chinese start_7e8794ba:

    # a "She’s fine. See?"
    a "她好好的。你看？"

# game/script.rpy:12625
translate chinese start_0a8b0049:

    # "Anna removes the rag she’d stuffed in Grace’s mouth."
    "Anna 把她塞在 Grace 嘴里的布拿掉。"

# game/script.rpy:12631
translate chinese start_c617063b:

    # a "I gave her water and kept her fed and everything."
    a "我给她水喝，管她吃饭，什么都做了。"

# game/script.rpy:12636
translate chinese start_b43232d1:

    # a "Well, most of the time..."
    a "嗯，大部分时候……"

# game/script.rpy:12643
translate chinese start_64cf510e:

    # a "But I tell you what, she used to be a real handful."
    a "不过我跟你说，她以前可真够难缠的。"

# game/script.rpy:12660
translate chinese start_5a22c8ab:

    # "Grace only stares blankly."
    "Grace 只是茫然地盯着。"

# game/script.rpy:12662
translate chinese start_23a3a144:

    # j "Let Grace go, you monster!"
    j "放了 Grace，你这个怪物！"

# game/script.rpy:12663
translate chinese start_f2cad7e0:

    # j "Take those cuffs off."
    j "把手铐解开。"

# game/script.rpy:12665
translate chinese start_451b535a:

    # "Grace’s arms are cuffed behind her back. Her legs are cuffed together, too."
    "Grace 的手被铐在背后。腿也铐在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:12669
translate chinese start_8b82ab2a:

    # "She’s mumbling something now."
    "她现在在含糊地说着什么。"

# game/script.rpy:12680
translate chinese start_a102b1d0:

    # a "Let her go yourself."
    a "那你自己来放她。"

# game/script.rpy:12685
translate chinese start_dadcae30:

    # a "I’ll give you the key."
    a "我把钥匙给你。"

# game/script.rpy:12687
translate chinese start_aa25a865:

    # "Anna dangles the key in my face."
    "Anna 把钥匙在我面前晃。"

# game/script.rpy:12689
translate chinese start_0139a5ad:

    # j "...It’s never that easy with you."
    j "……跟你打交道从来不会这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:12690
translate chinese start_479f7c7d:

    # j "What do you want?"
    j "你想要什么？"

# game/script.rpy:12696
translate chinese start_c9292e28:

    # a "Are you serious?"
    a "你是认真的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12701
translate chinese start_de95341c:

    # a "Are you actually serious?"
    a "你认真的？"

# game/script.rpy:12707
translate chinese start_1d0c7c87:

    # a "You’re asking me what I want, Jack?"
    a "你问我想要什么，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:12714
translate chinese start_d0eee716:

    # a "I want the same {i}gosh{/i}-darned thing I’ve been telling you all this time."
    a "我要的就是我一直跟你说的{i}那件{/i}事。"

# game/script.rpy:12721
translate chinese start_d45d31ca:

    # a "I want you to remember {i}us.{/i}"
    a "我要你想起来的，是{i}我们{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:12723
translate chinese start_1bd8d589:

    # j "Well, I remember!"
    j "好啊，我想起来了！"

# game/script.rpy:12729
translate chinese start_d478523f:

    # a "...You do?"
    a "……你想起来了？"

# game/script.rpy:12731
translate chinese start_fb9720f1:

    # "My feelings come pouring out of me. I’ve kept them bottled up for so long."
    "我的情绪从身上倾泻而出。我憋了太久了。"

# game/script.rpy:12733
translate chinese start_9f865504:

    # j "{i}Yes, I do!{/i}"
    j "{i}是的，我想起来了！{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:12739
translate chinese start_90e57b68:

    # j "You killed my family—my father, my mother, and even my fucking dog!"
    j "你杀了我的家人——我爸，我妈，连我他妈的狗都杀了！"

# game/script.rpy:12740
translate chinese start_9a89bf97:

    # j "There."
    j "好了。"

# game/script.rpy:12741
translate chinese start_b82e32b3:

    # j "Are you happy, you sick freak?!"
    j "你满意了吗，你这个变态？！"

# game/script.rpy:12742
translate chinese start_fca241be:

    # j "I saw your little picture book. That’s how you have fun, is it?"
    j "我看了你那本小画书。你就是这么取乐的是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:12743
translate chinese start_b73e7ddc:

    # j "{i}Reminiscing?{/i}"
    j "{i}回味往事？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:12744
translate chinese start_266aac25:

    # j "Is that why you want me to remember too, huh? So you can see me scream and beg for my life?!"
    j "所以你也想让我想起来，是吧？好看着我叫、看着我求饶？！"

# game/script.rpy:12745
translate chinese start_0e7fa18b:

    # j "Well, fuck you! I’m not begging for anything."
    j "去你妈的！我什么都不会求。"

# game/script.rpy:12749
translate chinese start_bc5c6b54:

    # "I take out the scalpel I stole from the doctor and hid under my cast."
    "我掏出从医生那儿偷来、藏在石膏下的手术刀。"

# game/script.rpy:12751
translate chinese start_cc964f2a:

    # j "If you come any closer, I’ll gut you, I swear."
    j "你再靠近一步，我就剖了你，我发誓。"

# game/script.rpy:12752
translate chinese start_d109a45d:

    # j "Now let Grace go. This is between you and me only."
    j "现在放开 Grace。这是你和我之间的事。"

# game/script.rpy:12753
translate chinese start_0bd7b9e5:

    # j "She has nothing to do with it. Don’t ruin more people’s lives than you already have."
    j "跟她没关系。你已经毁了不少人的人生，别再毁了。"

# game/script.rpy:12759
translate chinese start_bec8c2e9:

    # a "Jack..."
    a "Jack……"

# game/script.rpy:12761
translate chinese start_9696677d:

    # j "I’m not asking twice. {i}Do it.{/i}"
    j "我不会说第二遍。{i}放了她。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:12769
translate chinese start_ce214931_1:

    # a "Oh, Jack."
    a "噢，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:12771
translate chinese start_3d8c461c:

    # "Anna heaves a resigned sigh."
    "Anna 无奈地叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:12777
translate chinese start_4a782f57:

    # a "You really know how to disappoint a girl."
    a "你还真会让人失望啊。"

# game/script.rpy:12783
translate chinese start_1645b240:

    # a "When you said... ugh."
    a "当你说……唉。"

# game/script.rpy:12788
translate chinese start_798e09c2:

    # a "Darn it."
    a "该死的。"

# game/script.rpy:12794
translate chinese start_1bdd4b4a:

    # a "I should’ve known... but for a {i}second{/i}...!"
    a "我早该知道……可就有那么{i}一秒{/i}……！"

# game/script.rpy:12796
translate chinese start_88c589d8:

    # j "...What the hell are you talking about?"
    j "……你到底在说什么？"

# game/script.rpy:12802
translate chinese start_ec8293fb:

    # a "Jack, you..."
    a "Jack，你……"

# game/script.rpy:12811
translate chinese start_a45fa333:

    # a "Ugh, fine!"
    a "唉，好吧！"

# game/script.rpy:12817
translate chinese start_cea8ca4a:

    # a "I’m done trying to do this. Even though it would’ve been so romantic..."
    a "我不想再试了。虽然本来会很浪漫……"

# game/script.rpy:12822
translate chinese start_4684ddd4:

    # j "What are you..."
    j "你在……"

# game/script.rpy:12826
translate chinese start_c6169744:

    # "I feel something bad coming."
    "我感觉有什么坏事要来了。"

# game/script.rpy:12827
translate chinese start_92e3a468:

    # "She reaches into her purse, takes out something small."
    "她伸手进手包，取出一样小东西。"

# game/script.rpy:12828
translate chinese start_0c53b955:

    # "She lets it fall to the ground."
    "她让它落到地上。"

# game/script.rpy:12829
translate chinese start_c71500fa:

    # "It’s my journal."
    "是我的日记。"

# game/script.rpy:12842
translate chinese start_e536caae:

    # "My hands are shivering. I don’t understand."
    "我的手在抖。我不明白。"

# game/script.rpy:12849
translate chinese start_e8d0305a_4:

    # a "Jack?"
    a "Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:12851
translate chinese start_77eff8f8:

    # j "Wh-What?"
    j "什、什么？"

# game/script.rpy:12856
translate chinese start_cfe0bc16:

    # a "You got it all wrong. Even after seeing the picture book."
    a "你全弄错了。就算看了那本画书也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:12864
translate chinese start_52590c25:

    # a "I didn’t kill your family."
    a "我没有杀你的家人。"

# game/script.rpy:12870
translate chinese start_bcfd0c04:

    # a "{i}You{/i} killed {i}mine.{/i}"
    a "{i}你{/i}杀的是{i}我的{/i}家人。"

# game/script.rpy:12898
translate chinese start_2d3e2d33:

    # "Her words are ones I hadn't considered."
    "她的话我从没想过。"

# game/script.rpy:12899
translate chinese start_fafae413:

    # "I hadn't dared consider them."
    "我不敢想。"

# game/script.rpy:12900
translate chinese start_1215381c:

    # "But now that they've been said, I know that they are true."
    "可既然说出口了，我就知道它们是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:12901
translate chinese start_cab1220d:

    # "And that truth hits me like a bullet between the eyes."
    "那个真相像一颗子弹打在我两眼之间。"

# game/script.rpy:12907
translate chinese start_1386a9f1:

    # "The dam I’ve had in my brain for fifteen years breaks, spills over."
    "我脑子里那道积了十五年的坝，塌了，漫了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:12908
translate chinese start_6b3224f6:

    # "Memories come gushing out."
    "记忆喷涌而出。"

# game/script.rpy:12916
translate chinese start_ba0d7482:

    # "Where am I?"
    "我在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:12917
translate chinese start_927bfa16:

    # "I'm somewhere dark and cramped."
    "我在一个又黑又挤的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:12918
translate chinese start_0daf6f39:

    # "A hidey-hole."
    "一个藏身的洞。"

# game/script.rpy:12919
translate chinese start_9dd153e5:

    # "I'm hiding."
    "我在躲。"

# game/script.rpy:12920
translate chinese start_c05bb78d:

    # "I'm back {i}there.{/i}"
    "我回到了{i}那里{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:12921
translate chinese start_f81c8899:

    # "I don't think I ever really left."
    "我觉得我从来没有真正离开过。"

# game/script.rpy:12923
translate chinese start_9334843f:

    # q "Where are you, Jack?"
    q "你在哪儿，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:12924
translate chinese start_6b75d0a8:

    # q "Stop running away."
    q "别跑了。"

# game/script.rpy:12926
translate chinese start_4ec4e5e1:

    # "{i}No.{/i}"
    "{i}不。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:12927
translate chinese start_4ec4e5e1_1:

    # "{i}No.{/i}"
    "{i}不。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:12928
translate chinese start_beec2079:

    # "{i}Please don’t let him find me.{/i}"
    "{i}求求你别让他找到我。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:12929
translate chinese start_8b63552a:

    # "{i}Please.{/i}"
    "{i}求你。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:12930
translate chinese start_1414cb5d:

    # "{cps=*1.5}{i}Please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please please{/i}{/cps}{nw}"
    "{cps=*1.5}{i}求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你求求你{/i}{/cps}{nw}"

# game/script.rpy:12932
translate chinese start_c2ad918e:

    # q "There you are."
    q "找到你了。"

# game/script.rpy:12936
translate chinese start_97df826f:

    # "Pain."
    "疼。"

# game/script.rpy:12937
translate chinese start_1209b007:

    # "So much pain it makes me vomit."
    "疼得我吐了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:12938
translate chinese start_cf64f4c0:

    # "I’m not used to it yet."
    "我还没习惯。"

# game/script.rpy:12939
translate chinese start_17b156f5:

    # "I’ll never be used to it."
    "我永远也习惯不了。"

# game/script.rpy:12940
translate chinese start_01572c63:

    # "I don't think anyone could live with this pain."
    "我觉得没人能带着这种疼活下去。"

# game/script.rpy:12941
translate chinese start_17cb27d9:

    # "I can't."
    "我受不了。"

# game/script.rpy:12943
translate chinese start_f44035ad:

    # j "M-Mom, help me..."
    j "妈、妈妈，救救我……"

# game/script.rpy:12945
translate chinese start_2a556c46:

    # "Cold eyes."
    "冰冷的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:12946
translate chinese start_2efa0d81:

    # "Like she is looking at dirt."
    "像在看一堆脏东西。"

# game/script.rpy:12947
translate chinese start_532a8a1d:

    # "It's always like this."
    "一直都是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:12948
translate chinese start_dcca4765:

    # "Day in, day out."
    "一天又一天。"

# game/script.rpy:12949
translate chinese start_f38b0736:

    # "It will never stop."
    "永远不会停。"

# game/script.rpy:12960
translate chinese start_389b7202:

    # "But one day it does stop."
    "可有一天，它停了。"

# game/script.rpy:12961
translate chinese start_52962286:

    # "There is silence."
    "一片寂静。"

# game/script.rpy:12962
translate chinese start_5c8a0ffc:

    # "Nothing but silence."
    "除了寂静，什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:12963
translate chinese start_05822265:

    # "A quiet so bottomless it lets nothing exist. Especially not me."
    "容不下任何东西存在。尤其容不下我。"

# game/script.rpy:12964
translate chinese start_607481f7:

    # "It isn't bad."
    "这并不坏。"

# game/script.rpy:12965
translate chinese start_ea2a46e5:

    # "There is no pain."
    "没有疼。"

# game/script.rpy:12975
translate chinese start_e82e164b:

    # "But things start moving again."
    "可东西又开始动了。"

# game/script.rpy:12976
translate chinese start_04be0948:

    # "I have no say in the matter. I’m being swept along."
    "这事由不得我。我被推着走。"

# game/script.rpy:12984
translate chinese start_fe4162aa:

    # q "It's all right now, Jack."
    q "现在没事了，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:12985
translate chinese start_ee01fd73:

    # q "You’re safe with us."
    q "你和我们在一起很安全。"

# game/script.rpy:12987
translate chinese start_44e5db31:

    # "A pair of warm strangers."
    "一对温暖的陌生人。"

# game/script.rpy:12989
translate chinese start_68790bd6:

    # q "I can't even imagine how tough it was for you..."
    q "我都不敢想象这些日子你是怎么熬过来的……"

# game/script.rpy:12990
translate chinese start_d18a4bf6:

    # q "You can call me Mom if you want. But you don’t have to."
    q "你想的话，可以叫我妈妈。当然，不叫也没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:12992
translate chinese start_bb1502d2:

    # j "Mom?"
    j "妈妈？"

# game/script.rpy:12994
translate chinese start_e57a883e:

    # q "Yes!"
    q "是的！"

# game/script.rpy:12995
translate chinese start_fccd4c3c:

    # q "Oh, thank you so much, Jack."
    q "太感谢你了，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:12996
translate chinese start_d7b5a628:

    # q "We love you."
    q "我们爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:13002
translate chinese start_e674e645:

    # "They pretend to be nice."
    "他们假装对我好。"

# game/script.rpy:13003
translate chinese start_da410709:

    # "They pretend to like me."
    "他们假装喜欢我。"

# game/script.rpy:13004
translate chinese start_9ea813ba:

    # "They give me food to eat and give me books to read, and all sorts of other things."
    "他们给我吃的，给我书看，还给我各种各样的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:13005
translate chinese start_6fb3bef2:

    # "They’re trying to make me like them. They’re very clever."
    "他们想让我喜欢上他们。他们很聪明。"

# game/script.rpy:13006
translate chinese start_bc19b653:

    # "But I’m more clever than they are."
    "但我比他们聪明。"

# game/script.rpy:13021
translate chinese start_5c6bbc3f:

    # "Somebody kills their dog."
    "有人杀了他们的狗。"

# game/script.rpy:13022
translate chinese start_5930cdc4:

    # "I liked the dog."
    "我喜欢那条狗。"

# game/script.rpy:13027
translate chinese start_a60ed334:

    # "They must have killed the dog."
    "一定是他们杀了那条狗。"

# game/script.rpy:13032
translate chinese start_fffb8dfc:

    # "It’s what they’ll do to me, too."
    "他们对我也一定会这样。"

# game/script.rpy:13037
translate chinese start_6fd399bc:

    # "I know what they are like—what they’re all like."
    "我知道他们是什么样——他们全都是什么样。"

# game/script.rpy:13038
translate chinese start_806ef919:

    # "I don’t want to die."
    "我不想死。"

# game/script.rpy:13039
translate chinese start_e489b087:

    # "I’ve got used to living again."
    "我又习惯活着了。"

# game/script.rpy:13043
translate chinese start_ce486691:

    # "So one night I take a knife."
    "于是一天夜里，我拿起一把刀。"

# game/script.rpy:13051
translate chinese start_381322bc:

    # "I visit the girl they’re keeping, with their blood still on me."
    "身上还带着他们的血，我去看他们养着的那个女孩。"

# game/script.rpy:13053
translate chinese start_7405db51:

    # j "I did it."
    j "是我干的。"

# game/script.rpy:13055
translate chinese start_1643ba35:

    # q "D-Did what?"
    q "做、做了什么？"

# game/script.rpy:13056
translate chinese start_cb588782:

    # q "What was that noise?"
    q "那是什么声音？"

# game/script.rpy:13058
translate chinese start_825dfa01:

    # "I thought it would be obvious with all that blood."
    "我身上这么多血，应该很明显了。"

# game/script.rpy:13059
translate chinese start_84a133a3:

    # "I say it anyway."
    "我还是说了。"

# game/script.rpy:13061
translate chinese start_7a5a2d5a:

    # j "They’re dead."
    j "他们死了。"

# game/script.rpy:13063
translate chinese start_ba886589:

    # q "Dead?!"
    q "死了？！"

# game/script.rpy:13065
translate chinese start_04514199:

    # "The girl’s eyes open wide."
    "女孩睁大了眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:13066
translate chinese start_fbe9f695:

    # "Her grip on her pillow tightens."
    "她抓着枕头的手收紧了。"

# game/script.rpy:13068
translate chinese start_2bc739d3:

    # q "Who is...?!"
    q "谁……？！"

# game/script.rpy:13070
translate chinese start_ad5975ba:

    # j "’Mom’ and ’Dad.’"
    j "“妈妈”和“爸爸”。"

# game/script.rpy:13072
translate chinese start_4dbb6b7c:

    # "I thought she’d be happy."
    "我以为她会高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:13073
translate chinese start_0731a084:

    # "But she starts crying."
    "但她哭了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:13074
translate chinese start_aabe7a03:

    # "They’re not happy tears. They're sad tears."
    "那不是高兴的眼泪。是难过的眼泪。"

# game/script.rpy:13075
translate chinese start_2c099916:

    # "Scared tears, too."
    "也是害怕的眼泪。"

# game/script.rpy:13076
translate chinese start_dc26c3a9:

    # "She’s holding the pillow between us like she wants it to protect her."
    "她把枕头挡在我们之间，像想让它保护自己。"

# game/script.rpy:13077
translate chinese start_4090d3e9:

    # "She’s afraid of me."
    "她怕我。"

# game/script.rpy:13078
translate chinese start_94871ed8:

    # "Why?"
    "为什么？"

# game/script.rpy:13080
translate chinese start_7a1f04d0:

    # j "You’re free now."
    j "你现在自由了。"

# game/script.rpy:13081
translate chinese start_af8971c8:

    # j "They won’t hurt you."
    j "他们不会伤害你的。"

# game/script.rpy:13085
translate chinese start_372aa0c7:

    # "She cries harder."
    "她哭得更厉害了。"

# game/script.rpy:13086
translate chinese start_2b840f69:

    # "It’s so piercing in my ears."
    "那声音刺得我耳朵疼。"

# game/script.rpy:13087
translate chinese start_e36e3aa7:

    # "I don’t understand."
    "我不明白。"

# game/script.rpy:13088
translate chinese start_c69628f0:

    # "I did a good thing."
    "我做了一件好事。"

# game/script.rpy:13090
translate chinese start_2b59873b:

    # j "I’ll... see you later."
    j "我……回头见。"

# game/script.rpy:13106
translate chinese start_97635c74:

    # "The crying is so loud I have to go outside."
    "哭声太响了，我只能走到外面。"

# game/script.rpy:13107
translate chinese start_a7201ee4:

    # "It’s cold. Steam rises from the warm blood."
    "很冷。热气从温热的血上冒起来。"

# game/script.rpy:13108
translate chinese start_c69628f0_1:

    # "I did a good thing."
    "我做了一件好事。"

# game/script.rpy:13109
translate chinese start_72ef86a8:

    # "Didn’t I?"
    "不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:13110
translate chinese start_2542daee:

    # "I did."
    "我做得对。"

# game/script.rpy:13111
translate chinese start_1a3ca4e2:

    # "But there’s doubt now."
    "可现在有了疑虑。"

# game/script.rpy:13112
translate chinese start_4a28a844:

    # "I think of their eyes when they woke up with their necks opened up."
    "我想起他们脖子被划开、醒过来时的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:13113
translate chinese start_b82837f7:

    # "They weren’t angry. I didn’t know what they were."
    "他们没有生气。我不知道那是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:13114
translate chinese start_30ab3d81:

    # "Now I think they were sad."
    "现在我想，那是难过。"

# game/script.rpy:13119
translate chinese start_ddfac307:

    # "I’m confused."
    "我糊涂了。"

# game/script.rpy:13120
translate chinese start_37814227:

    # "So, so confused."
    "那么、那么困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:13121
translate chinese start_ddeb4fb8:

    # "I’ve never been this confused."
    "我从没这么糊涂过。"

# game/script.rpy:13122
translate chinese start_783e4ff9:

    # "I drop the knife."
    "刀从我手里掉下去。"

# game/script.rpy:13123
translate chinese start_eb23528b:

    # "Sobs come out of me even though I don't want to cry."
    "我不想哭，可哭声还是从我身上出来。"

# game/script.rpy:13124
translate chinese start_6eefcf82:

    # "It’s all too much."
    "这一切太过了。"

# game/script.rpy:13130
translate chinese start_f042e973:

    # "The whole world has come crashing down on me. I can’t handle it."
    "整个世界都砸在我身上。我承受不住。"

# game/script.rpy:13131
translate chinese start_4325c83b:

    # "I’ll break."
    "我会崩溃的。"

# game/script.rpy:13132
translate chinese start_0cace2e4:

    # "I hear a voice, then."
    "然后我听见一个声音。"

# game/script.rpy:13133
translate chinese start_851429cf:

    # "It’s coming from {i}inside me.{/i} It’s my own voice."
    "它来自{i}我体内{/i}。那是我自己的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:13134
translate chinese start_4188f11c:

    # "It’s whispering."
    "它在低语。"

# game/script.rpy:13135
translate chinese start_f2a8a802:

    # "It says, \"This did not happen to you.\""
    "它说：“这些没有发生在你身上。”"

# game/script.rpy:13136
translate chinese start_e86cd03f:

    # "\"It didn’t happen at all, to anyone.\""
    "“根本没发生过，对谁都没有。”"

# game/script.rpy:13137
translate chinese start_4ac178f4:

    # "\"It was all a dream.\""
    "“全都是梦。”"

# game/script.rpy:13138
translate chinese start_e610e40c:

    # "\"You’ll forget about it in the morning.\""
    "“到早上你就忘了。”"

# game/script.rpy:13142
translate chinese start_771a4ba9:

    # "So I lay down, and I sleep."
    "于是我躺下，睡了。"

# game/script.rpy:13143
translate chinese start_3d8784a7:

    # "And by morning I’ve forgotten."
    "到了早上，我忘了。"

# game/script.rpy:13153
translate chinese start_86f268af:

    # "This all comes back to me in a single flash of understanding."
    "一瞬间，这一切全都涌回了我的脑海。"

# game/script.rpy:13154
translate chinese start_f9246ddc:

    # "I sit there for a minute, barely breathing, as the weight of it passes over me."
    "我在那儿坐了一分钟，几乎不敢呼吸，任那份沉重从我身上压过。"

# game/script.rpy:13155
translate chinese start_7696ef65:

    # "When I finally look around again, I realize my jaw hurts. I’ve been clenching it."
    "等我终于再看周围时，才发现下巴在疼。我一直咬着牙。"

# game/script.rpy:13164
translate chinese start_eb81cc89:

    # a "...Do you...?"
    a "……你……？"

# game/script.rpy:13166
translate chinese start_9f64a2bd_3:

    # j "Yes."
    j "是。"

# game/script.rpy:13167
translate chinese start_7ca48968:

    # j "I remember now."
    j "我想起来了。"

# game/script.rpy:13174
translate chinese start_5d4d10bc:

    # "Anna still looks suspicious of me."
    "Anna 还是对我将信将疑。"

# game/script.rpy:13179
translate chinese start_7a4fdce7:

    # a "Can you prove it?"
    a "你能证明吗？"

# game/script.rpy:13181
translate chinese start_c7590857:

    # j "You used to have short hair, Anna."
    j "你以前是短发，Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:13182
translate chinese start_9c386cd6:

    # j "I teased you about it. I said you looked like a boy."
    j "我还拿这个逗你。说你像个男孩子。"

# game/script.rpy:13188
translate chinese start_d5b75546:

    # a "You’re..."
    a "你……"

# game/script.rpy:13193
translate chinese start_b32b907a:

    # "Anna takes a few steps towards me."
    "Anna 朝我走了几步。"

# game/script.rpy:13202
translate chinese start_6b2d87c8:

    # "She collapses with her head in my lap." with vpunch
    "她一下子瘫倒，把头埋进我膝上。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:13209
translate chinese start_eb283a94:

    # a "You’re back."
    a "你回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:13215
translate chinese start_948074d0:

    # a "I’m... so happy."
    a "我……太高兴了。"

# game/script.rpy:13221
translate chinese start_3ceadf97:

    # a "I’m so happy I could die."
    a "我高兴得要死。"

# game/script.rpy:13223
translate chinese start_937b3171:

    # j "There, there."
    j "好了，好了。"

# game/script.rpy:13225
translate chinese start_8dfdd3cd:

    # "I run my fingers through her hair."
    "我用手指梳过她的头发。"

# game/script.rpy:13226
translate chinese start_8819001c:

    # "I can’t help but pity her."
    "我忍不住可怜她。"

# game/script.rpy:13232
translate chinese start_1bf09e89:

    # "Anna starts talking, but her sobs make it hard for her to speak."
    "Anna 开始说话，可抽泣让她说不成句。"

# game/script.rpy:13239
translate chinese start_ab1876a9:

    # a "I knew... I knew if I waited... y-you’d come back to me."
    a "我就知道……我就知道只要我等……你、你会回到我身边。"

# game/script.rpy:13244
translate chinese start_df6a57ee:

    # a "That was really cruel... you know! What you did..."
    a "那真的很残忍……你知道吗！你做的那些……"

# game/script.rpy:13251
translate chinese start_28e8cff6:

    # a "You... you showed me... {i}everything{/i}... and then... went away..."
    a "你……你把{i}一切{/i}都给我看了……然后……就走了……"

# game/script.rpy:13253
translate chinese start_86e15fb4:

    # "I offer her the end of my blanket. She blows her nose on it and takes a few deep breaths to calm herself."
    "我把毯子的一角递给她。她擤了擤鼻子，深吸几口气让自己平静下来。"

# game/script.rpy:13259
translate chinese start_dd18b1c2:

    # a "Thanks."
    a "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:13266
translate chinese start_65dc4a12:

    # a "...You taught me everything, you know, Jack?"
    a "……你什么都教给我了，你知道吗，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:13272
translate chinese start_6bb3d136:

    # a "I can’t ever thank you enough for that."
    a "这件事我怎么谢你都不够。"

# game/script.rpy:13281
translate chinese start_5ed3194c:

    # a "At first I was scared, and I hated you."
    a "一开始我害怕，也恨你。"

# game/script.rpy:13288
translate chinese start_20f61f49:

    # a "I was really stupid, huh?"
    a "我以前真蠢，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:13294
translate chinese start_8675c2b3:

    # a "But the more I thought about you—and I thought about you a {i}lot{/i}—the more the truth became so obvious."
    a "可我越想你就——我是{i}常常{/i}想你的——真相就越明显。"

# game/script.rpy:13300
translate chinese start_edbdc25d:

    # a "You showed me what the world is {i}really{/i} like."
    a "你给我看了这世界{i}真正的{/i}样子。"

# game/script.rpy:13305
translate chinese start_aa32b01b:

    # a "There are sheep, and there are wolves."
    a "有羊，也有狼。"

# game/script.rpy:13310
translate chinese start_98942009:

    # a "You are a wolf. And I am, too. Right?"
    a "你是狼。我也是。对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:13316
translate chinese start_3f8909c4:

    # a "That’s what you saw in me back then, right? That’s why you spared me."
    a "当年你在我身上看到的就是这个，对吧？所以你没杀我。"

# game/script.rpy:13323
translate chinese start_968a54a7:

    # a "And that’s why I love you. Because we were made for each other."
    a "所以我才爱你。因为我们是天生一对。"

# game/script.rpy:13325
translate chinese start_dea573b4:

    # j "You love me?"
    j "你爱我？"

# game/script.rpy:13330
translate chinese start_9de8b3de:

    # a "I do. I love you."
    a "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:13336
translate chinese start_074ff80c:

    # a "I love you."
    a "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:13342
translate chinese start_c8e9ddc4:

    # a "I love you!"
    a "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:13349
translate chinese start_074ff80c_1:

    # a "I love you."
    a "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:13355
translate chinese start_5486e69c:

    # a "And you love me, too."
    a "你也爱我。"

# game/script.rpy:13357
translate chinese start_e7eb75b9_2:

    # j "I see."
    j "原来如此。"

# game/script.rpy:13361
translate chinese start_fcf41f27:

    # "Anna kisses me on the cheek, before picking the scalpel up from the ground."
    "Anna 吻了吻我的脸颊，然后从地上捡起手术刀。"

# game/script.rpy:13362
translate chinese start_1816567c:

    # "I dropped it at some point."
    "我不知什么时候把它弄掉了。"

# game/script.rpy:13371
translate chinese start_71e5d30b:

    # "She places it gently in my lap, then wheels me over to Grace."
    "她轻轻把它放在我膝上，然后把我推到 Grace 那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:13372
translate chinese start_95e8b9c9:

    # "Grace is lying on her side."
    "Grace 侧躺着。"

# game/script.rpy:13386
translate chinese start_e5133448:

    # "Her eyes are focused now. They’re looking at me."
    "她的眼神现在聚焦了。她正看着我。"

# game/script.rpy:13387
translate chinese start_387d2018:

    # "But I can’t help but feel she’s not seeing me."
    "可我总觉得她并没有在看我。"

# game/script.rpy:13388
translate chinese start_a4b2d1cf:

    # "I’m close enough to hear the words she’s hissing out."
    "我离得够近，听得见她挤出的话。"

# game/script.rpy:13393
translate chinese start_0fbc7fbf:

    # g "...ill her..."
    g "……杀她……"

# game/script.rpy:13394
translate chinese start_ab9d6434:

    # g "...Kill her..."
    g "……杀了她……"

# game/script.rpy:13395
translate chinese start_ab9d6434_1:

    # g "...Kill her..."
    g "……杀了她……"

# game/script.rpy:13400
translate chinese start_8d0b4a04:

    # g "...Please..."
    g "求你了。"

# game/script.rpy:13404
translate chinese start_e98e66ee:

    # "There’s a whistling quality to her voice."
    "她的声音里带着一种哨音。"

# game/script.rpy:13405
translate chinese start_dba6c0b0:

    # "I bend down and pull her lips back."
    "我俯下身，把她的嘴唇翻开。"

# game/script.rpy:13406
translate chinese start_4be9bc45:

    # "She’s missing some teeth."
    "她少了几颗牙。"

# game/script.rpy:13413
translate chinese start_447095de:

    # "I turn to Anna."
    "我转向 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:13422
translate chinese start_8480ae82:

    # a "Ah, well..."
    a "我……呃……"

# game/script.rpy:13428
translate chinese start_86a653bc:

    # a "That’s, uh..."
    a "那、那个……"

# game/script.rpy:13430
translate chinese start_0d6267e1:

    # j "How many?"
    j "几颗？"

# game/script.rpy:13436
translate chinese start_15f7578d:

    # a "Just four!"
    a "才四颗！"

# game/script.rpy:13441
translate chinese start_e5b8831a:

    # a "No more than that."
    a "不会超过这个数。"

# game/script.rpy:13450
translate chinese start_1dcd9ae0:

    # a "And I didn’t... enjoy it or anything..."
    a "而且我一点也……没乐在其中……"

# game/script.rpy:13456
translate chinese start_7abcb42b:

    # a "She just {i}really{/i} wouldn’t shut up... until I did that."
    a "她{i}就是{/i}不肯闭嘴……直到我那么做。"

# game/script.rpy:13462
translate chinese start_13d37096:

    # "Anna’s eyes dart sideways."
    "Anna 的眼睛往旁边瞟。"

# game/script.rpy:13470
translate chinese start_775f7466:

    # "I follow them—and see a pair of pliers on the ground, alongside a towel and a bottle of what might be rubbing alcohol."
    "我顺着看过去——地上有一把钳子，旁边是毛巾和一瓶像是酒精的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:13479
translate chinese start_41bcaea1:

    # a "Are you mad?"
    a "你生气了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:13487
translate chinese start_1e60ea63:

    # "I don’t answer."
    "我没有回答。"

# game/script.rpy:13488
translate chinese start_166c5380:

    # "How {i}do{/i} I feel?"
    "我{i}到底{/i}是什么感觉？"

# game/script.rpy:13490
translate chinese start_b4faf233:

    # j "You know, I didn’t kill Buddy."
    j "你知道吗，Buddy 不是我杀的。"

# game/script.rpy:13496
translate chinese start_419d5750:

    # a "What?"
    a "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:13501
translate chinese start_f1c9b887:

    # a "You didn’t?"
    a "不是你？"

# game/script.rpy:13503
translate chinese start_1dd4185e_2:

    # j "No."
    j "不是我。"

# game/script.rpy:13510
translate chinese start_f3ef29ed:

    # a "...Then who did?"
    a "……那是谁？"

# game/script.rpy:13512
translate chinese start_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "我耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:13514
translate chinese start_f6ead2c1:

    # j "It could have been anyone."
    j "谁都可能是凶手。"

# game/script.rpy:13520
translate chinese start_64ae28c7:

    # "Anna thinks it over, but eventually also shrugs."
    "Anna 想了想，最后也耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:13526
translate chinese start_2b549c57:

    # a "Oh, it doesn’t matter, really."
    a "好吧，这事实上也没那么重要。"

# game/script.rpy:13531
translate chinese start_c82b667e:

    # a "Hehe..."
    a "嘿嘿……"

# game/script.rpy:13533
translate chinese start_81d2a948:

    # j "I guess it doesn’t."
    j "我想也是。"

# game/script.rpy:13555
translate chinese kg_eed705c0:

    # "I plant the knife."
    "我把刀送进去。"

# game/script.rpy:13556
translate chinese kg_256601d4:

    # "Grace’s neck blossoms red."
    "Grace 的脖子开出一片红。"

# game/script.rpy:13557
translate chinese kg_cdaaec8d:

    # "It’s the third time I’ve seen this strange sort of fountain."
    "这种奇怪的喷泉，我已经是第三次见了。"

# game/script.rpy:13558
translate chinese kg_d8cf86e9:

    # "I forgot how pretty it was."
    "我忘了它有多好看。"

# game/script.rpy:13559
translate chinese kg_c852bac8:

    # "But the smell is still awful."
    "可味道还是一样难闻。"

# game/script.rpy:13565
translate chinese kg_bdbe34c5:

    # "Anna crouches down next to me again."
    "Anna 又在我旁边蹲下。"

# game/script.rpy:13573
translate chinese kg_656dcb7b:

    # a "You did well."
    a "你做得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:13575
translate chinese kg_59546c8c:

    # j "Your shoes are wet."
    j "你的鞋湿了。"

# game/script.rpy:13581
translate chinese kg_99e3a3da:

    # a "It doesn’t matter."
    a "没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:13588
translate chinese kg_5c303b3c:

    # a "Now that you’ve come back to me, nothing else matters."
    a "既然你回到我身边了，别的都不重要。"

# game/script.rpy:13594
translate chinese kg_074ff80c:

    # a "I love you."
    a "我爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:13624
translate chinese kg_ka_98545d98:

    # "Anna looks down at her own bleeding throat."
    "Anna 低头看自己流血的喉咙。"

# game/script.rpy:13625
translate chinese kg_ka_4a1ab1db:

    # "She’s surprised."
    "她很惊讶。"

# game/script.rpy:13626
translate chinese kg_ka_5acd5916:

    # "But not too surprised."
    "但不算太意外。"

# game/script.rpy:13628
translate chinese kg_ka_39b350a3:

    # j "Whoops."
    j "哎呀。"

# game/script.rpy:13629
translate chinese kg_ka_b785ea0f:

    # j "My hand slipped."
    j "我手滑了。"

# game/script.rpy:13638
translate chinese kg_ka_8be4c2a3:

    # "She opens her mouth to speak. Red comes out."
    "她张嘴要说话。出来的是红色。"

# game/script.rpy:13640
translate chinese kg_ka_1343b474:

    # j "Shh."
    j "嘘。"

# game/script.rpy:13641
translate chinese kg_ka_ac2c7bce:

    # j "It’s all right."
    j "没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:13642
translate chinese kg_ka_554c416b:

    # j "Let it happen."
    j "让它发生吧。"

# game/script.rpy:13650
translate chinese kg_ka_26b6c74b:

    # "Anna reaches out—to strangle me? To caress me?—but her hands fall short."
    "Anna 伸出手——是要掐死我？还是要摸我？——可她的手没够到。"

# game/script.rpy:13651
translate chinese kg_ka_3d24f3bc:

    # "She grips the edge of my wheelchair instead, and when she falls back, she takes me with her."
    "她抓住了我轮椅的边沿，她往后倒的时候，把我也带了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:13662
translate chinese kg_ka_61e75585:

    # j "Ow." with vpunch
    j "哎哟。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:13664
translate chinese kg_ka_e8b0b550:

    # "I’m lying on my back."
    "我仰面躺着。"

# game/script.rpy:13665
translate chinese kg_ka_2b8dee4c:

    # "My left leg, still in its cast, points up to the ceiling."
    "我打着石膏的左腿，指着天花板。"

# game/script.rpy:13669
translate chinese kg_ka_1e2ae37d:

    # j "Damn."
    j "见鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:13671
translate chinese kg_ka_f11e17ed:

    # "I had a feeling it would end this way."
    "我早觉得会是这样的结局。"

# game/script.rpy:13672
translate chinese kg_ka_e9022695:

    # "But that’s okay."
    "没关系的。"

# game/script.rpy:13673
translate chinese kg_ka_cacd8cf2:

    # "I made the world a better place."
    "我让这个世界变得更好了一点。"

# game/script.rpy:13674
translate chinese kg_ka_c180bec8:

    # "I glance at Grace and Anna."
    "我瞥了一眼 Grace 和 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:13675
translate chinese kg_ka_e4c8e644:

    # "They’re still twitching, but their eyes are like glass."
    "她们还在抽动，可眼睛像玻璃一样。"

# game/script.rpy:13677
translate chinese kg_ka_b98df771:

    # j "I’ll see you later."
    j "回头见。"

# game/script.rpy:13683
translate chinese kg_ka_2ed89ce7:

    # "My world goes red, then black, then nothing."
    "我的世界先变红，再变黑，然后什么都没有了。"

# game/script.rpy:13704
translate chinese kg_nka_64b9ff08:

    # j "I love you, too."
    j "我也爱你。"

# game/script.rpy:13727
translate chinese kg_nka_957d9f4a:

    # a "Jaaack."
    a "Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:13729
translate chinese kg_nka_17697de5:

    # j "What is it?"
    j "什么事？"

# game/script.rpy:13735
translate chinese kg_nka_60d84154:

    # a "I’m tiiiireeed."
    a "我累死了——"

# game/script.rpy:13737
translate chinese kg_nka_0aa7948d:

    # j "Hang in there. You’re almost done."
    j "再撑一会儿。你就快好了。"

# game/script.rpy:13739
translate chinese kg_nka_c47a3226:

    # "Anna is shoveling dirt onto a spot on the ground."
    "Anna 正在往地上某处铲土。"

# game/script.rpy:13745
translate chinese kg_nka_a520f807:

    # a "Help meeeee."
    a "帮帮我呀——"

# game/script.rpy:13747
translate chinese kg_nka_70cd887c:

    # j "I would if I could."
    j "能帮我就帮了。"

# game/script.rpy:13753
translate chinese kg_nka_b5200d69:

    # "When she’s done, I hand her a towel so she can wipe the sweat off her face."
    "她干完之后，我递给她一条毛巾擦汗。"

# game/script.rpy:13763
translate chinese kg_nka_90fee174:

    # j "Great work."
    j "干得不错。"

# game/script.rpy:13769
translate chinese kg_nka_c72b5e4f:

    # a "Thanks!"
    a "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:13771
translate chinese kg_nka_7d25e94f:

    # j "But don’t you think it’s a little obvious?"
    j "但你不觉得有点太显眼了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:13773
translate chinese kg_nka_2ddc400b:

    # "The mound of dirt is the only spot that’s not overgrown with grass or weeds."
    "那堆土是唯一没长草的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:13779
translate chinese kg_nka_409371db:

    # a "It’s obvious. But it doesn’t matter."
    a "是挺显眼的。不过无所谓。"

# game/script.rpy:13784
translate chinese kg_nka_392a6ded:

    # a "No one ever comes here."
    a "从来没人来这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:13786
translate chinese kg_nka_e7eb75b9:

    # j "I see."
    j "原来如此。"

# game/script.rpy:13796
translate chinese kg_nka_eb5fbda5:

    # "Anna is wheeling me away. She’s humming as she walks."
    "Anna 推着我离开。她一边走一边哼着歌。"

# game/script.rpy:13797
translate chinese kg_nka_3a152cbc:

    # "We’re on our way home."
    "我们在回家的路上。"

# game/script.rpy:13799
translate chinese kg_nka_8c6986cd:

    # j "It’s good to be back."
    j "回来真好。"

# game/script.rpy:13800
translate chinese kg_nka_bb81a27c:

    # j "I’m sorry I took so long."
    j "抱歉我花了这么久。"

# game/script.rpy:13802
translate chinese kg_nka_f9c02fd1:

    # a "That’s okay!"
    a "没关系的。"

# game/script.rpy:13817
translate chinese kg_nka_8e6afe77:

    # "Anna brings her head down next to mine."
    "Anna 把头凑到我头边。"

# game/script.rpy:13822
translate chinese kg_nka_870a5743:

    # a "How long you took doesn't matter. You’re here now."
    a "你花了多久都不重要。你现在在这儿了。"

# game/script.rpy:13828
translate chinese kg_nka_a488594b:

    # a "My love."
    a "我的爱人。"

# game/script.rpy:13830
translate chinese kg_nka_954bc1ed:

    # "She’s cute."
    "她真可爱。"

# game/script.rpy:13831
translate chinese kg_nka_11f183ec:

    # "I want to tease her."
    "我想逗逗她。"

# game/script.rpy:13833
translate chinese kg_nka_7e0996f8:

    # j "Hey, you’re taking me to the rehab place, aren’t you?"
    j "喂，你是要送我去康复中心吧？"

# game/script.rpy:13840
translate chinese kg_nka_6c7c3166:

    # a "No way!"
    a "才不！"

# game/script.rpy:13845
translate chinese kg_nka_1825b13b:

    # a "I’m never letting you out of my sight ever again."
    a "我再也不会让你离开我的视线了。"

# game/script.rpy:13847
translate chinese kg_nka_ae02b560:

    # j "What if I want to meet some cute girls there?"
    j "要是我在那儿想认识几个可爱的女孩呢？"

# game/script.rpy:13853
translate chinese kg_nka_de7b5f14:

    # a "If you do that, I’ll bury them, too."
    a "你要是那样，我就把她们也埋了。"

# game/script.rpy:13855
translate chinese kg_nka_b6b543f2:

    # j "I’d expect nothing less."
    j "我就知道你会这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:13856
translate chinese kg_nka_1f11011b:

    # j "But keep in mind, I’m not going to let you baby me like you did that one whole month."
    j "不过你记着，我不会再让你像那整整一个月那样把我当小孩养。"

# game/script.rpy:13857
translate chinese kg_nka_029d487b:

    # j "What the hell was that about?"
    j "刚才那是干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:13864
translate chinese kg_nka_4f72e8b5:

    # a "S-Sorry, Jack!"
    a "对、对不起，Jack！"

# game/script.rpy:13870
translate chinese kg_nka_317b5c0c:

    # a "I couldn’t help myself. You were so helpless and cute."
    a "我控制不住嘛。你那么无助，又那么可爱。"

# game/script.rpy:13872
translate chinese kg_nka_303197da:

    # j "...Yeah, yeah. I sort of get it."
    j "……好啦好啦。我大概明白。"

# game/script.rpy:13873
translate chinese kg_nka_763a7a86:

    # j "Don’t think I’m helpless now, though."
    j "不过别以为我现在还是那么无助。"

# game/script.rpy:13879
translate chinese kg_nka_75f820cf:

    # a "Of course you’re not."
    a "你当然不是。"

# game/script.rpy:13881
translate chinese kg_nka_aec4db60:

    # j "Just wait until I can walk again, then you’ll see."
    j "等我重新能走路，你就知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:13882
translate chinese kg_nka_81cdf4aa:

    # j "...You’ll help me walk again, right?"
    j "……你会帮我重新走路的吧？"

# game/script.rpy:13888
translate chinese kg_nka_a6be5e3c:

    # a "Of course!"
    a "当然！"

# game/script.rpy:13893
translate chinese kg_nka_53ad83f6:

    # a "I learned all about that."
    a "那些我都学过了。"

# game/script.rpy:13898
translate chinese kg_nka_9f9fd41d:

    # a "I’ve been very busy, you know?"
    a "我一直很忙，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:13900
translate chinese kg_nka_6fdd9660:

    # j "I know. Very busy."
    j "我知道。非常忙。"

# game/script.rpy:13901
translate chinese kg_nka_bbdb97d1:

    # j "You’ve been busy all these years, haven’t you?"
    j "这些年你一直很忙吧？"

# game/script.rpy:13907
translate chinese kg_nka_894e7159:

    # a "Yes..."
    a "是的。"

# game/script.rpy:13912
translate chinese kg_nka_d55238fd:

    # a "I tried to make myself into the perfect girl for you."
    a "我一直努力把自己变成你心里那个完美的女孩。"

# game/script.rpy:13917
translate chinese kg_nka_50d480b2:

    # a "Did I do well?"
    a "我做得够好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:13919
translate chinese kg_nka_605ce17e:

    # j "You did well."
    j "你做得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:13920
translate chinese kg_nka_c00137c0:

    # j "I’m proud of you."
    j "我为你骄傲。"

# game/script.rpy:13927
translate chinese kg_nka_02ca13b2:

    # "Anna beams."
    "Anna 笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:13929
translate chinese kg_nka_af9e77f2:

    # j "You must be disappointed, though."
    j "不过你一定失望了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:13930
translate chinese kg_nka_50ceba6a:

    # j "All you get is me."
    j "你得到的只有我。"

# game/script.rpy:13937
translate chinese kg_nka_90531fff:

    # a "That’s not true!"
    a "才不是！"

# game/script.rpy:13942
translate chinese kg_nka_df4ae268:

    # a "You’re perfect the way you are."
    a "你现在的样子就很完美。"

# game/script.rpy:13948
translate chinese kg_nka_0dea744b:

    # a "You can’t not be perfect."
    a "你不可能不完美。"

# game/script.rpy:13953
translate chinese kg_nka_10bf5d7f:

    # a "That’s what you showed me that night."
    a "那天晚上，你就是这么让我看到的。"

# game/script.rpy:13959
translate chinese kg_nka_8d1472cd:

    # a "You were like an angel of death..."
    a "你就像死亡天使……"

# game/script.rpy:13966
translate chinese kg_nka_73e5166b:

    # a "...You were just... Haah..."
    a "……你就是……哈啊……"

# game/script.rpy:13973
translate chinese kg_nka_1228c0a6:

    # "Anna sighs with pleasure."
    "Anna 舒服地叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:13974
translate chinese kg_nka_452c1d46:

    # "She’s not looking at me. Her eyes are closed."
    "她没在看我。她闭着眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:13976
translate chinese kg_nka_af66535a:

    # j "Hurry up, Anna."
    j "快点，Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:13977
translate chinese kg_nka_22034a75:

    # j "It’s cold out here."
    j "外面很冷。"

# game/script.rpy:13985
translate chinese kg_nka_f5c8d33a:

    # a "Yes!"
    a "好！"

# game/script.rpy:13990
translate chinese kg_nka_fa2b1541:

    # a "Don’t worry. We’ll be home in no time."
    a "别急。我们马上就到家了。"

# game/script.rpy:13992
translate chinese kg_nka_d3157260:

    # j "I can’t wait."
    j "我等不及了。"

# game/script.rpy:13998
translate chinese kg_nka_5efed261:

    # "Anna pushes my wheelchair forward."
    "Anna 推着我的轮椅往前走。"

# game/script.rpy:13999
translate chinese kg_nka_3f04475f:

    # "We're going into the life I chose for us."
    "我们正走进我为咱俩选好的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:14005
translate chinese kg_nka_99e98f38:

    # "Two wolves in a world of sheep."
    "羊群世界里的两只狼。"

# game/script.rpy:14024
translate chinese nkg_454328a0:

    # j "Keys."
    j "钥匙。"

# game/script.rpy:14032
translate chinese nkg_32fb53c2:

    # a "Hm?"
    a "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:14034
translate chinese nkg_aaba9674:

    # j "Give me the keys, Anna."
    j "把钥匙给我，Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:14039
translate chinese nkg_36fd9ce1:

    # a "Are you sure?"
    a "你确定？"

# game/script.rpy:14041
translate chinese nkg_9f64a2bd:

    # j "Yes."
    j "确定。"

# game/script.rpy:14048
translate chinese nkg_28ab5097:

    # "Anna looks at me very carefully."
    "Anna 非常仔细地看我。"

# game/script.rpy:14049
translate chinese nkg_7fa8768b:

    # "In the end she hands me the keys to Grace’s cuffs."
    "最后她把 Grace 手铐的钥匙递给我。"

# game/script.rpy:14065
translate chinese nkg_78073942:

    # "I bend over and to the side so I can unlock them."
    "我弯下腰，往旁边探身，好把手铐打开。"

# game/script.rpy:14066
translate chinese nkg_9a63b4e0:

    # "It’s very awkward at first, but I soon get the hang of it, and Grace is free."
    "一开始很别扭，但我很快摸到了窍门，Grace 自由了。"

# game/script.rpy:14067
translate chinese nkg_c6b388c9:

    # "She’s lying down on the ground. I think she's asleep."
    "她躺在地上。我想她睡着了。"

# game/script.rpy:14072
translate chinese nkg_5e3061dd:

    # "I touch one of her wrists, where the cuffs have dug into her skin. She breathes in sharply but doesn’t wake up."
    "我碰了碰她的一只手腕，手铐已经嵌进皮肉。她猛地吸了口气，但没有醒。"

# game/script.rpy:14073
translate chinese nkg_17f2871a:

    # "Her lips are cracked. She’s very pale."
    "她的嘴唇裂了。脸色非常白。"

# game/script.rpy:14087
translate chinese nkg_29c72e11:

    # a "Why did you do that?"
    a "你为什么要那样做？"

# game/script.rpy:14089
translate chinese nkg_8b5f954b:

    # j "Why do you think?"
    j "你觉得是为什么？"

# game/script.rpy:14095
translate chinese nkg_77ce296c:

    # a "I asked you first!"
    a "是我先问你的！"

# game/script.rpy:14097
translate chinese nkg_448b6a46:

    # "I place my blanket under Grace’s head, so it isn’t touching the hard concrete."
    "我把毯子垫在 Grace 头下，不让她的头贴着硬水泥。"

# game/script.rpy:14104
translate chinese nkg_ebd0bf15:

    # a "Is it a part of your plan?"
    a "这也是你计划的一部分吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14115
translate chinese nkg_8418f84e:

    # "I wheel myself around to face Anna."
    "我把轮椅转过来面对 Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:14116
translate chinese nkg_ba51784c:

    # "My arms are already tired. I’m weak."
    "我的手臂已经累了。我很虚弱。"

# game/script.rpy:14121
translate chinese nkg_e8d0305a:

    # a "Jack?"
    a "Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:14126
translate chinese nkg_98684880:

    # "The scalpel is still in my lap."
    "手术刀还在我膝上。"

# game/script.rpy:14128
translate chinese nkg_19b9e03c:

    # j "My plan, huh?"
    j "我的计划，是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14129
translate chinese nkg_0d66afe0:

    # j "My master plan."
    j "我的大计划。"

# game/script.rpy:14144
translate chinese nkg_ka_9f64a2bd:

    # j "Yes."
    j "是。"

# game/script.rpy:14145
translate chinese nkg_ka_fc8db988:

    # j "I guess this is part of it."
    j "我猜这也是其中一部分。"

# game/script.rpy:14147
translate chinese nkg_ka_56179c19:

    # "Though my arms are heavy, I manage one quick swing."
    "我还是快速挥出了一记。"

# game/script.rpy:14157
translate chinese nkg_ka_33100115:

    # a "Ugh!"
    a "呃！"

# game/script.rpy:14159
translate chinese nkg_ka_75b24aca:

    # j "Huh."
    j "噢。"

# game/script.rpy:14161
translate chinese nkg_ka_592842bc:

    # "It’s a good swing, too."
    "这一挥也很漂亮。"

# game/script.rpy:14163
translate chinese nkg_ka_014354f9:

    # "Anna doesn’t even have time to bring her hands up to her throat."
    "Anna 连抬手去捂喉咙的时间都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:14172
translate chinese nkg_ka_9229b47d:

    # "The drop in blood pressure drives her to the floor."
    "血压一落，她倒在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:14188
translate chinese nkg_ka_ec000052:

    # "She stares at me for a while, mouthing words I can’t understand."
    "她盯着我看了一会儿，嘴里做着口型，我看不懂。"

# game/script.rpy:14194
translate chinese nkg_ka_fa215e77:

    # "Less than a minute later, she stops."
    "不到一分钟，她就不动了。"

# game/script.rpy:14195
translate chinese nkg_ka_714871cf:

    # "She’s gone."
    "她走了。"

# game/script.rpy:14199
translate chinese nkg_ka_ad7f32cf:

    # j "Phew."
    j "呼。"

# game/script.rpy:14201
translate chinese nkg_ka_cd3c4caf:

    # "I place the scalpel in her hand, then fold her fingers around it."
    "我把手术刀放进她手里，再把她的手指合上。"

# game/script.rpy:14203
translate chinese nkg_ka_a20e430f:

    # j "Fingers crossed."
    j "但愿顺利。"

# game/script.rpy:14205
translate chinese nkg_ka_339c56f9:

    # "Behind me, I hear Grace stirring from her sleep."
    "身后，我听见 Grace 从睡中动了动。"

# game/script.rpy:14214
translate chinese nkg_ka_ac1b04f7:

    # "I get to her so fast I nearly run her over."
    "我推得太快，差点碾过她。"

# game/script.rpy:14225
translate chinese nkg_ka_f0d57158:

    # j "Grace?"
    j "Grace？"

# game/script.rpy:14226
translate chinese nkg_ka_917c6720:

    # j "Grace, are you awake?"
    j "Grace，你醒着吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14227
translate chinese nkg_ka_8c424668:

    # j "Can you hear me?"
    j "能听见我说话吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14232
translate chinese nkg_ka_aa385db8:

    # "Her eyes flutter open."
    "她睁开眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:14239
translate chinese nkg_ka_701e662f:

    # "She sees me and smiles."
    "她看见我，笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:14245
translate chinese nkg_ka_5b222718:

    # i "So you’re saying she...?"
    i "所以你是说，她……？"

# game/script.rpy:14251
translate chinese nkg_ka_c954b40b:

    # j "She did it to herself."
    j "她自己下的手。"

# game/script.rpy:14253
translate chinese nkg_ka_cfcf5fae:

    # i "Why?"
    i "为什么？"

# game/script.rpy:14255
translate chinese nkg_ka_2fdefc32:

    # j "Why?"
    j "为什么？"

# game/script.rpy:14256
translate chinese nkg_ka_988115a1:

    # j "I don’t know why."
    j "呃，我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:14257
translate chinese nkg_ka_e34000d3:

    # j "Maybe she saw no way out?"
    j "也许她看不到别的出路了？"

# game/script.rpy:14259
translate chinese nkg_ka_f708869e:

    # "I say the first thing I can think of. I’m too tired for anything else."
    "我说出了脑子里第一个想到的理由。我太累了，编不出别的。"

# game/script.rpy:14261
translate chinese nkg_ka_3d52843a:

    # i "Yeah, you sure had her cornered, eh?"
    i "是啊，你确实把她逼到死角了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:14267
translate chinese nkg_ka_a2a76472:

    # "The inspector taps at my wheelchair with his foot."
    "探长用脚踢了踢我的轮椅。"

# game/script.rpy:14268
translate chinese nkg_ka_7a349f7b:

    # "He seems me as harmless."
    "他觉得我无害。"

# game/script.rpy:14269
translate chinese nkg_ka_d2d9c9cf:

    # "Or I hope he does."
    "或者说，我希望如此。"

# game/script.rpy:14270
translate chinese nkg_ka_310c619b:

    # "I hope he’ll let me go soon."
    "我希望他快点放我走。"

# game/script.rpy:14271
translate chinese nkg_ka_eef53f6c:

    # "He doesn’t."
    "他并没有。"

# game/script.rpy:14281
translate chinese nkg_ka_bbe49269:

    # i "Come on, Friday."
    i "得了吧，Friday。"

# game/script.rpy:14282
translate chinese nkg_ka_c7bf4e3b:

    # i "That can’t be it."
    i "不可能就这样。"

# game/script.rpy:14283
translate chinese nkg_ka_2bbf0417:

    # i "Give me the {i}whole{/i} story."
    i "把{i}整件事{/i}都告诉我。"

# game/script.rpy:14285
translate chinese nkg_ka_fecc759b:

    # "I repeat what I said."
    "我把刚才说的又说了一遍。"

# game/script.rpy:14286
translate chinese nkg_ka_61d28130:

    # "Anna killed herself. I don’t know why."
    "Anna 自杀了。我不知道为什么。"

# game/script.rpy:14287
translate chinese nkg_ka_ed8b53a0:

    # "She must have lost her mind."
    "她一定是疯了。"

# game/script.rpy:14288
translate chinese nkg_ka_bcee18a1:

    # "The inspector doesn’t look happy."
    "探长看起来不高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:14289
translate chinese nkg_ka_e67c36d4:

    # "He’s been questioning me for hours."
    "他已经审了我几个钟头。"

# game/script.rpy:14290
translate chinese nkg_ka_6e6144ef:

    # "Now he’s about to start over again—ask me everything once more."
    "现在他准备再来一遍——把所有问题重问一次。"

# game/script.rpy:14291
translate chinese nkg_ka_232d4294:

    # "I can tell he’s going to do it. He’s done it so many times."
    "我看得出他要这么干。他已经这么干过好多次了。"

# game/script.rpy:14295
translate chinese nkg_ka_3bc4a1e6:

    # "But a knock on the door interrupts him. Someone’s calling him out."
    "可敲门声打断了他。有人叫他出去。"

# game/script.rpy:14297
translate chinese nkg_ka_0432a014:

    # i "Don’t go running off, now."
    i "别想着跑，啊。"

# game/script.rpy:14299
translate chinese nkg_ka_e8e1eaa4:

    # "He laughs as he walks off."
    "他笑着走开了。"

# game/script.rpy:14305
translate chinese nkg_ka_8148cd2d:

    # "A minute later there’s a crashing sound, like someone’s thrown a chair."
    "一分钟后传来砸东西的声音，像有人扔了把椅子。"

# game/script.rpy:14306
translate chinese nkg_ka_9e6c11e4:

    # "Within the hour, they let me leave."
    "不到一个钟头，他们就放我走了。"

# game/script.rpy:14321
translate chinese nkg_ka_658d2176:

    # "I’m visiting Grace in the hospital."
    "我去医院看 Grace。"

# game/script.rpy:14322
translate chinese nkg_ka_1adb72ec:

    # "She’s being treated for fatigue and dehydration."
    "她正在因疲劳和脱水接受治疗。"

# game/script.rpy:14324
translate chinese nkg_ka_d60b3478:

    # j "Hey, you'll be out soon, right?"
    j "喂，你很快就能出院了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:14325
translate chinese nkg_ka_e3cf3b42:

    # j "What do you want to do when you get of here?"
    j "你出院之后想做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:14326
translate chinese nkg_ka_673b01bd:

    # j "What’s the first thing?"
    j "第一件事是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:14332
translate chinese nkg_ka_4df6f7ac:

    # "She makes a happy sound."
    "她发出高兴的一声。"

# game/script.rpy:14338
translate chinese nkg_ka_d219f602:

    # g "Oh, I thought about it a lot."
    g "噢，我想了很多。"

# game/script.rpy:14343
translate chinese nkg_ka_ce037808:

    # g "But I don’t know."
    g "呃，我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:14348
translate chinese nkg_ka_907acc93:

    # g "I'd like to do anything. As long as it’s with you, Jack."
    g "我什么都想做。只要是跟你一起，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:14350
translate chinese nkg_ka_f5f232a6:

    # "I squeeze her hand."
    "我握紧她的手。"

# game/script.rpy:14352
translate chinese nkg_ka_63a0d97c:

    # j "I want us to go on a long walk somewhere."
    j "我想我们找个地方，走很长很长的路。"

# game/script.rpy:14358
translate chinese nkg_ka_cba633aa:

    # "Grace looks down at my leg."
    "Grace 低头看我的腿。"

# game/script.rpy:14360
translate chinese nkg_ka_29083db3:

    # j "Yeah, I know."
    j "我知道。"

# game/script.rpy:14361
translate chinese nkg_ka_5dceb99a:

    # j "But I’ll be walking again in no time."
    j "但我很快就能重新走路了。"

# game/script.rpy:14362
translate chinese nkg_ka_37e23fa1:

    # j "You’ll see."
    j "你会看到的。"

# game/script.rpy:14368
translate chinese nkg_ka_666f16ce:

    # g "I can’t wait."
    g "我等不及了。"

# game/script.rpy:14373
translate chinese nkg_ka_e12be71b:

    # g "Going on a walk would be perfect."
    g "去散步就很好。"

# game/script.rpy:14379
translate chinese nkg_ka_aa85b5ca:

    # g "A long walk... somewhere far away."
    g "走很长很长的路……去很远的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:14381
translate chinese nkg_ka_9962b39b:

    # "Even when she smiles, she doesn’t show much teeth."
    "她笑起来，也不太露牙。"

# game/script.rpy:14382
translate chinese nkg_ka_5fb9c608:

    # "She must be self-conscious about how she looks, with four of them gone."
    "少了四颗牙，她一定在意自己的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:14383
translate chinese nkg_ka_0c86ca1e:

    # "I don’t remember all that well, but I think at least one was a front tooth."
    "我记得不太清，但至少有一颗是门牙。"

# game/script.rpy:14384
translate chinese nkg_ka_39d464b0:

    # "Poor girl."
    "可怜的姑娘。"

# game/script.rpy:14393
translate chinese nkg_ka_f4a18d1d:

    # g "Hey, Jack?"
    g "喂，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:14395
translate chinese nkg_ka_c73fa029:

    # j "Hey."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:14403
translate chinese nkg_ka_a5b4153a:

    # g "I know what you did, you know."
    g "你知道吗，你做的事我都知道。"

# game/script.rpy:14405
translate chinese nkg_ka_41abaa47:

    # j "...What?"
    j "什么？"

# game/script.rpy:14411
translate chinese nkg_ka_f70dc34e:

    # g "I saw everything."
    g "我全都看见了。"

# game/script.rpy:14413
translate chinese nkg_ka_d266b7f1:

    # j "You... saw what?"
    j "你……看见什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:14427
translate chinese nkg_ka_c35b306e:

    # "She brings a finger to one side of her neck, and slides it across to the other side."
    "她把一根手指放到脖子一侧，横着划到另一侧。"

# game/script.rpy:14432
translate chinese nkg_ka_61577b24:

    # g "I saw {i}that.{/i}"
    g "我看见了{i}那个{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:14434
translate chinese nkg_ka_29139162:

    # "The meaning is clear."
    "意思很清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:14436
translate chinese nkg_ka_13f62006:

    # j "A-And...?"
    j "然、然后……？"

# game/script.rpy:14445
translate chinese nkg_ka_29a144e7:

    # g "Thank you!"
    g "谢谢你！"

# game/script.rpy:14451
translate chinese nkg_ka_63312f5e:

    # g "I hoped for so long that you’d come save me. And then there you were."
    g "我盼了那么久，盼你来救我。然后你就出现了。"

# game/script.rpy:14458
translate chinese nkg_ka_2e2e404f:

    # g "You were so brave. It was amazing."
    g "你真勇敢。太厉害了。"

# game/script.rpy:14463
translate chinese nkg_ka_4417365f:

    # g "I never could’ve done that."
    g "我绝对做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:14465
translate chinese nkg_ka_b9aa88b6:

    # j "...That’s it?"
    j "……就这样？"

# game/script.rpy:14471
translate chinese nkg_ka_b421d792:

    # g "That’s it."
    g "就这样。"

# game/script.rpy:14477
translate chinese nkg_ka_6bda3216:

    # g "What, were you worried I’d tell someone?"
    g "怎么，你担心我会说出去？"

# game/script.rpy:14483
translate chinese nkg_ka_efd85918:

    # g "Jeez. You should know I wouldn't do that."
    g "天啊。你该知道我不会那么做的。"

# game/script.rpy:14488
translate chinese nkg_ka_fc7c8bb4:

    # g "It was my idea to kill her in the first place. Remember?"
    g "当初要杀她，本来就是我的主意。记得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14493
translate chinese nkg_ka_dd56bd53:

    # g "And I love you too much to tell on you, anyway."
    g "再说我太爱你了，才不会去告发你。"

# game/script.rpy:14498
translate chinese nkg_ka_d5c7a6cb:

    # g "I told them Anna killed herself."
    g "我跟他们说，Anna 是自杀的。"

# game/script.rpy:14504
translate chinese nkg_ka_857be32d:

    # g "That’s why you put the knife in her hand, isn’t it?"
    g "所以你把刀放进了她手里，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:14509
translate chinese nkg_ka_7d09d227:

    # g "That was very clever of you."
    g "你这一手真聪明。"

# game/script.rpy:14515
translate chinese nkg_ka_46f8fe8d:

    # g "And now she’s gone, and there’s nothing in our way anymore."
    g "现在她走了，我们再没有阻碍了。"

# game/script.rpy:14520
translate chinese nkg_ka_ae78a3a9:

    # g "Isn’t that amazing?"
    g "这不是很棒吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14522
translate chinese nkg_ka_984f6b91:

    # j "...Yeah."
    j "……是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:14530
translate chinese nkg_ka_e2820925:

    # g "Hey, hey, Jack."
    g "嘿，嘿，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:14535
translate chinese nkg_ka_bcfea7b6:

    # g "I did think of something to do when I’m out, after all."
    g "我还真想好出院后要做什么了。"

# game/script.rpy:14537
translate chinese nkg_ka_ef3b9281:

    # j "What’s that, Grace?"
    j "什么事，Grace？"

# game/script.rpy:14542
translate chinese nkg_ka_88b973c6:

    # g "I’ll hold you close."
    g "我会紧紧抱着你。"

# game/script.rpy:14547
translate chinese nkg_ka_cb3b2066:

    # g "And I’ll never let go of you. Ever again."
    g "我再也不会放开你。再也不会。"

# game/script.rpy:14549
translate chinese nkg_ka_eb233dbb:

    # "She's got the most innocent smile I've ever seen."
    "她露出我见过最天真的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:14551
translate chinese nkg_ka_e7eb75b9:

    # j "I see."
    j "原来如此。"

# game/script.rpy:14553
translate chinese nkg_ka_bc9b385d:

    # "{i}Well.{/i}"
    "{i}好吧。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:14554
translate chinese nkg_ka_b2fa72d6:

    # "{w=0.25}.{w=0.5}.{w=0.5}."
    "{w=0.25}.{w=0.5}.{w=0.5}."

# game/script.rpy:14555
translate chinese nkg_ka_358ea1b2:

    # "{i}I guess this is fine, too.{/i}"
    "{i}我想这样也不错。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:14557
translate chinese nkg_ka_ad10a89a:

    # "I smile."
    "我笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:14563
translate chinese nkg_ka_4b0c44f0:

    # g "You like the sound of that, don't you?"
    g "你喜欢听这个，是不是？"

# game/script.rpy:14565
translate chinese nkg_ka_667c2f83:

    # j "Yeah... I was just thinking."
    j "是啊……我刚在想。"

# game/script.rpy:14571
translate chinese nkg_ka_014315ab:

    # g "Yeah?"
    g "想什么？"

# game/script.rpy:14573
translate chinese nkg_ka_580b840f:

    # j "Things are going so incredibly well."
    j "一切都顺利得不可思议。"

# game/script.rpy:14574
translate chinese nkg_ka_2379351b:

    # j "It’s like the whole world is bending over backwards for us."
    j "就像整个世界都在为我们迁就。"

# game/script.rpy:14575
translate chinese nkg_ka_69a23f18:

    # j "Even though..."
    j "尽管……"

# game/script.rpy:14581
translate chinese nkg_ka_55571a37:

    # g "Even though what, Jack?"
    g "尽管什么，Jack？"

# game/script.rpy:14583
translate chinese nkg_ka_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

# game/script.rpy:14585
translate chinese nkg_ka_08a3302b:

    # j "No, it’s nothing."
    j "不，没事的啦。"

# game/script.rpy:14586
translate chinese nkg_ka_4cc2e354:

    # j "We have every right to be happy."
    j "我们完全有资格幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:14587
translate chinese nkg_ka_8f1b7377:

    # j "Don’t we?"
    j "不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14592
translate chinese nkg_ka_de600a4d:

    # g "We do."
    g "我们有。"

# game/script.rpy:14597
translate chinese nkg_ka_da04c926:

    # g "We deserve this. The most out of anyone in the world."
    g "这是我们应得的。世上没有人比我们更该得到。"

# game/script.rpy:14601
translate chinese nkg_ka_2e43822b:

    # j "Yeah... we do."
    j "是啊……我们确实该。"

# game/script.rpy:14609
translate chinese nkg_ka_d7a56ba9:

    # "We talk and smile and laugh together—two people on their way to a happily ever after."
    "两个人正走向从此幸福美满的结局。"

# game/script.rpy:14628
translate chinese nkg_nka_a970e574:

    # "I toss the scalpel out through one of the glassless windows."
    "我把手术刀从一扇没玻璃的窗户丢了出去。"

# game/script.rpy:14629
translate chinese nkg_nka_b11e8467:

    # "It makes no sound as it hits the ground."
    "它落地时没有声音。"

# game/script.rpy:14633
translate chinese nkg_nka_eba6d9c9:

    # j "There is no plan."
    j "没有什么计划。"

# game/script.rpy:14634
translate chinese nkg_nka_676129dc:

    # j "There’s never been one."
    j "从来就没有过。"

# game/script.rpy:14640
translate chinese nkg_nka_3f480409:

    # "Anna stares."
    "Anna 愣住了。"

# game/script.rpy:14642
translate chinese nkg_nka_d6556b94:

    # j "Go call for help."
    j "去叫人。"

# game/script.rpy:14643
translate chinese nkg_nka_8e3e26ae:

    # j "We need to get Grace to a hospital."
    j "我们得把 Grace 送医院。"

# game/script.rpy:14648
translate chinese nkg_nka_9f428aed:

    # a "Who are you?"
    a "你是谁？"

# game/script.rpy:14650
translate chinese nkg_nka_f3c875c0:

    # j "Hello, my name is Jack."
    j "你好，我叫 Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:14651
translate chinese nkg_nka_f54db4f1:

    # j "It’s nice to meet you."
    j "很高兴认识你。"

# game/script.rpy:14656
translate chinese nkg_nka_7c49942b:

    # a "No—no, you’re not."
    a "不——不，你不是。"

# game/script.rpy:14663
translate chinese nkg_nka_59dc83ec:

    # a "How come you remember everything, and you’re—you’re still...?"
    a "你怎么全都想起来了，可你——你还是……？"

# game/script.rpy:14668
translate chinese nkg_nka_fc816e5e:

    # a "...I thought..."
    a "……我以为……"

# game/script.rpy:14670
translate chinese nkg_nka_e15ae163:

    # j "I’m sorry, Anna."
    j "对不起，Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:14671
translate chinese nkg_nka_ff55ce83:

    # j "I caused you so much harm. More than I can repay—ever."
    j "我伤害你太深了。多到我永远还不清。"

# game/script.rpy:14676
translate chinese nkg_nka_d6701b57:

    # a "No, you never..."
    a "不，你从来没有……"

# game/script.rpy:14678
translate chinese nkg_nka_edfac0de:

    # j "I killed your parents."
    j "我杀了你父母。"

# game/script.rpy:14684
translate chinese nkg_nka_7199f17e:

    # a "Who cares about that?!"
    a "谁在乎那个？！"

# game/script.rpy:14691
translate chinese nkg_nka_8a66b225:

    # a "They were sheep."
    a "他们是羊。"

# game/script.rpy:14693
translate chinese nkg_nka_0bbc3955:

    # j "They were people."
    j "他们是人。"

# game/script.rpy:14694
translate chinese nkg_nka_c419350f:

    # j "We’re people, too."
    j "我们也是人。"

# game/script.rpy:14695
translate chinese nkg_nka_9ae988da:

    # j "There’s only people."
    j "这世上只有人。"

# game/script.rpy:14702
translate chinese nkg_nka_9568ecf9:

    # a "Shut up!"
    a "闭嘴！"

# game/script.rpy:14704
translate chinese nkg_nka_c71cb18c:

    # j "It's true."
    j "是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:14710
translate chinese nkg_nka_d1ded906:

    # a "No, you’re {i}wrong.{/i}"
    a "不，你{i}错了{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:14712
translate chinese nkg_nka_939b6134:

    # j "I’m so sorry."
    j "我十分抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:14719
translate chinese nkg_nka_7a9d6bed:

    # "Anna takes out a knife and holds it to my throat."
    "Anna 掏出刀，抵在我喉咙上。"

# game/script.rpy:14720
translate chinese nkg_nka_266fd3e6:

    # "Is it Grace’s knife? The one she wanted to kill Anna with?"
    "是 Grace 那把吗？她想用来杀 Anna 的那把？"

# game/script.rpy:14721
translate chinese nkg_nka_5512981d:

    # "I’m not sure. It could be."
    "我不确定。也许是。"

# game/script.rpy:14723
translate chinese nkg_nka_2f725020:

    # "Either way, she has it pressed against my jugular."
    "不管怎样，它现在贴在我的颈静脉上。"

# game/script.rpy:14730
translate chinese nkg_nka_643760da:

    # a "Stop playing tricks with me."
    a "别再耍我了。"

# game/script.rpy:14736
translate chinese nkg_nka_ba83be89:

    # a "{i}Please.{/i}"
    a "{i}求你。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:14741
translate chinese nkg_nka_71fb3174:

    # a "I can’t take it."
    a "我受不了。"

# game/script.rpy:14743
translate chinese nkg_nka_a51c4aa3:

    # j "Don’t do this, Anna."
    j "别这样，Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:14745
translate chinese nkg_nka_e2208875:

    # "If she kills me, her future is done for."
    "她要是杀了我，她的将来就完了。"

# game/script.rpy:14746
translate chinese nkg_nka_f1a1769b:

    # "I can’t let that happen. This is my fault."
    "我不能让这种事发生。这是我的错。"

# game/script.rpy:14748
translate chinese nkg_nka_2a4501fc:

    # j "Put the knife down."
    j "把刀放下。"

# game/script.rpy:14755
translate chinese nkg_nka_5ff8e264:

    # a "Or what?!"
    a "不然呢？！"

# game/script.rpy:14761
translate chinese nkg_nka_b8c2e29d:

    # a "You... you’ll do what?"
    a "你……你能怎样？"

# game/script.rpy:14763
translate chinese nkg_nka_c24c315a:

    # j "I won’t do anything."
    j "我什么都不会做。"

# game/script.rpy:14764
translate chinese nkg_nka_d5b274f3:

    # j "I’d never hurt you."
    j "我永远不会伤害你。"

# game/script.rpy:14765
translate chinese nkg_nka_d37fc58c:

    # j "I want you to be happy."
    j "我希望你幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:14772
translate chinese nkg_nka_1453b540:

    # a "Th-Then...!"
    a "那、那……！"

# game/script.rpy:14785
translate chinese nkg_nka_0781b78c:

    # "Anna forces my fingers around the knife's handle."
    "Anna 硬把我的手指按在刀柄上。"

# game/script.rpy:14791
translate chinese nkg_nka_f1d41bc3:

    # a "Take this, a-and..."
    a "拿着，然、然后……"

# game/script.rpy:14800
translate chinese nkg_nka_61ab176f:

    # "Wiping her eyes, she turns my wheelchair until I’m facing Grace."
    "她擦着眼睛，把我的轮椅转到正对 Grace。"

# game/script.rpy:14807
translate chinese nkg_nka_d7016927:

    # a "Do it!"
    a "动手！"

# game/script.rpy:14812
translate chinese nkg_nka_dae0ee77:

    # a "I’ll be happy then!"
    a "那我就高兴了！"

# game/script.rpy:14818
translate chinese nkg_nka_fa06939d:

    # a "Kill her!"
    a "杀了她！"

# game/script.rpy:14820
translate chinese nkg_nka_393f286a:

    # j "I can’t."
    j "我做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:14825
translate chinese nkg_nka_636aaf8c:

    # a "Why not?!"
    a "为什么不行？！"

# game/script.rpy:14833
translate chinese nkg_nka_ed1cbea8:

    # j "I’m not who you think I am."
    j "我不是你以为的那个人。"

# game/script.rpy:14835
translate chinese nkg_nka_8eec4c75:

    # "The man she thought I was doesn’t exist."
    "她以为的那个我，并不存在。"

# game/script.rpy:14836
translate chinese nkg_nka_eeefaeab:

    # "He never did."
    "从来就不存在。"

# game/script.rpy:14838
translate chinese nkg_nka_c3068f2a:

    # j "What I did when we were kids was a mistake. I’m..."
    j "我们小时候我做的那些，是个错误。我……"

# game/script.rpy:14843
translate chinese nkg_nka_dfac142b:

    # a "No, it wasn’t a mistake..."
    a "不，那不是错误……"

# game/script.rpy:14849
translate chinese nkg_nka_bf214f09:

    # a "It wasn’t!"
    a "不是的！"

# game/script.rpy:14855
translate chinese nkg_nka_b360d2e9:

    # a "You... you’re..."
    a "你……你是……"

# game/script.rpy:14860
translate chinese nkg_nka_47c5155f:

    # a "You were my... my hero."
    a "你是我……我的英雄。"

# game/script.rpy:14867
translate chinese nkg_nka_b4e94983:

    # a "...Right?"
    a "……对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:14869
translate chinese nkg_nka_dbf00c83:

    # "She’s struggling. She might accept the truth, or maybe she won’t."
    "她在挣扎。她也许会接受真相，也许不会。"

# game/script.rpy:14870
translate chinese nkg_nka_0d7e937a:

    # "It can’t be easy, realizing there was no meaning behind the most important thing that ever happened to you."
    "发现你生命中最重要的那件事背后什么意义都没有，这不会轻松。"

# game/script.rpy:14874
translate chinese nkg_nka_ceceb4d7:

    # "I can’t stand watching her. I squeeze my eyes shut."
    "我受不了看她。我把眼睛紧紧闭上。"

# game/script.rpy:14880
translate chinese nkg_nka_8b206f47:

    # n "A part of me wishes Anna will reject the truth—because then she won’t blame me."
    n "我心里有一部分希望 Anna 拒绝接受真相——因为那样她就不会怪我。"

# game/script.rpy:14881
translate chinese nkg_nka_0ef629dc:

    # n "The guilt I have right now is already so strong it could crush me."
    n "我现在的愧疚已经重得能把我压垮。"

# game/script.rpy:14882
translate chinese nkg_nka_431f2517:

    # n "If she starts blaming me for what happened... I don’t know what I’ll do."
    n "要是她开始为这件事怪我……我不知道自己会做出什么。"

# game/script.rpy:14883
translate chinese nkg_nka_059b3c57:

    # n "But I also see how selfish this is."
    n "可我也看得出这有多自私。"

# game/script.rpy:14885
translate chinese nkg_nka_d3d436cb:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I should feel guilty."
    nvl clear
    n "我应该愧疚。"

# game/script.rpy:14888
translate chinese nkg_nka_82cc2ae3:

    # n "I {i}am{/i} guilty."
    n "我{i}确实{/i}有罪。"

# game/script.rpy:14889
translate chinese nkg_nka_0ed96cfc:

    # n "I’ve gone all these years without even knowing about the horrible things I’ve done."
    n "这些年我一直不知道自己做过的那些可怕的事。"

# game/script.rpy:14890
translate chinese nkg_nka_c582c603:

    # n "That’s a crime in itself."
    n "那本身就是一种罪。"

# game/script.rpy:14892
translate chinese nkg_nka_74da76c5:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I deserve every bad thing that comes my way."
    nvl clear
    n "落到我头上的每一件坏事，我都该受。"

# game/script.rpy:14895
translate chinese nkg_nka_bf0aab5f:

    # n "I should be shot. I should be hanged. Worse things, too."
    n "我该被枪毙。该被吊死。还有更糟的。"

# game/script.rpy:14896
translate chinese nkg_nka_0e92ad97:

    # n "And I don’t have the right to complain."
    n "而我没有抱怨的资格。"

# game/script.rpy:14898
translate chinese nkg_nka_76b2fe88:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:14902
translate chinese nkg_nka_10793920:

    # n "I realize I’m still holding the knife."
    n "我这才发现自己手里还握着刀。"

# game/script.rpy:14903
translate chinese nkg_nka_e9972ade:

    # n "What if I...?"
    n "要是我……？"

# game/script.rpy:14905
translate chinese nkg_nka_51be491c:

    # nvl clear
    # n "{w=1}There’s a hand on my shoulder."
    nvl clear
    n "{w=1}有一只手落在我肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:14908
translate chinese nkg_nka_27dc9882:

    # n "I don’t want to look."
    n "我不想看。"

# game/script.rpy:14909
translate chinese nkg_nka_94defbc8:

    # n "I look."
    n "我看了。"

# game/script.rpy:14925
translate chinese nkg_nka_2fa0291a:

    # "A cool breeze wakes me up."
    "一阵凉风把我吹醒。"

# game/script.rpy:14926
translate chinese nkg_nka_bb319b10:

    # "Thank God something woke me up."
    "幸好有什么把我叫醒了。"

# game/script.rpy:14927
translate chinese nkg_nka_1a96e592:

    # "I hate being stuck in the past."
    "我讨厌被困在过去。"

# game/script.rpy:14940
translate chinese nkg_nka_daa66af4:

    # a "You're finally awake, Jack."
    a "你终于醒了，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:14945
translate chinese nkg_nka_bb048977:

    # a "Did you have a nice dream?"
    a "做了个好梦吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14947
translate chinese nkg_nka_05eb561c:

    # j "Ah... I..."
    j "啊……我……"

# game/script.rpy:14949
translate chinese nkg_nka_5d6f3fa0:

    # "Should I tell her?"
    "我要告诉她吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14951
translate chinese nkg_nka_da65ecfa:

    # j "I... don't remember."
    j "我不记得了。"

# game/script.rpy:14964
translate chinese nkg_nka_5a8d4d42:

    # g "I was about to wake you up myself."
    g "我正要自己把你叫醒呢。"

# game/script.rpy:14970
translate chinese nkg_nka_384447f5:

    # g "You can't ask us to come out here and then spend all day snoozing. It's not fair."
    g "你叫我们出来，自己却睡了一整天。这不公平。"

# game/script.rpy:14972
translate chinese nkg_nka_e33f02ef:

    # "I laugh."
    "我笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:14974
translate chinese nkg_nka_4a443ba0:

    # j "Sorry."
    j "抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:14975
translate chinese nkg_nka_31d42e64:

    # j "I'll make it up to you next time, all right?"
    j "下次我补偿你们，行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:14981
translate chinese nkg_nka_d214e99b:

    # g "Well... okay, then."
    g "好吧，就这样了。"

# game/script.rpy:14986
translate chinese nkg_nka_65323db5:

    # g "If you say so."
    g "好吧，既然你都这么说了。"

# game/script.rpy:14988
translate chinese nkg_nka_ac219f3a:

    # "Grace flashes me a smile."
    "Grace 朝我笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:14989
translate chinese nkg_nka_6d1888ce:

    # "She’s got all her teeth again."
    "她的牙又都齐了。"

# game/script.rpy:14990
translate chinese nkg_nka_4b6beffa:

    # "She used to have an outline of a wound on her neck, but that’s gone now, too. Not a trace of it."
    "她脖子上原来有一道伤口的轮廓，现在也没了。一点痕迹都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:14991
translate chinese nkg_nka_f10a6424:

    # "You could say that about all three of us: not a trace of anything."
    "我们三个都可以这么说：什么痕迹都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:14992
translate chinese nkg_nka_dfeea898:

    # "If someone came walking by, they might think we had no worries or regrets or anything bad in our lives at all."
    "要是有人路过，可能会以为我们生活里没有烦恼、没有悔恨，什么坏事都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:14993
translate chinese nkg_nka_2766ce02:

    # "The girls are up on their feet."
    "两个女孩都站了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:14994
translate chinese nkg_nka_98fd5041:

    # "I try to get up, too, but I’m having trouble."
    "我也想站起来，可很费劲。"

# game/script.rpy:14999
translate chinese nkg_nka_0a82a15c:

    # a "Need some help?"
    a "要帮忙吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15001
translate chinese nkg_nka_852217f1:

    # j "Please."
    j "麻烦你。"

# game/script.rpy:15013
translate chinese nkg_nka_48fd2a32:

    # "Anna takes my right hand. Grace scrambles to take my left."
    "Anna 拉住我的右手。Grace 急忙来拉我的左手。"

# game/script.rpy:15022
translate chinese nkg_nka_45f9f997:

    # "They pull me up together."
    "她们一起把我拉了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:15027
translate chinese nkg_nka_9e88d53f:

    # "We start slowly walking back."
    "我们慢慢往回走。"

# game/script.rpy:15028
translate chinese nkg_nka_1464bbe7:

    # "I really have slept a long time—the sun is much farther in the sky than it was. It’s casting long shadows."
    "我确实睡了很久——太阳在天上的位置高了不少。它投下长长的影子。"

# game/script.rpy:15029
translate chinese nkg_nka_6703b21c:

    # "There are people watching us from afar."
    "远处有人在看我们。"

# game/script.rpy:15037
translate chinese nkg_nka_b5f9e57f:

    # g "When are we going to do this again?"
    g "我们什么时候再来一次？"

# game/script.rpy:15039
translate chinese nkg_nka_437cacaf:

    # j "I don’t know. When we can."
    j "不知道。等有空的时候吧。"

# game/script.rpy:15045
translate chinese nkg_nka_0839cba2:

    # g "Promise it won’t take too long?"
    g "答应我别隔太久？"

# game/script.rpy:15047
translate chinese nkg_nka_b5aa9f9e:

    # j "Yeah, I promise."
    j "嗯，我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:15054
translate chinese nkg_nka_ae463a4f:

    # "This seems to satisfy her."
    "这话似乎让她满意了。"

# game/script.rpy:15058
translate chinese nkg_nka_5638ebda:

    # "I take in a deep breath. My lungs fill with fresh air."
    "我深吸一口气。肺里灌满新鲜空气。"

# game/script.rpy:15059
translate chinese nkg_nka_9d509144:

    # "I love it here. It's so peaceful."
    "我喜欢这儿。这么安静。"

# game/script.rpy:15060
translate chinese nkg_nka_4d351c21:

    # "There’s nothing around for miles."
    "方圆几里什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:15064
translate chinese nkg_nka_793bc78f:

    # "Well, almost nothing. There is that one building."
    "嗯，几乎什么都没有。除了那一栋楼。"

# game/script.rpy:15065
translate chinese nkg_nka_e301051f:

    # "It looks like a mansion. You wouldn’t think it was anything else."
    "看着像座宅邸。你不会想到别的。"

# game/script.rpy:15071
translate chinese nkg_nka_acc5cf8a:

    # j "It's great out here, isn't it?"
    j "这儿真好，是不是？"

# game/script.rpy:15079
translate chinese nkg_nka_809a6fc0:

    # a "It's pretty nice."
    a "挺不错的。"

# game/script.rpy:15087
translate chinese nkg_nka_bd6912d0:

    # g "Yeah. It isn't home, but..."
    g "是啊。虽说不是家，可……"

# game/script.rpy:15089
translate chinese nkg_nka_7866b15f:

    # j "I really like it here."
    j "我真的很喜欢这里。"

# game/script.rpy:15090
translate chinese nkg_nka_56a56c4a:

    # j "And I've met so many new people."
    j "而且我认识了好多人。"

# game/script.rpy:15091
translate chinese nkg_nka_f5f45d10:

    # j "You know, if there's one thing I've managed to learn here, it's that you need as many friends as you can get in life."
    j "你知道吗，我在这儿学到的一件事就是：这辈子朋友越多越好。"

# game/script.rpy:15092
translate chinese nkg_nka_d776e9a4:

    # j "A whole bunch of people to love."
    j "要有一大堆可以去爱的人。"

# game/script.rpy:15093
translate chinese nkg_nka_e439a9fd:

    # j "It makes everything so much easier to bear."
    j "这样什么都好承受得多。"

# game/script.rpy:15094
translate chinese nkg_nka_41e008da:

    # j "And you might get hurt, sure, but that's just how life is."
    j "当然，你可能会受伤，可生活就是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:15098
translate chinese nkg_nka_76b2fe88_1:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:15108
translate chinese nkg_nka_d3cf1809:

    # n "I guess to most people this is all extremely obvious, but it took me a long time to figure out."
    n "这些对大多数人大概显而易见，可我花了很久才想明白。"

# game/script.rpy:15109
translate chinese nkg_nka_338f7cfb:

    # n "At one point I even thought I could make it through life alone."
    n "有段时间我甚至以为一个人也能过完一辈子。"

# game/script.rpy:15111
translate chinese nkg_nka_de6dd163:

    # nvl clear
    # n "And maybe I could have made it alone—but I didn't have to. Grace showed me this."
    nvl clear
    n "也许我一个人真能过下去——可我不必如此。这是 Grace 让我看到的。"

# game/script.rpy:15114
translate chinese nkg_nka_6f9bc87f:

    # n "Grace taught me how sweeter life was when you had someone to share it with."
    n "Grace 教会我，有人分享的生活甜得多。"

# game/script.rpy:15115
translate chinese nkg_nka_09211e80:

    # n "But even after learning that, I was still cold and rude to people."
    n "可就算明白了这一点，我对人还是冷淡又无礼。"

# game/script.rpy:15116
translate chinese nkg_nka_2fb41097:

    # n "I was cold and rude to the people I worked with, and to the other patients in the hospital— I was like that with anyone other than Grace."
    n "我对一起干活的人冷淡无礼，对医院里别的病人也是——除了 Grace，我对谁都那样。"

# game/script.rpy:15118
translate chinese nkg_nka_22e8716c:

    # nvl clear
    # n "That was no way to live life."
    nvl clear
    n "那样没法过日子。"

# game/script.rpy:15121
translate chinese nkg_nka_2946e7e1:

    # n "It was Anna who, in her own way, taught me that I had to change."
    n "是 Anna，用她自己的方式，教会我必须改变。"

# game/script.rpy:15123
translate chinese nkg_nka_da0dc768:

    # nvl clear
    # n "One person to share life with is not nearly enough. It's like building a house with only a single, thin wall."
    nvl clear
    n "只跟一个人分享生活远远不够。那就像只用一面薄墙盖房子。"

# game/script.rpy:15126
translate chinese nkg_nka_03416447:

    # n "\"A house with only one wall\"—that's the metaphor I've heard used. I think it's a good one."
    n "“只有一面墙的房子”——我听过这个比喻。我觉得很贴切。"

# game/script.rpy:15127
translate chinese nkg_nka_cf006207:

    # n "If there's only one relationship in your life that really matters, and something happens to that relationship, your whole life can crumble just like that."
    n "如果你生命里只有一段真正重要的关系，而这段关系出了事，你的整个人生就会那样垮掉。"

# game/script.rpy:15129
translate chinese nkg_nka_23371750:

    # nvl clear
    # n "If I had known this from the start, things could have gone a lot better."
    nvl clear
    n "要是我一开始就懂这个，事情会好得多。"

# game/script.rpy:15132
translate chinese nkg_nka_8d6dc5a0:

    # n "But I didn't know it, so that's that."
    n "但我当时不知道，所以也只能这样了。"

# game/script.rpy:15133
translate chinese nkg_nka_9ce06e8a:

    # n "There is not use beating myself up over it. Not over that."
    n "没必要为这个自责。不为这个。"

# game/script.rpy:15134
translate chinese nkg_nka_23a4a350:

    # n "I should be grateful, instead."
    n "我应该感激才对。"

# game/script.rpy:15136
translate chinese nkg_nka_76b2fe88_2:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:15144
translate chinese nkg_nka_9b049a8c:

    # j "I don't think I'll ever thank you two enough."
    j "我大概一辈子都谢不完你们俩。"

# game/script.rpy:15149
translate chinese nkg_nka_906b3d20:

    # g "Thank us for what?"
    g "谢我们什么？"

# game/script.rpy:15154
translate chinese nkg_nka_045dd26f:

    # j "For helping me sort out my mess of a life."
    j "谢你们帮我理清我这团乱糟糟的人生。"

# game/script.rpy:15161
translate chinese nkg_nka_4b4dc9a4:

    # a "That's a strange way to describe what I did..."
    a "这么说我做的事，挺奇怪的……"

# game/script.rpy:15166
translate chinese nkg_nka_3458eb5a:

    # j "No, for real. I mean it."
    j "不，我是认真的。真心话。"

# game/script.rpy:15167
translate chinese nkg_nka_9a6fb353:

    # j "Thank you."
    j "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:15175
translate chinese nkg_nka_a0ade8de:

    # g "What's with that, all of a sudden?"
    g "怎么突然说这个？"

# game/script.rpy:15179
translate chinese nkg_nka_94cefe1c:

    # j "I just felt like saying it."
    j "我只是忽然想说。"

# game/script.rpy:15181
translate chinese nkg_nka_0ae9c73a:

    # "We take a little break so I can stretch my leg."
    "我们歇了一会儿，让我活动活动腿。"

# game/script.rpy:15182
translate chinese nkg_nka_0fc0e705:

    # "I massage my knee. It's starting to hurt."
    "我揉着膝盖。它开始疼了。"

# game/script.rpy:15184
translate chinese nkg_nka_782fb2c9:

    # j "I met someone new the other day, by the way."
    j "对了，前几天我认识了一个新朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:15186
translate chinese nkg_nka_2bfc9321:

    # "In all honesty, I'm bad at meeting new people, at making friends."
    "说实话，我不擅长认识新人，不擅长交朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:15187
translate chinese nkg_nka_7cade4c7:

    # "But I damn well try."
    "可我他妈拼了命在试。"

# game/script.rpy:15189
translate chinese nkg_nka_bad699fd:

    # j "I met a woman named Anne. Funny, right?"
    j "我认识了一个叫 Anne 的女人。有意思吧？"

# game/script.rpy:15190
translate chinese nkg_nka_c6f9ac9c:

    # j "I'll have to introduce you to her. I think you'd really get along."
    j "我得把她介绍给你们。我觉得你们会合得来。"

# game/script.rpy:15195
translate chinese nkg_nka_ab6a2588:

    # g "A woman?"
    g "一个女人？"

# game/script.rpy:15197
translate chinese nkg_nka_e16d2a3e:

    # j "Hey, don't get jealous now."
    j "喂，别吃醋啊。"

# game/script.rpy:15203
translate chinese nkg_nka_ee608bbd:

    # g "I'm not."
    g "我没有。"

# game/script.rpy:15205
translate chinese nkg_nka_24902dc1:

    # j "There's no reason for you to be jealous of anyone, Grace. Or you, Anna."
    j "你们没必要吃任何人的醋，Grace。你也是，Anna。"

# game/script.rpy:15206
translate chinese nkg_nka_a3127902:

    # j "You're the most important people to me in the world."
    j "你们是我在这世上最重要的人。"

# game/script.rpy:15218
translate chinese nkg_nka_d5876e3c:

    # "That's true, and the girls know it's true."
    "这是实话，而她们也知道是实话。"

# game/script.rpy:15219
translate chinese nkg_nka_57e2e992:

    # "They mean the world to me."
    "她们就是我的全世界。"

# game/script.rpy:15220
translate chinese nkg_nka_0ea7aef1:

    # "I care about them, and they care about me—and that's what truly matters."
    "我在意她们，她们也在意我——这才是真正重要的。"

# game/script.rpy:15234
translate chinese nkg_nka_585694b4:

    # a "Jack, did you happen to be dreaming about... what happened before?"
    a "Jack，你刚才是不是梦到……以前那些事了？"

# game/script.rpy:15236
translate chinese nkg_nka_9a6233a4:

    # j "Ack."
    j "呃。"

# game/script.rpy:15237
translate chinese nkg_nka_b65c231e:

    # j "How do you know these things?"
    j "你怎么知道的？"

# game/script.rpy:15242
translate chinese nkg_nka_f01777f3:

    # a "Just a guess."
    a "大概吧。"

# game/script.rpy:15247
translate chinese nkg_nka_ae653329:

    # a "And it looked like you were having a nightmare."
    a "而且看着像在做噩梦。"

# game/script.rpy:15254
translate chinese nkg_nka_ccc14292:

    # g "Does that still bother you?"
    g "那些事还缠着你吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15258
translate chinese nkg_nka_97c59aae:

    # j "...Of course it still bothers me."
    j "……当然还在意。"

# game/script.rpy:15259
translate chinese nkg_nka_55bdf561:

    # j "Everything that happened was my fault, after all."
    j "毕竟发生的一切都是我的错。"

# game/script.rpy:15266
translate chinese nkg_nka_569c62cf:

    # a "Again with that..."
    a "又来了……"

# game/script.rpy:15271
translate chinese nkg_nka_69e20f29:

    # g "Jack... do you think your new friends want to see you blame yourself?"
    g "Jack……你觉得你的新朋友愿意看你自责吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15277
translate chinese nkg_nka_082c3008:

    # g "Do you think we want that? To see you in pain?"
    g "你觉得我们愿意吗？愿意看你痛苦？"

# game/script.rpy:15283
translate chinese nkg_nka_afbae008:

    # g "You should let it go already."
    g "你该放下了。"

# game/script.rpy:15285
translate chinese nkg_nka_ca86bc55:

    # j "No. I can't do that."
    j "不。我做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:15286
translate chinese nkg_nka_c4e3be02:

    # j "Someone's got to take the blame."
    j "总得有人担这个责任。"

# game/script.rpy:15288
translate chinese nkg_nka_0a44478f:

    # "I will not allow a crime that horrible go unpunished."
    "我不能让那么可怕的罪不受惩罚。"

# game/script.rpy:15289
translate chinese nkg_nka_bf9ebd88:

    # "I can't let myself go blameless."
    "我不能让自己毫无过错。"

# game/script.rpy:15290
translate chinese nkg_nka_7c2d4b4e:

    # "So if no one else finds me guilty, I will find myself guilty."
    "所以如果没别人判我有罪，我就自己判自己有罪。"

# game/script.rpy:15291
translate chinese nkg_nka_f0a24687:

    # "The world needs to be fair."
    "这世界得公平。"

# game/script.rpy:15298
translate chinese nkg_nka_70fa2025:

    # a "Then I'm to blame as well."
    a "那我也该负责。"

# game/script.rpy:15303
translate chinese nkg_nka_8ca1fae3:

    # a "I did some disgusting things..."
    a "我做过一些恶心的事……"

# game/script.rpy:15309
translate chinese nkg_nka_eb6acc14:

    # g "Me too."
    g "我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:15315
translate chinese nkg_nka_c438947c:

    # g "If things had gone how I wanted, I would have done something {i}really{/i} bad..."
    g "要是事情照我想要的发展，我会做出{i}非常{/i}坏的事……"

# game/script.rpy:15320
translate chinese nkg_nka_98d9515a:

    # g "So we shouldn't be forgiven, either?"
    g "那我们也就不该被原谅？"

# game/script.rpy:15322
translate chinese nkg_nka_c5ad72fe:

    # j "No, that's different."
    j "不，那不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:15323
translate chinese nkg_nka_d90c8a1c:

    # j "What I did was so much worse."
    j "我做的要糟得多。"

# game/script.rpy:15324
translate chinese nkg_nka_358dc8e5:

    # j "For God's sake, you two. I killed people who were doing their best to help me."
    j "天啊，你们俩。我杀的是尽力想帮我的人。"

# game/script.rpy:15325
translate chinese nkg_nka_17590b4a:

    # j "Your parents, Anna...!"
    j "你的父母啊，Anna……！"

# game/script.rpy:15326
translate chinese nkg_nka_b30e5c4c:

    # j "If I don't feel guilty for that, what should anyone feel guilty for?"
    j "要是我不为这个愧疚，那谁还该为什么愧疚？"

# game/script.rpy:15327
translate chinese nkg_nka_aeff5fc9:

    # j "I did something unforgivable. I deserve much worse than just feeling guilty."
    j "我做了不可原谅的事。我该受的远不止愧疚。"

# game/script.rpy:15339
translate chinese nkg_nka_6790e91c:

    # "Grace and Anna look at each other, worried."
    "Grace 和 Anna 担忧地对视了一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:15341
translate chinese nkg_nka_9770d14c:

    # j "Don't worry... I'm not going to do anything stupid."
    j "别担心……我不会做傻事。"

# game/script.rpy:15342
translate chinese nkg_nka_c786b06b:

    # j "If I thought there was no point in going on—if I thought we were beyond saving—I would've ended it all in that empty building."
    j "要是我觉得活下去没意义——要是我觉得我们已无可救药——我早就在那栋空楼里了结了。"

# game/script.rpy:15348
translate chinese nkg_nka_6d7b4c8d:

    # g "You don't mean that..."
    g "你不是那个意思吧……"

# game/script.rpy:15355
translate chinese nkg_nka_a3d72015:

    # "The pain in my knee has spread upwards. My thigh is cramping."
    "膝盖的疼往上窜。大腿抽起筋来。"

# game/script.rpy:15364
translate chinese nkg_nka_f9547945:

    # "I sit down in the grass."
    "我在草里坐下。"

# game/script.rpy:15374
translate chinese nkg_nka_ace13336:

    # a "Your leg hurts?"
    a "腿疼？"

# game/script.rpy:15376
translate chinese nkg_nka_fcceffc0:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:15381
translate chinese nkg_nka_5b9e57a2:

    # a "Maybe that means it will rain soon."
    a "也许是要下雨了。"

# game/script.rpy:15383
translate chinese nkg_nka_d927aa34:

    # j "Yeah. Maybe that's it."
    j "是啊，也许吧。"

# game/script.rpy:15396
translate chinese nkg_nka_9a2bfd52:

    # g "Can I help?"
    g "我能帮上什么？"

# game/script.rpy:15401
translate chinese nkg_nka_7bba5a73:

    # j "It's fine—it'll pass."
    j "没事，一会儿就好了。"

# game/script.rpy:15415
translate chinese nkg_nka_a2bc8d03:

    # a "You shouldn't be so selfish, Jack."
    a "你不该这么自私，Jack。"

# game/script.rpy:15417
translate chinese nkg_nka_bc892b39:

    # j "What, about my leg?"
    j "什么，我的腿？"

# game/script.rpy:15423
translate chinese nkg_nka_d702cb82:

    # a "You know I'm not talking about that."
    a "你知道我说的不是那个。"

# game/script.rpy:15428
translate chinese nkg_nka_a06a5900:

    # a "You say you can't forgive yourself for what you did... but you're only thinking of yourself."
    a "你说你没法原谅自己做过的事……可你想的只有你自己。"

# game/script.rpy:15430
translate chinese nkg_nka_85f23662:

    # j "I know."
    j "我知道。"

# game/script.rpy:15435
translate chinese nkg_nka_b21c36b1:

    # g "She's right. You're not thinking about how people around you feel."
    g "她说得对。你没想过身边的人是什么感受。"

# game/script.rpy:15437
translate chinese nkg_nka_85f23662_1:

    # j "I know."
    j "我知道。"

# game/script.rpy:15438
translate chinese nkg_nka_b1460c28:

    # j "I know, but... I just can't..."
    j "我知道，但……我就是做不到……"

# game/script.rpy:15439
translate chinese nkg_nka_2d06b682:

    # j "You two... do you not feel bad about what you did? Or tried to do?"
    j "你们两个……就不为做过、或想做的事难受吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15451
translate chinese nkg_nka_d45a8e14:

    # "Their eyes meet again."
    "她们又对看了一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:15457
translate chinese nkg_nka_aa374a81:

    # a "Of course we feel bad."
    a "我们当然也难受。"

# game/script.rpy:15463
translate chinese nkg_nka_5a5469b4:

    # g "Yeah. And I'm not going to lie, there's still plenty of bad feelings between us. How could there not be?"
    g "难受。我不骗你，我们之间还有很多不痛快。怎么可能没有？"

# game/script.rpy:15469
translate chinese nkg_nka_a8ff8516:

    # g "But we both know what we need to do."
    g "但我们都知道该做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:15475
translate chinese nkg_nka_75334ba5:

    # a "We need to move on."
    a "我们得往前走。"

# game/script.rpy:15480
translate chinese nkg_nka_1b0af738:

    # a "Not to forget what happened, but to accept it and keep on living."
    a "不是忘掉发生过的事，是接受它，然后继续活下去。"

# game/script.rpy:15486
translate chinese nkg_nka_ede01d44:

    # a "We haven't managed that yet, but at least we're trying."
    a "我们还没做到，可至少在试。"

# game/script.rpy:15491
translate chinese nkg_nka_cf67e806:

    # g "So please try with us?"
    g "所以，请跟我们一起试试？"

# game/script.rpy:15493
translate chinese nkg_nka_b2fa72d6:

    # "{w=0.25}.{w=0.5}.{w=0.5}."
    "{w=0.25}.{w=0.5}.{w=0.5}."

# game/script.rpy:15494
translate chinese nkg_nka_423b6812:

    # "Can I do that?"
    "我做得到吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15495
translate chinese nkg_nka_d456d778:

    # "Can I make myself throw away this awful weight?"
    "我能让自己把这可怕的负担扔掉吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15499
translate chinese nkg_nka_ac11afcb:

    # j "...I'll try."
    j "……我试试。"

# game/script.rpy:15500
translate chinese nkg_nka_185f508f:

    # j "Okay?"
    j "行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15501
translate chinese nkg_nka_74782698:

    # j "I can't say I'll do it, but I promise I will try."
    j "我不能保证做到，但我答应会试。"

# game/script.rpy:15515
translate chinese nkg_nka_b035f21c:

    # a "Thank you."
    a "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:15521
translate chinese nkg_nka_bc1dca6f:

    # g "That's all we wanted to hear."
    g "我们想听的就是这句话。"

# game/script.rpy:15523
translate chinese nkg_nka_8699a297:

    # j "Now help me get up, will you?"
    j "现在帮我站起来，行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15541
translate chinese nkg_nka_8b107961:

    # g "You know, we were just talking about something, Anna and me. While you were asleep."
    g "你知道吗，刚才你睡着的时候，我和 Anna 在聊一件事。"

# game/script.rpy:15546
translate chinese nkg_nka_7916810c:

    # g "We were saying how to someone just walking by, we would look totally carefree."
    g "我们说，路过的人看我们，一定觉得我们无忧无虑。"

# game/script.rpy:15548
translate chinese nkg_nka_c61c4e72:

    # j "No kidding? I must have heard you in my sleep. I was thinking the same thing."
    j "真的？我大概睡着时听见了。我也在想同一件事。"

# game/script.rpy:15557
translate chinese nkg_nka_ad6d430d:

    # a "It's true. We managed to make it out of that madness without any real scars to show for it."
    a "真的。我们从那场疯狂里出来，身上竟没留下什么真伤疤。"

# game/script.rpy:15563
translate chinese nkg_nka_7e311500:

    # a "Um, I mean, there's your leg, but..."
    a "呃，我是说，你的腿除外，不过……"

# game/script.rpy:15565
translate chinese nkg_nka_375c5240:

    # j "Don't worry. It will heal, too."
    j "别担心。它也会好的。"

# game/script.rpy:15570
translate chinese nkg_nka_886718b3:

    # a "So... if you go by that, there's no reason why our spirits wouldn't heal, either."
    a "所以……这么看的话，我们的心也没理由不愈合。"

# game/script.rpy:15575
translate chinese nkg_nka_dfbebab4:

    # g "Yeah—that's what we were saying."
    g "对——我们就是这么说的。"

# game/script.rpy:15581
translate chinese nkg_nka_6f0fa1e5:

    # g "Don't you think so, too? And don't you think it would be nice?"
    g "你不这么觉得吗？不觉得那样很好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:15583
translate chinese nkg_nka_1dd0e782:

    # j "...Yeah, I see what you mean."
    j "……嗯，我明白你的意思。"

# game/script.rpy:15584
translate chinese nkg_nka_f5020dbc:

    # j "It would be nice."
    j "那会很不错。"

# game/script.rpy:15590
translate chinese nkg_nka_09a4776c:

    # g "It's not the most exciting thing to look forward to, but it really would be nice."
    g "这不算最让人期待的，可真的会很好。"

# game/script.rpy:15592
translate chinese nkg_nka_2b352ef2:

    # j "You know what? Screw excitement. I've had enough of that."
    j "你知道吗？去他的刺激。我受够了。"

# game/script.rpy:15593
translate chinese nkg_nka_0efd2ee0:

    # j "Give me a boring life."
    j "给我一个无聊的人生吧。"

# game/script.rpy:15599
translate chinese nkg_nka_aa90c1e3:

    # "Anna laughs."
    "Anna 笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:15605
translate chinese nkg_nka_d33612b3:

    # a "I feel the same way."
    a "我也这么想。"

# game/script.rpy:15611
translate chinese nkg_nka_84fd3847:

    # a "I'm so much more at peace now, without all that 'excitement.'"
    a "没了那些“刺激”，我现在安宁多了。"

# game/script.rpy:15617
translate chinese nkg_nka_decbdea7:

    # g "Hmmm..."
    g "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:15622
translate chinese nkg_nka_5efbc87f:

    # g "Yeah, I get it, too."
    g "嗯，我也明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:15624
translate chinese nkg_nka_2f8cfb8b:

    # j "Let's go, then."
    j "好。就这么办。"

# game/script.rpy:15637
translate chinese nkg_nka_1e0984ec:

    # "I take the girls by their hands."
    "我牵起她们的手。"

# game/script.rpy:15642
translate chinese nkg_nka_8d4d8664:

    # g "Huh? Where are we going?"
    g "咦？我们去哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:15644
translate chinese nkg_nka_61bb6c3f:

    # j "What do you mean?"
    j "你说呢？"

# game/script.rpy:15645
translate chinese nkg_nka_fc5fcd6e:

    # j "We've got boring, happy lives to look forward to."
    j "我们还有无聊又幸福的日子等着过。"

# game/script.rpy:15651
translate chinese nkg_nka_f90c5805:

    # "I take a few grand steps forward."
    "我豪迈地往前迈了几步。"

# game/script.rpy:15662
translate chinese nkg_nka_f3a633e7:

    # "My leg cramps up again. It sends me tumbling to the ground." with vpunch
    "腿又抽筋了。我一下摔到地上。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:15677
translate chinese nkg_nka_f17e5874:

    # a "Jack!"
    a "Jack！"

# game/script.rpy:15688
translate chinese nkg_nka_7e3ed712:

    # g "Are you all right?! Are you hurt?"
    g "你没事吧？！伤到没有？"

# game/script.rpy:15690
translate chinese nkg_nka_b6452ae8:

    # "Laughter spills out of me."
    "笑声从我身上溢出来。"

# game/script.rpy:15691
translate chinese nkg_nka_8858f700:

    # "I'm not hurt at all. But I had such a dumb fall that I can't help but laugh."
    "我一点没伤着。可我摔得太蠢了，忍不住笑。"

# game/script.rpy:15732
translate chinese nkg_nka_aa2076c8:

    # n "The girls see I'm okay, so they laugh a little, too."
    n "她们看我没大碍，也轻轻笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:15733
translate chinese nkg_nka_da1801d0:

    # n "Seeing them happy warms my heart."
    n "看她们高兴，我心里也暖了。"

# game/script.rpy:15734
translate chinese nkg_nka_2d73806f:

    # n "And at that moment, I've made my decision."
    n "就在那一刻，我做了决定。"

# game/script.rpy:15736
translate chinese nkg_nka_0ab19699:

    # nvl clear
    # n "I told them I would try to stop blaming myself, but I didn't truly mean it."
    nvl clear
    n "我跟她们说我会试着不再自责，可我并不真的这么想。"

# game/script.rpy:15739
translate chinese nkg_nka_0a38082f:

    # n "I mostly said it because they wanted me to say it."
    n "我那么说，多半是因为她们想听。"

# game/script.rpy:15740
translate chinese nkg_nka_988d18f9:

    # n "But now I'm sure."
    n "但现在我确定了。"

# game/script.rpy:15741
translate chinese nkg_nka_fabd6aa7:

    # n "I'll do anything to make them happy."
    n "为了让她们高兴，我什么都愿意做。"

# game/script.rpy:15743
translate chinese nkg_nka_76b2fe88_3:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/script.rpy:15751
translate chinese nkg_nka_0bc14388:

    # n "To make them happy, I'll stop myself from being miserable—if I can."
    n "为了她们高兴，我会不让自己痛苦——如果做得到的话。"

# game/script.rpy:15752
translate chinese nkg_nka_b3517ff4:

    # n "No, I know I can do it."
    n "不——我知道我做得到。"

# game/script.rpy:15753
translate chinese nkg_nka_87abbe70:

    # n "I'll do it for them—I'll shake off this weight."
    n "我为她们做——把这沉重的负担甩掉。"

# game/script.rpy:15754
translate chinese nkg_nka_d0e24c8e:

    # n "And I'll be happy."
    n "然后我就会幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:15756
translate chinese nkg_nka_20077bae:

    # nvl clear
    # n "{w=1}I think I've stumbled upon something incredible."
    nvl clear
    n "{w=1}我想我碰上了什么了不起的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:15759
translate chinese nkg_nka_45d9c0b6:

    # n "I found myself a life worth living."
    n "我为自己找到了一种值得过的人生。"

